<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko" x-data="app()" x-init="init()" :class="{'dark': dark}">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0">
<title>{{ title }}</title>
{% if offline %}
<script defer src="/static/alpine.min.js"></script>
<script src="/static/plotly.min.js"></script>
<link href="/static/tabulator.min.css" rel="stylesheet" id="tab-theme">
<script src="/static/tabulator.min.js"></script>
{% else %}
<script defer src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/alpinejs@3.14.1/dist/cdn.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/plotly.js-dist@2.35.2/plotly.min.js"></script>
<link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/tabulator-tables@6.3.0/dist/css/tabulator_midnight.min.css" rel="stylesheet" id="tab-theme">
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/tabulator-tables@6.3.0/dist/js/tabulator.min.js"></script>
{% endif %}
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#0f1117;--bg2:#1a1d27;--bg3:#22263a;--border:#2d3148;
  --text:#e2e4f0;--text2:#8890b0;--accent:#6c8ef5;
  --green:#4ade80;--yellow:#facc15;--red:#f87171;--orange:#fb923c;--r:10px;
  /* spacing scale */
  --sp-1:4px;--sp-2:8px;--sp-3:12px;--sp-4:16px;--sp-5:24px;--sp-6:32px;
  /* font-size scale */
  --fs-xs:11px;--fs-sm:12px;--fs-md:13px;--fs-lg:15px;--fs-xl:22px;--fs-2xl:28px;
  /* semantic color aliases */
  --c-ok:var(--green);--c-warn:var(--yellow);--c-ng:var(--red);--c-info:var(--accent);
}
html:not(.dark){
  --bg:#f4f6fc;--bg2:#fff;--bg3:#eef0f8;--border:#d1d5e8;
  --text:#1a1d2e;--text2:#5a6080;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{font-family:'Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-size:16px}
.layout{display:grid;grid-template-rows:52px 1fr 28px;height:100vh}
.hdr{background:var(--bg2);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:0 14px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100}
.body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:190px 1fr;overflow:hidden}
.side{background:var(--bg2);border-right:1px solid var(--border);overflow-y:auto;padding:8px 0}
.main{overflow-y:auto;padding:16px}
.sbar{background:var(--bg2);border-top:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:0 14px;font-size:13px;color:var(--text2)}
/* header */
.logo{font-weight:700;font-size:16px;white-space:nowrap}.logo span{color:var(--accent)}
select{background:var(--bg3);color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:3px 7px;font-size:14px;max-width:240px}
.btn{background:var(--bg3);color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:4px 9px;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:none;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px}
.btn:hover,.btn.active{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-color:var(--accent)}
.sp{flex:1}
.dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);display:inline-block}
.dot.off{background:var(--text2)}.dot.live{animation:pulse 1.5s infinite}
@keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.35}}
/* sidebar */
.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:7px 13px;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);border-left:3px solid transparent}
.nav:hover,.nav.on{background:var(--bg3);color:var(--text);border-left-color:var(--accent)}
.nav-badge{margin-left:auto;background:var(--bg);border-radius:99px;font-size:12px;padding:1px 5px;color:var(--text2);cursor:help}
.nav-group{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text2);letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:14px 13px 4px;opacity:.7}
.nav-scope{font-size:10px;font-weight:600;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 4px;letter-spacing:.03em;flex-shrink:0;opacity:.75}
.nav-scope.s-file{background:rgba(99,179,237,.15);color:#63b3ed;border:1px solid rgba(99,179,237,.25)}
.nav-scope.s-global{background:rgba(72,187,120,.15);color:#48bb78;border:1px solid rgba(72,187,120,.25)}
.nav-legend{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:8px 13px 6px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);margin-top:4px}
.nav-legend span{font-size:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;color:var(--text2)}
/* cards */
.kpi-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px}
.kpi-grid.dq-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(180px,1fr))}
.kpi{background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r);padding:12px 14px;transition:border-color .15s,background .15s}
.kpi:hover{border-color:var(--accent)}
.kpi.sel{border-color:var(--accent);background:var(--bg3)}
{# ── kpi-act 체크리스트 ────────────────────────────────────────────
   클릭 시 kpi_detail_panel 상세 패널이 열리는 KPI 카드에만 kpi-act 클래스를 추가한다.
   신규 클릭 가능 KPI 카드 추가 시 아래 4가지를 모두 확인할 것:

   [ ] 1. 부모 div에 x-data="{ selK: null, meta:{}, calcFormula(), filteredItems(), filterLabel(), hlCol() }" 정의
   [ ] 2. KPI 카드에 class="kpi kpi-act" + :class="{sel:selK==='KEY'}" + @click="selK=selK==='KEY'?null:'KEY'" 적용
   [ ] 3. kpi-grid 닫는 </div> 뒤에 {% call kpi_detail_panel(...) %} ... {% endcall %} 블록 추가
   [ ] 4. 다음 차트/섹션 요소에 style="margin-top:16px" 추가 (패널↔차트 구분 여백)

   적용 현황 (2026-03-24 기준, 총 52개):
     품질 기본  — TCR(4) Accuracy(5) Quality(1) Hallucination(4)
     품질 심화  — RAG: Faithfulness/Ans.Relevancy/Ctx.Recall/Ctx.Precision/Overall(5)
     품질 통합  — DeepEval: G-Eval/Hallucination/Toxicity/Bias/Ans.Relevancy(5)
     에이전틱   — Tool Efficiency(6) Tool Selection / Multi-Agent / Workflow / Retry(나머지)
     성능       — Latency(6) Token(4) Cost(3)
     보안       — L1 입력(4) L1 출력(3) L2 권한상승(2)
   ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
.kpi-act{cursor:pointer;border-left:3px solid var(--accent);padding-left:12px}
.kpi-act::after{content:'▾ 상세';display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--accent);text-align:right;margin-top:4px;opacity:.45;transition:opacity .15s}
.kpi-act:hover::after,.kpi-act.sel::after{opacity:1}
.kpi-nav{cursor:pointer}
.kpi-nav::after{content:'↗ 이동';display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--accent);text-align:right;margin-top:4px;opacity:.35;transition:opacity .15s}
.kpi-nav:hover::after{opacity:1}
.kpi-lbl{font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em}
.kpi-val{font-size:28px;font-weight:800;margin:3px 0}
.kpi-sub{font-size:13px}.kpi-sub.ok{color:var(--green)}.kpi-sub.warn{color:var(--yellow)}
.kpi-delta{font-size:12px;margin-top:2px}.kpi-delta.up{color:var(--green)}.kpi-delta.dn{color:var(--red)}.kpi-delta.neu{color:var(--text2)}
/* deploy gate */
.dgate{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.dgate-box{flex:1;min-width:150px;background:var(--bg2);border:2px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r);padding:12px;transition:border-color .15s}
.dgate-box.pass{border-color:var(--green)}.dgate-box.partial{border-color:var(--yellow)}.dgate-box.fail{border-color:var(--red)}
.dgate-title{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
.dgate-badge{font-size:12px;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:99px;font-weight:600}
.dgate-box.pass .dgate-badge{background:#4ade8022;color:var(--green)}.dgate-box.partial .dgate-badge{background:#facc1522;color:var(--yellow)}.dgate-box.fail .dgate-badge{background:#f8717122;color:var(--red)}
.dgate-row{font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;padding:2px 0}
.dgate-row .dv{margin-left:auto;font-size:11px;opacity:.7}
/* sections */
.sec{background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r);padding:14px;margin-bottom:12px}
.sec-t{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.badge{background:var(--bg3);border-radius:4px;font-size:12px;padding:1px 5px;color:var(--text2)}
/* tabs */
.tabs{display:flex;gap:2px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.tab{padding:5px 12px;font-size:14px;cursor:pointer;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;color:var(--text2)}
.tab.on{color:var(--accent);border-bottom-color:var(--accent)}
/* charts */
.cg{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
.cg3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
.cg4{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:10px}
.cg>*,.cg3>*,.cg4>*{min-width:0;overflow:hidden}
.cbox{background:var(--bg3);border-radius:8px;padding:10px;overflow:hidden;min-width:0}
.cbox .js-plotly-plot{height:100%!important}
.plt-chart{min-width:0;width:100%}
.ct{font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:6px}
/* health gauge */
.hr{display:grid;grid-template-columns:160px 1fr;gap:14px;align-items:center}
.gw{position:relative;width:140px;height:140px;margin:0 auto}
.gs{position:absolute;top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);text-align:center}
.gn{font-size:32px;font-weight:800}
.gl{font-size:12px;color:var(--text2)}
.bars{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px}
.brow{font-size:13px}
.blbl{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:2px}
.btrack{background:var(--bg);border-radius:99px;height:5px;overflow:hidden}
.bfill{height:100%;border-radius:99px;transition:width .4s}
/* pills */
.pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;font-size:12px;border-radius:99px;padding:2px 7px;font-weight:600}
.pg{background:rgba(74,222,128,.15);color:var(--green)}
.py{background:rgba(250,204,21,.15);color:var(--yellow)}
.pr{background:rgba(248,113,113,.15);color:var(--red)}
.po{background:rgba(251,146,60,.15);color:var(--orange)}
/* alert cards */
.alert{border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;margin-bottom:8px;border-left:3px solid}
.alert.critical{background:rgba(248,113,113,.1);border-color:var(--red)}
.alert.high{background:rgba(251,146,60,.1);border-color:var(--orange)}
.alert.medium{background:rgba(250,204,21,.1);border-color:var(--yellow)}
.alert.low{background:rgba(74,222,128,.1);border-color:var(--green)}
.alert-t{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:3px}
.alert-b{font-size:13px;color:var(--text2)}
/* rec cards */
.rec{background:var(--bg3);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;margin-bottom:8px}
.rec-t{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px}
.rec-b{font-size:13px;color:var(--text2)}
/* insights accordion */
details.sec{border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;background:var(--bg3);margin-bottom:8px}
details.sec[open]{background:var(--bg2)}
details.sec>summary{outline:none;user-select:none}
details.sec>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
details.sec>summary::marker{display:none}
/* table */
.tw{border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden}
/* detail rows */
.drow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);font-size:14px}
.drow:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.dk{color:var(--text2)}
/* tag */
.tag{display:inline-block;background:var(--bg3);border-radius:4px;font-size:12px;padding:1px 6px;margin:1px;color:var(--text2)}
/* empty */
.empty{text-align:center;padding:40px 20px;color:var(--text2)}
.empty h3{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}
.empty p{font-size:14px}
/* scrollable list */
.slist{max-height:300px;overflow-y:auto}
/* partial success progress bar */
.pscore-bar{height:6px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--bg3);overflow:hidden;min-width:80px}
.pscore-fill{height:100%;border-radius:3px;background:var(--yellow);transition:width .3s}
.pscore-fill.strong{background:#f59e0b}.pscore-fill.weak{background:#fb923c}
/* risk gauge bar */
.rg{margin:10px 0}
.rgt{background:var(--bg3);border-radius:99px;height:14px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:4px}
.rgf{height:100%;border-radius:99px;transition:width .4s}
/* interaction row */
.irow{background:var(--bg3);border-radius:6px;padding:7px 10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:13px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
/* step row */
.step{background:var(--bg3);border-radius:6px;padding:7px 10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:13px}
.step-t{font-weight:600;margin-bottom:2px}
/* transparency scope info bar */
.tr-info{background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r);padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;line-height:1.5}
.tr-info strong{color:var(--text)}
/* trace step */
.trace-step{border-left:2px solid var(--accent);padding:6px 10px;margin-bottom:6px}
.trace-step h4{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--accent)}
.trace-step p{font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:2px}
/* glossary */
.gterm{border-left:3px solid var(--accent);padding:8px 12px;margin-bottom:8px;background:var(--bg3);border-radius:0 6px 6px 0}
.gterm h4{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:3px}
.gterm p{font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.5}
/* compare table */
.cmp-tbl{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px}
.cmp-tbl th,.cmp-tbl td{padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid var(--border);text-align:right}
.cmp-tbl th:first-child,.cmp-tbl td:first-child{text-align:left;color:var(--text2)}
.cmp-tbl thead th{background:var(--bg3);font-weight:600}
/* grade badge */
.grade{display:inline-block;border-radius:4px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 7px;margin-left:6px}
.grade-A{background:rgba(74,222,128,.2);color:var(--green)}
.grade-B{background:rgba(108,142,245,.2);color:var(--accent)}
.grade-C{background:rgba(250,204,21,.2);color:var(--yellow)}
.grade-D{background:rgba(251,146,60,.2);color:var(--orange)}
.grade-F{background:rgba(248,113,113,.2);color:var(--red)}
/* filter bar */
.fbar{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:10px}
.fbar label{font-size:13px;color:var(--text2)}
@media(max-width:768px){
  .body{grid-template-columns:1fr}.side{display:none}
  .cg,.cg3,.cg4{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}
.plt-chart{height:200px}.gw .plt-chart{height:140px!important;width:140px!important}
.modal-backdrop{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.6);z-index:200;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.modal{background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;max-width:700px;width:90%;max-height:85vh;overflow-y:auto}
.modal-t{font-size:16px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
.gd-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr 1fr auto;gap:8px;align-items:center;padding:6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);font-size:14px}
.gd-row:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.gd-input{background:var(--bg3);color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:4px 8px;font-size:14px;width:100%}
textarea.gd-input{height:60px;resize:vertical;font-family:inherit}
@media print{
  .side,.hdr,.sbar,.fbar,.tabs,.btn{display:none!important}
  .layout{display:block;height:auto}
  .body{display:block}
  .main{overflow:visible;padding:0}
  .kpi-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
  .cg,.cg3{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  @page{margin:15mm}
}
/* data tables — 공통화 */
.dt{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;table-layout:fixed}
.dt thead tr{color:var(--text2);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.dt th{padding:6px 8px;font-weight:600}
.dt td{padding:6px 8px}
.dt tbody tr:not(:last-child){border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.dt-card{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}
.dt-card thead tr{background:var(--bg3);color:var(--text2);font-weight:600}
.dt-card th,.dt-card td{padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.dt-card th:first-child,.dt-card td:first-child{text-align:left}
.dt-card th:not(:first-child){text-align:right}
.dt-card td:not(:first-child){text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.dt-grid{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px}
.dt-grid thead tr{background:var(--bg3);color:var(--text2)}
.dt-grid th{padding:7px 10px;border:1px solid var(--border)}
.dt-grid td{padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid var(--border)}
/* ── 하위호환 CSS 별칭 (구 클래스 → 신규 컴포넌트 매핑) ── */
/* .empty → .es */
.empty{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:var(--sp-6);color:var(--text2);text-align:center;gap:var(--sp-2)}
.empty h3{font-size:var(--fs-md);font-weight:600;margin:0}
.empty p{font-size:var(--fs-sm);margin:0}
/* .pill + color → .badge-* */
.badge-ok,.pg{background:rgba(74,222,128,.12);color:var(--green);border-radius:99px;font-size:var(--fs-xs);font-weight:600;padding:1px 7px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:3px}
.badge-warn,.py{background:rgba(250,204,21,.12);color:var(--yellow);border-radius:99px;font-size:var(--fs-xs);font-weight:600;padding:1px 7px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:3px}
.badge-ng,.pr{background:rgba(248,113,113,.12);color:var(--red);border-radius:99px;font-size:var(--fs-xs);font-weight:600;padding:1px 7px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:3px}
.badge-info,.po{background:rgba(108,142,245,.12);color:var(--accent);border-radius:99px;font-size:var(--fs-xs);font-weight:600;padding:1px 7px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:3px}
.badge-gray,.tag{background:var(--bg3);color:var(--text2);border-radius:99px;font-size:var(--fs-xs);padding:1px 7px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;border-radius:4px}
/* .pill base (layout only, color provided by above) */
.pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;font-size:var(--fs-xs);border-radius:99px;padding:2px 7px;font-weight:600}
/* .slist → max-height scroll wrapper */
.slist{max-height:300px;overflow-y:auto}
/* .drow used as flex row (keep existing behavior) */
.drow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);font-size:14px}
.drow:last-child{border-bottom:none}
[x-cloak]{display:none!important}
/* overview section divider */
.ov-divider{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:20px 0 12px;user-select:none}
.ov-divider-label{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text2);white-space:nowrap;letter-spacing:.06em}
.ov-divider-sub{font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);opacity:.6;white-space:nowrap}
.ov-divider-line{flex:1;height:1px;background:var(--border)}
.ov-zone-sep{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:22px 0 18px}
.ov-zone-sep-line{flex:1;height:2px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent)44 0%,transparent 100%)}
.ov-zone-sep-line.r{background:linear-gradient(270deg,var(--accent)44 0%,transparent 100%)}
.ov-zone-sep-badge{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text2);background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:99px;padding:2px 10px;white-space:nowrap;letter-spacing:.04em}
/* ── 프레임워크 공통 컴포넌트 (2026-03-24) ── */
/* dtx: 드릴다운 가능한 데이터 테이블 */
.dtx{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r);overflow:hidden;font-size:var(--fs-sm)}
.dtx-row{display:grid;gap:0 8px;padding:5px var(--sp-3);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);align-items:center}
.dtx-head{font-weight:600;color:var(--text2);background:var(--bg3);font-size:var(--fs-xs);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em}
.dtx-row:not(.dtx-head):hover{background:var(--bg3)}
.dtx-id{font-family:monospace;font-size:var(--fs-xs);color:var(--accent);overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
.dtx-empty{padding:var(--sp-5);text-align:center;color:var(--text2);font-size:var(--fs-sm)}
/* badge 변형 */
.badge-ok{background:rgba(74,222,128,.12);color:var(--green);border-radius:99px;font-size:var(--fs-xs);font-weight:600;padding:1px 7px;display:inline-block}
.badge-warn{background:rgba(250,204,21,.12);color:var(--yellow);border-radius:99px;font-size:var(--fs-xs);font-weight:600;padding:1px 7px;display:inline-block}
.badge-ng{background:rgba(248,113,113,.12);color:var(--red);border-radius:99px;font-size:var(--fs-xs);font-weight:600;padding:1px 7px;display:inline-block}
.badge-info{background:rgba(108,142,245,.12);color:var(--accent);border-radius:99px;font-size:var(--fs-xs);font-weight:600;padding:1px 7px;display:inline-block}
.badge-gray{background:var(--bg3);color:var(--text2);border-radius:99px;font-size:var(--fs-xs);padding:1px 7px;display:inline-block}
/* kpi-info: 정보 전용 KPI (클릭 불가) */
.kpi-info{cursor:default;opacity:.9}
.kpi-info::after{display:none}
/* btn-xs / btn-sm */
.btn-xs{background:transparent;color:var(--accent);border:none;font-size:var(--fs-xs);cursor:pointer;padding:0 4px;text-decoration:underline;white-space:nowrap}
.btn-xs:hover{opacity:.75}
/* empty-state 표준화 */
.es{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:var(--sp-6);color:var(--text2);text-align:center;gap:var(--sp-2)}
.es-icon{font-size:28px}
.es-title{font-size:var(--fs-md);font-weight:600}
.es-desc{font-size:var(--fs-sm)}
.es-desc code{background:var(--bg3);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px;font-size:var(--fs-xs)}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="layout">

<!-- ===== HEADER ===== -->
<header class="hdr">
  <div class="logo">🤖 <span>Agent</span> Evaluator</div>
  <select x-model="selId" @change="loadFile(selId)" style="flex:0 1 260px">
    <option value="">— 파일 선택 —</option>
    <template x-for="f in files" :key="f.id">
      <option :value="f.id" x-text="`${f.name.substring(0,36)}  (${f.total_tasks}t)`"></option>
    </template>
  </select>
  <button class="btn" @click="refresh()" title="새로고침">🔄</button>
  <button class="btn" @click="window.open('/slides'+(selId?'?id='+selId:''),'_blank')">📊 Slides</button>
  <a class="btn" href="/api/docs"  target="_blank" title="UI 개발용 REST API — Swagger UI (OAS 3.1)">📡 UI API</a>
  <a class="btn" href="/sdk-docs" target="_blank" title="Agent 평가용 Python SDK 레퍼런스">📖 SDK</a>
  <div class="sp"></div>
  <span class="dot" :class="{'live':connected,'off':!connected}"></span>
  <span x-text="connected?'Live':'Offline'" style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2)"></span>
  <button class="btn" @click="dark=!dark" x-text="dark?'☀️':'🌙'"></button>
</header>

<!-- ===== BODY ===== -->
<div class="body">

<!-- Sidebar -->
<nav class="side">
  <template x-for="(n,idx) in nav" :key="n.id">
    <div>
      <div x-show="idx===0 || nav[idx-1].group !== n.group" class="nav-group" x-text="n.group"></div>
      <div class="nav" :class="{on:sec===n.id}" @click="sec=n.id; if(n.id==='insights'){ti='diag';recFilter='all';}">
        <span x-text="n.icon"></span>
        <span x-text="n.label" style="flex:1"></span>
        <span class="nav-scope" :class="n.scope==='file'?'s-file':'s-global'" x-text="n.scope==='file'?'파일':'전역'"></span>
        <span class="nav-badge"
          x-show="data && (n.group==='평가 관점' || (n.badge && n.badge(data)))"
          :title="perspScoreDesc(n.id)"
          x-text="data && n.group==='평가 관점' ? perspScore(n.id, data) : (n.badge ? n.badge(data) : '')"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </template>
  <!-- 범례 -->
  <div class="nav-legend">
    <span><i class="nav-scope s-file" style="font-style:normal">파일</i> 선택 파일 기준</span>
    <span><i class="nav-scope s-global" style="font-style:normal">전역</i> 전체 데이터 기준</span>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- Main -->
<main class="main">

<!-- Empty state -->
<div x-show="!data && !loading" class="es">
  <div class="es-icon">📂</div>
  <div class="es-title">결과 파일을 선택하세요</div>
  <div class="es-desc" x-show="files.length===0" style="color:var(--red)">⚠️ 결과 디렉토리에 JSON 파일이 없습니다.</div>
  <div class="es-desc" x-show="files.length>0">상단 드롭다운에서 평가 결과 파일을 선택하세요.</div>
</div>
<div x-show="loading" class="empty es"><p>로딩 중…</p></div>

<!-- ══ OVERVIEW ══ -->
<div x-show="data && sec==='overview'" x-cloak>

  <!-- ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
       상단 — 종합 요약 (한눈에 파악)
  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->

  <!-- ① 관점별 종합 점수 + 레이더 (2:1, 높이 동일) -->
  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-bottom:12px;align-items:stretch">

    <!-- 관점별 종합 점수 카드 -->
    <div class="sec" style="margin-bottom:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px">
        <div class="sec-t" style="margin-bottom:0">🎯 평가 관점별 종합 점수</div>
        <span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2)">— 클릭하면 해당 관점으로 이동</span>
      </div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px;flex:1;align-items:stretch">

        <!-- 품질 -->
        <div class="kpi" style="cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--border);padding:10px 8px;display:flex;flex-direction:column" @click="sec='quality'">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">📊 품질</div>
          <div class="kpi-val" x-text="perspScore('quality',data)"></div>
          <div style="height:4px;background:var(--bg3);border-radius:2px;margin:4px 0">
            <div :style="`width:${perspScore('quality',data)}%;height:100%;border-radius:2px;background:${perspScore('quality',data)>=80?'var(--green)':perspScore('quality',data)>=60?'var(--yellow)':'var(--red)'}`"></div>
          </div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px"
            :style="`color:${perspScore('quality',data)>=90?'var(--green)':perspScore('quality',data)>=70?'var(--yellow)':'var(--red)'}`"
            x-text="perspScore('quality',data)>=90?'EXCELLENT':perspScore('quality',data)>=80?'GOOD':perspScore('quality',data)>=70?'FAIR':'NEEDS WORK'">
          </div>
          <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.6;border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:6px;flex:1">
            <div style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:3px;color:var(--text1);font-size:10.5px">📐 산출 방식</div>
            <div>① <b style="color:var(--text1)">TCR</b> — 완전/부분 성공 태스크 비율</div>
            <div>② <b style="color:var(--text1)">Accuracy</b> — TokenOverlapF1(40%) + Jaccard(30%) + LCS(20%) + CharSim/Levenshtein(10%) 가중 평균</div>
            <div>③ <b style="color:var(--text1)">환각역점수</b> — 100 − 환각율×10<br><span style="opacity:.65;padding-left:10px">환각율이 낮을수록 고점</span></div>
            <div>④ <b style="color:var(--text1)">응답품질</b> — 관련성·완전성·정확성·명확성·유용성 5차원 평균 ×20<br><span :style="data?.has_quality ? 'opacity:.65' : 'opacity:.65;color:var(--yellow)'" x-text="data?.has_quality ? '(포함됨)' : '(미측정 — 제외됨)'"></span></div>
            <div style="margin-top:4px;opacity:.7">→ 측정된 항목의 단순 평균</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 성능 -->
        <div class="kpi" style="cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--border);padding:10px 8px;display:flex;flex-direction:column" @click="sec='performance'">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">⚡ 성능</div>
          <div class="kpi-val"
            :style="(data?.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.p95 != null || data?.total_tasks > 0) ? '' : 'color:var(--text2)'"
            x-text="(data?.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.p95 != null || data?.total_tasks > 0) ? perspScore('performance',data) : 'N/A'"></div>
          <div style="height:4px;background:var(--bg3);border-radius:2px;margin:4px 0">
            <div x-show="data?.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.p95 != null || data?.total_tasks > 0" :style="`width:${perspScore('performance',data)}%;height:100%;border-radius:2px;background:${perspScore('performance',data)>=80?'var(--green)':perspScore('performance',data)>=60?'var(--yellow)':'var(--red)'}`"></div>
          </div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px"
            :style="(data?.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.p95 != null || data?.total_tasks > 0) ? `color:${perspScore('performance',data)>=90?'var(--green)':perspScore('performance',data)>=70?'var(--yellow)':'var(--red)'}` : 'color:var(--text2)'"
            x-text="(data?.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.p95 != null || data?.total_tasks > 0) ? (perspScore('performance',data)>=90?'EXCELLENT':perspScore('performance',data)>=80?'GOOD':perspScore('performance',data)>=70?'FAIR':'NEEDS WORK') : '미측정'">
          </div>
          <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.6;border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:6px;flex:1">
            <div style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:3px;color:var(--text1);font-size:10.5px">📐 산출 방식</div>
            <div><b style="color:var(--text1)">P95 레이턴시</b> 기반 지수 감쇠</div>
            <div style="margin:3px 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;background:var(--bg3);padding:3px 5px;border-radius:3px">100 × e<sup style="font-size:8px">−0.25 × P95(초)</sup></div>
            <div>P95 = 상위 5% 제외 최대 응답시간</div>
            <div style="margin-top:3px">
              <span style="opacity:.8">1s → 78점</span><br>
              <span style="opacity:.8">2s → 61점</span><br>
              <span style="opacity:.8">5s → 29점</span><br>
              <span style="opacity:.8">10s → 8점</span>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:4px;opacity:.7">최저 5점 · 데이터 없을 시 0점</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 에이전틱 -->
        <div class="kpi" style="cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--border);padding:10px 8px;display:flex;flex-direction:column" @click="sec='agentic'">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">🤖 에이전틱</div>
          <div class="kpi-val"
            :style="data?.has_agentic ? '' : 'color:var(--text2)'"
            x-text="data?.has_agentic ? perspScore('agentic',data) : 'N/A'"></div>
          <div style="height:4px;background:var(--bg3);border-radius:2px;margin:4px 0">
            <div x-show="data?.has_agentic" :style="`width:${perspScore('agentic',data)}%;height:100%;border-radius:2px;background:${perspScore('agentic',data)>=80?'var(--green)':perspScore('agentic',data)>=60?'var(--yellow)':'var(--red)'}`"></div>
          </div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px"
            :style="data?.has_agentic ? `color:${perspScore('agentic',data)>=90?'var(--green)':perspScore('agentic',data)>=70?'var(--yellow)':'var(--red)'}` : 'color:var(--text2)'"
            x-text="data?.has_agentic ? (perspScore('agentic',data)>=90?'EXCELLENT':perspScore('agentic',data)>=80?'GOOD':perspScore('agentic',data)>=70?'FAIR':'NEEDS WORK') : '미측정'">
          </div>
          <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.6;border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:6px;flex:1">
            <div style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:3px;color:var(--text1);font-size:10.5px">📐 산출 방식</div>
            <div>① <b style="color:var(--text1)">Tool F1</b> — ToolSelectionTracker의 Precision × Recall 조화 평균</div>
            <div>② <b style="color:var(--text1)">협업성공률</b> — AgentCoordination 상호작용 성공 비율</div>
            <div>③ <b style="color:var(--text1)">워크플로성공률</b> — WorkflowExecution 단계별 성공 비율</div>
            <div>④ <b style="color:var(--text1)">Tool효율</b> — 중복·실패 없는 도구 호출 비율</div>
            <div style="margin-top:4px;opacity:.7">→ 값이 있는 항목만 포함해 단순 평균<br>에이전틱 트래커 미활성화 시 N/A</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 보안 -->
        <div class="kpi" style="cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--border);padding:10px 8px;display:flex;flex-direction:column" @click="sec='security'">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">🔒 보안</div>
          <div class="kpi-val"
            :style="data?.has_security ? '' : 'color:var(--text2)'"
            x-text="data?.has_security ? perspScore('security',data) : 'N/A'"></div>
          <div style="height:4px;background:var(--bg3);border-radius:2px;margin:4px 0">
            <div x-show="data?.has_security" :style="`width:${perspScore('security',data)}%;height:100%;border-radius:2px;background:${perspScore('security',data)>=80?'var(--green)':perspScore('security',data)>=60?'var(--yellow)':'var(--red)'}`"></div>
          </div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px"
            :style="data?.has_security ? `color:${perspScore('security',data)>=90?'var(--green)':perspScore('security',data)>=70?'var(--yellow)':'var(--red)'}` : 'color:var(--text2)'"
            x-text="data?.has_security ? (perspScore('security',data)>=90?'EXCELLENT':perspScore('security',data)>=80?'GOOD':perspScore('security',data)>=70?'FAIR':'NEEDS WORK') : '미측정'">
          </div>
          <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.6;border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:6px;flex:1">
            <div style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:3px;color:var(--text1);font-size:10.5px">📐 산출 방식</div>
            <div>① <b style="color:var(--text1)">입력보안</b> — 100 − 입력위협율<br><span style="opacity:.65;padding-left:10px">InputSanitizationTracker</span></div>
            <div>② <b style="color:var(--text1)">출력보안</b> — 100 − 출력유출율<br><span style="opacity:.65;padding-left:10px">OutputLeakageDetector</span></div>
            <div>③ <b style="color:var(--text1)">권한준수율</b> — 인가된 도구 호출 비율<br><span style="opacity:.65;padding-left:10px">ToolAuthorizationTracker</span></div>
            <div style="margin-top:4px;opacity:.7">→ 3개 항목 단순 평균<br>보안 트래커 미활성화 시 N/A</div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 관점별 레이더 -->
    <div class="sec" style="margin-bottom:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:stretch">
      <div class="sec-t" style="text-align:center">🕸️ 관점별 레이더</div>
      <div style="flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:220px">
        <div id="ov-radar" style="width:100%;height:260px"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- ② Health Score + KPI 핵심 수치 (1:3) -->
  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 3fr;gap:12px;margin-bottom:12px;align-items:stretch">

    <!-- Health Score 게이지 -->
    <div class="sec" style="margin-bottom:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center">
      <div class="sec-t">🏥 시스템 Health Score</div>
      <div class="hr" style="grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px">
        <div class="gw" style="margin:0 auto">
          <div id="gauge-c" style="width:140px;height:140px"></div>
          <div class="gs" style="display:none"><div class="gn" x-text="hs()"></div><div class="gl" x-text="hl()"></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="bars" style="width:100%">
          <div class="brow"><div class="blbl"><span>품질</span><span x-text="pct(l1s())"></span></div><div class="btrack"><div class="bfill" :style="`width:${l1s()}%;background:var(--accent)`"></div></div></div>
          <div class="brow"><div class="blbl"><span>에이전틱</span><span x-text="data?.has_agentic ? pct(l2s()) : 'N/A'"></span></div><div class="btrack"><div class="bfill" :style="`width:${l2s()}%;background:${bc(l2s())}`"></div></div></div>
          <div class="brow"><div class="blbl"><span>성능</span><span x-text="pct(ps())"></span></div><div class="btrack"><div class="bfill" :style="`width:${ps()}%;background:${bc(ps())}`"></div></div></div>
          <div class="brow"><div class="blbl"><span>보안</span><span x-text="data?.has_security ? pct(ss()) : 'N/A'"></span></div><div class="btrack"><div class="bfill" :style="`width:${ss()}%;background:${bc(ss())}`"></div></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- KPI 핵심 수치 -->
    <div class="sec" style="margin-bottom:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column">
      <div class="sec-t">📋 핵심 지표</div>
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:11px;color:var(--text2)">
        <span>📌 핵심 지표 요약</span>
        <span style="opacity:.5">— 카드 클릭 시 해당 세션으로 이동</span>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi-grid" style="margin-top:0">
        <div class="kpi kpi-nav" @click="sec='quality';tq='basic';t1='tcr'" title="클릭 → 품질 탭으로 이동" style="cursor:pointer">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">Task Completion</div>
          <div class="kpi-val" x-text="pct(tcr())"></div>
          <div class="kpi-sub" :class="tc(tcr(),thresholds.tcr)"><span x-text="tlbl(tcr(),thresholds.tcr)"></span></div>
          <div class="kpi-delta" x-show="prevFile()" :class="(deltaFmt(tcr(), prevFile()?.tcr, true)||{}).cls||'neu'" x-text="(deltaFmt(tcr(), prevFile()?.tcr, true)||{txt:''}).txt + (prevFile()?' vs 이전':'')"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-nav" @click="sec='quality';tq='basic';t1='acc'" title="클릭 → 품질 탭으로 이동" style="cursor:pointer">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">Accuracy</div>
          <div class="kpi-val" x-text="pct(acc())"></div>
          <div class="kpi-sub" :class="tc(acc(),thresholds.acc)"><span x-text="tlbl(acc(),thresholds.acc)"></span></div>
          <div class="kpi-delta" x-show="prevFile()" :class="(deltaFmt(acc(), prevFile()?.accuracy, true)||{}).cls||'neu'" x-text="(deltaFmt(acc(), prevFile()?.accuracy, true)||{txt:''}).txt + (prevFile()?' vs 이전':'')"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-nav" @click="sec='quality';tq='basic';t1='hall'" title="클릭 → 품질 탭으로 이동" style="cursor:pointer">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">Hallucination</div>
          <div class="kpi-val" :style="hr_col(hall())" x-text="pct(hall())"></div>
          <div class="kpi-sub" x-text="hr_lbl(hall())"></div>
          <div class="kpi-delta" x-show="prevFile()" :class="(deltaFmt(hall(), prevFile()?.hallucination, false)||{}).cls||'neu'" x-text="(deltaFmt(hall(), prevFile()?.hallucination, false)||{txt:''}).txt + (prevFile()?' vs 이전':'')"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-nav" @click="sec='performance';tperf='basic';tp='lat'" title="클릭 → 성능 탭으로 이동" style="cursor:pointer">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">Avg Latency</div>
          <div class="kpi-val" x-text="sec_(lat_mean())"></div>
          <div class="kpi-sub" :class="lat_cl(data.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.p95)">P95: <span x-text="sec_(data.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.p95)"></span></div>
          <div class="kpi-delta" x-show="prevFile()" :class="(deltaFmt(lat_mean(), prevFile()?.avg_latency, false, 's')||{}).cls||'neu'" x-text="(deltaFmt(lat_mean(), prevFile()?.avg_latency, false, 's')||{txt:''}).txt + (prevFile()?' vs 이전':'')"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-nav" @click="sec='performance';tperf='advanced';tp='cost'" title="클릭 → 성능 탭으로 이동" style="cursor:pointer">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">Total Cost</div>
          <div class="kpi-val" x-text="cost(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.total_cost)"></div>
          <div class="kpi-sub" style="color:var(--text2)">Task당: <span x-text="cost(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.avg_cost_per_task)"></span></div>
          <div class="kpi-delta" x-show="prevFile()" :class="(deltaFmt(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.total_cost, prevFile()?.total_cost, false, '$')||{}).cls||'neu'" x-text="(deltaFmt(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.total_cost, prevFile()?.total_cost, false, '$')||{txt:''}).txt + (prevFile()?' vs 이전':'')"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">Total Tasks</div>
          <div class="kpi-val" x-text="data.total_tasks"></div>
          <div class="kpi-sub" style="color:var(--text2)" x-text="data.name?.substring(0,22)"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- 상단 종합 요약 → 하단 세부 분석 경계 -->
  <div class="ov-zone-sep">
    <div class="ov-zone-sep-line"></div>
    <div class="ov-zone-sep-badge">▼ 세부 분석</div>
    <div class="ov-zone-sep-line r"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- ③ 배포 준비도 구분선 -->
  <div class="ov-divider">
    <span class="ov-divider-label">🛡️ 배포 준비도</span>
    <span class="ov-divider-sub">— 환경별 배포 가능 기준 충족 여부</span>
    <div class="ov-divider-line"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- Deployment Readiness Gate -->
  <div class="dgate">
    <template x-for="g in deployGates()" :key="g.key">
      <div class="dgate-box" :class="g.cls">
        <div class="dgate-title">
          <span x-text="g.label"></span>
          <span class="dgate-badge" x-text="g.cls==='pass'?'PASS':g.cls==='fail'?'FAIL':`${g.passed}/${g.total}`"></span>
        </div>
        <template x-for="c in g.criteria" :key="c.name">
          <div class="dgate-row">
            <span x-text="c.pass?'✅':'❌'"></span>
            <span x-text="c.name"></span>
            <span class="dv" x-text="c.val"></span>
          </div>
        </template>
      </div>
    </template>
  </div>

  <!-- 📐 벤치마크 비교 -->
  <div class="sec" x-show="data" style="margin-bottom:12px">
    <div class="sec-t">📐 벤치마크 비교</div>
    <table class="dt">
      <colgroup>
        <col style="width:auto">
        <col style="width:100px">
        <col style="width:120px">
        <col style="width:140px">
      </colgroup>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th style="text-align:left">지표</th>
          <th style="text-align:right">내 값</th>
          <th style="text-align:center">목표 값</th>
          <th style="text-align:left">판정</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>TCR</td>
          <td style="text-align:right" x-text="tcr().toFixed(1)+'%'"></td>
          <td style="text-align:center;color:var(--accent);font-weight:600" x-text="thresholds.tcr+'%'"></td>
          <td style="text-align:left" :style="tcr()>=thresholds.tcr?'color:var(--green)':'color:var(--orange)'" x-text="tcr()>=thresholds.tcr?'✅ 목표 달성':'⚠️ 목표 미달'"></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Accuracy</td>
          <td style="text-align:right" x-text="acc().toFixed(1)+'%'"></td>
          <td style="text-align:center;color:var(--accent);font-weight:600" x-text="thresholds.acc+'%'"></td>
          <td style="text-align:left" :style="acc()>=thresholds.acc?'color:var(--green)':'color:var(--orange)'" x-text="acc()>=thresholds.acc?'✅ 목표 달성':'⚠️ 목표 미달'"></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Hallucination</td>
          <td style="text-align:right" x-text="hall().toFixed(1)+'%'"></td>
          <td style="text-align:center;color:var(--accent);font-weight:600" x-text="thresholds.hall+'%'"></td>
          <td style="text-align:left" :style="hall()<=thresholds.hall?'color:var(--green)':'color:var(--orange)'" x-text="hall()<=thresholds.hall?'✅ 목표 달성':'⚠️ 목표 미달'"></td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <div style="margin-top:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text2)">
      ⚙️ 목표 값은 <a href="#" @click.prevent="sec='settings'" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none">Settings</a>에서 변경·저장할 수 있습니다.
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ④ 태스크 분포 구분선 -->
  <div class="ov-divider" x-show="data?.tasks?.length>0">
    <span class="ov-divider-label">📊 태스크 분포</span>
    <span class="ov-divider-sub">— 성공/실패 현황 및 TaskType별 구성</span>
    <div class="ov-divider-line"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- 분포 차트 -->
  <div x-show="!(data?.tasks?.length>0)" class="empty" style="padding:14px;text-align:left;border-left:3px solid var(--border)">
    <p>📊 태스크 데이터 없음 — 평가 결과 파일에 태스크가 포함되어 있지 않습니다.</p>
  </div>
  <div x-show="data?.tasks?.length>0" class="cg">
    <div class="cbox"><div class="ct">성공/실패 분포</div><div id="ov-donut" class="plt-chart"></div></div>
    <div class="cbox"><div class="ct">TaskType별 Task 수</div><div id="ov-type" class="plt-chart"></div></div>
  </div>

  <!-- ⑤ 평가 트렌드 구분선 -->
  <div class="ov-divider">
    <span class="ov-divider-label">📈 평가 트렌드</span>
    <span class="ov-divider-sub">— 시간 경과에 따른 지표 변화</span>
    <div class="ov-divider-line"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- 평가 트렌드 -->
  <div x-show="files.length < 2" class="empty" style="padding:14px;text-align:left;border-left:3px solid var(--border)">
    <p>2개 이상의 평가 파일이 필요합니다 (현재 <span x-text="files.length"></span>개 로드됨)</p>
  </div>
  <div x-show="files.length >= 2" class="sec">
    <div id="ov-trend" style="height:220px"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- ⚠️ 품질 지표 회귀 -->
  <div class="sec" x-show="data">
    <div class="sec-t">⚠️ 품질 지표 회귀</div>

    <!-- Case 1: 이전 파일 없음 -->
    <div x-show="!prevFile()" class="empty" style="padding:20px 0">
      <div style="font-size:28px;margin-bottom:8px">📂</div>
      <p style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px">비교할 이전 평가 파일이 없습니다</p>
      <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2)" x-text="files.length < 2 ? '평가 결과가 '+files.length+'개 로드됨 — 2개 이상일 때 회귀를 감지합니다.' : '가장 오래된 파일은 비교 기준이 없습니다.'"></p>
    </div>

    <!-- Case 2/3: 이전 파일 있음 -->
    <div x-show="prevFile()">
      <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:10px" x-text="'📄 비교 기준: ' + (prevFile()?.name || '')"></div>
      <template x-for="r in regressionItems().filter(r=>['TCR','Accuracy','Hallucination','Response Quality'].includes(r.label))" :key="r.key">
        <div class="alert" :class="r.severity">
          <div class="alert-t" x-text="r.label+': '+r.prev.toFixed(1)+r.unit+' → '+r.curr.toFixed(1)+r.unit+' '+r.delta"></div>
        </div>
      </template>
      <div x-show="regressionItems().filter(r=>['TCR','Accuracy','Hallucination','Response Quality'].includes(r.label)).length===0">
        <div class="empty" style="padding:16px 0">
          <div style="font-size:24px;margin-bottom:6px">✅</div>
          <p style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px">모든 품질 지표 회귀 없음</p>
        </div>
        <table class="dt-card">
          <colgroup><col style="width:auto"><col style="width:80px"><col style="width:80px"><col style="width:72px"></colgroup>
          <thead><tr><th>지표</th><th>이전</th><th>현재</th><th>변화</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <template x-for="it in [
              {label:'TCR',             curr:tcr(),                                  prev:prevFile()?.tcr||0,           unit:'%', invert:false},
              {label:'Accuracy',        curr:acc(),                                  prev:prevFile()?.accuracy||0,      unit:'%', invert:false},
              {label:'Hallucination',   curr:hall(),                                 prev:prevFile()?.hallucination||0, unit:'%', invert:true },
              {label:'Response Quality',curr:(data.quality_detail?.avg_score||0)*20, prev:prevFile()?.quality_avg||0,   unit:'%', invert:false},
            ]" :key="it.label">
              <tr>
                <td x-text="it.label"></td>
                <td x-text="it.prev.toFixed(1)+it.unit"></td>
                <td x-text="it.curr.toFixed(1)+it.unit"></td>
                <td :style="(()=>{const d=it.invert?it.prev-it.curr:it.curr-it.prev;return d>0.05?'color:var(--green)':d<-0.05?'color:var(--orange)':'color:var(--text2)'})()"
                  x-text="(()=>{const d=it.invert?it.prev-it.curr:it.curr-it.prev;const s=d>0.05?'▲':d<-0.05?'▼':'─';return s+' '+Math.abs(d).toFixed(1)+it.unit})()"></td>
              </tr>
            </template>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ⑥ 알림 구분선 -->
  <div class="ov-divider" x-show="data.insights?.alerts?.length>0">
    <span class="ov-divider-label">🚨 주요 알림</span>
    <span class="ov-divider-sub" x-text="`— ${data.insights?.alerts?.length}건의 임계값 초과 지표`"></span>
    <div class="ov-divider-line"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- Alerts 요약 -->
  <div x-show="data.insights?.alerts?.length>0">
    <template x-for="a in (data.insights?.alerts||[]).slice(0,3)" :key="a.metric">
      <div class="alert" :class="a.severity">
        <div class="alert-t" x-text="`[${a.severity.toUpperCase()}] ${a.metric}`"></div>
        <div class="alert-b" x-text="a.message"></div>
      </div>
    </template>
    <button class="btn" x-show="data.insights?.alerts?.length>3" @click="sec='insights'" style="margin-top:8px">전체 보기 →</button>
  </div>

  <!-- ⑦ Harness 구분선 -->
  <div class="ov-divider" x-show="data.has_harness">
    <span class="ov-divider-label">🧪 Harness 평가 (A–G)</span>
    <span class="ov-divider-sub">— 에이전트 품질 7개 그룹 종합 점수</span>
    <div class="ov-divider-line"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- Harness 그룹 요약 -->
  <div x-show="data.has_harness" class="sec" style="margin-bottom:12px">
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:10px">
      <div class="sec-t" style="margin-bottom:0">Harness 평가 요약</div>
      <span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:99px"
        :style="`background:${(data.harness_groups?.overall?.gate||'')=='pass'?'rgba(74,222,128,.15)':(data.harness_groups?.overall?.gate||'')=='warn'?'rgba(250,204,21,.15)':'rgba(248,113,113,.15)'};color:${(data.harness_groups?.overall?.gate||'')=='pass'?'var(--green)':(data.harness_groups?.overall?.gate||'')=='warn'?'var(--yellow)':'var(--red)'}`"
        x-text="data.harness_groups?.overall ? ((data.harness_groups.overall.score*100).toFixed(1)+'%  '+(data.harness_groups.overall.gate||'').toUpperCase()) : ''"></span>
    </div>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:6px">
      <template x-for="gkey in ['A','B','C','D','E','F','G']" :key="gkey">
        <div style="border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--border);padding:8px 6px;text-align:center;background:var(--bg2)"
          :style="`border-color:${(data.harness_groups?.[gkey]?.gate||'n/a')==='pass'?'var(--green)':(data.harness_groups?.[gkey]?.gate||'n/a')==='warn'?'var(--yellow)':(data.harness_groups?.[gkey]?.gate||'n/a')==='fail'?'var(--red)':'var(--border)'}`">
          <div style="font-size:16px;font-weight:700;line-height:1"
            :style="`color:${(data.harness_groups?.[gkey]?.gate||'n/a')==='pass'?'var(--green)':(data.harness_groups?.[gkey]?.gate||'n/a')==='warn'?'var(--yellow)':(data.harness_groups?.[gkey]?.gate||'n/a')==='fail'?'var(--red)':'var(--text2)'}`"
            x-text="gkey"></div>
          <div style="font-size:9px;color:var(--text2);margin:3px 0;line-height:1.3;min-height:24px"
            x-text="data.harness_groups?.[gkey]?.name || ''"></div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:600"
            :style="`color:${(data.harness_groups?.[gkey]?.gate||'n/a')==='pass'?'var(--green)':(data.harness_groups?.[gkey]?.gate||'n/a')==='warn'?'var(--yellow)':(data.harness_groups?.[gkey]?.gate||'n/a')==='fail'?'var(--red)':'var(--text2)'}`"
            x-text="data.harness_groups?.[gkey]?.score != null ? (data.harness_groups[gkey].score*100).toFixed(1)+'%' : 'N/A'"></div>
          <div style="font-size:9px;margin-top:2px;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600"
            :style="`color:${(data.harness_groups?.[gkey]?.gate||'n/a')==='pass'?'var(--green)':(data.harness_groups?.[gkey]?.gate||'n/a')==='warn'?'var(--yellow)':(data.harness_groups?.[gkey]?.gate||'n/a')==='fail'?'var(--red)':'var(--text2)'}`"
            x-text="data.harness_groups?.[gkey]?.gate || 'n/a'"></div>
        </div>
      </template>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

{# ── empty_state macro ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
   사용: {% call empty_state("!condition_expr", "enable_flag=True", "섹션명") %}{% endcall %}
   또는 조건 없이: {% macro empty_state(flag_expr, code_hint, label) %}
   ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
{% macro empty_state(flag_expr, code_hint, label='데이터') %}
<div x-show="{{ flag_expr }}" class="es">
  <div class="es-icon">📭</div>
  <div class="es-title">{{ label }} 데이터 없음</div>
  <div class="es-desc"><code>{{ code_hint }}</code>으로 활성화하세요.</div>
</div>
{% endmacro %}

{# ── chart_box macro ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   사용: {% call chart_box("차트 제목", "chart-id", 200, "보조 설명") %}{% endcall %}
   ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
{% macro chart_box(title, chart_id, height=200, desc='') %}
<div class="cbox">
  <div class="ct">{{ title }}{% if desc %} <span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);font-weight:400">— {{ desc }}</span>{% endif %}</div>
  <div id="{{ chart_id }}" class="plt-chart" style="height:{{ height }}px"></div>
</div>
{% endmacro %}

{% macro kpi_detail_panel(value_expr, data_expr, items_label='관련 항목') %}
<div x-show="selK"
     x-transition:enter="transition ease-out duration-150"
     x-transition:enter-start="opacity-0 transform -translate-y-1"
     x-transition:enter-end="opacity-100 transform translate-y-0"
     style="margin-top:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--accent);overflow:hidden">
  <template x-if="selK">
    <div>
      <!-- 헤더 -->
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:12px 16px;background:var(--bg2);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)">
        <span style="font-weight:700;font-size:14px" x-text="meta[selK]?.label||selK"></span>
        <span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);background:var(--bg3);padding:1px 7px;border-radius:99px"
              x-text="meta[selK]?.unit?'단위: '+meta[selK].unit:''"></span>
        <span style="margin-left:auto;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)"
              x-text="{{ value_expr }}"></span>
      </div>
      <!-- 설명 + 산출 방식 -->
      <div style="padding:12px 16px;background:var(--bg2);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)">
        <div>
          <div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:4px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em">설명</div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.7" x-text="meta[selK]?.hint||meta[selK]?.desc||''"></div>
        </div>
        <div style="background:var(--bg3);border-radius:6px;padding:10px 12px">
          <div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:6px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em">📐 산출 방식</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;font-family:monospace;color:var(--accent);line-height:1.8;white-space:pre-line"
               x-text="calcFormula(selK, {{ data_expr }})"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- 관련 항목 -->
      <div style="padding:12px 16px;background:var(--bg)">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:8px">
          <span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text2);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em">{{ items_label }}</span>
          <span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);background:var(--bg3);padding:1px 7px;border-radius:99px"
                x-text="filterLabel(selK)"></span>
          <span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);margin-left:auto"
                x-text="filteredItems(selK, {{ data_expr }}).length+'건'"></span>
        </div>
        <div style="font-size:12px">
          {{ caller() }}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </template>
</div>
{% endmacro %}

<!-- ══ 품질 (Quality) ══ -->
<div x-show="data && sec==='quality'" x-cloak>

  <!-- 티어 탭 헤더 -->
  <div class="tabs">
    <div class="tab" :class="{on:tq==='basic'}"      @click="tq='basic'">🔵 기본</div>
    <div class="tab" :class="{on:tq==='advanced'}"   @click="tq='advanced'">🟡 RAG <span style="font-size:11px;opacity:.7">(Ragas)</span></div>
    <div class="tab" :class="{on:tq==='integrated'}" @click="tq='integrated'">🟣 외부 라이브러리 <span style="font-size:11px;opacity:.7">(DeepEval)</span></div>
    <span style="margin-left:auto;font-size:14px;color:var(--text2)">
      품질 Score: <b x-text="perspScore('quality',data)"></b>/100
    </span>
  </div>

  <!-- 티어 설명 배너 -->
  <div class="sec" style="padding:8px 12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);border-left:3px solid var(--accent)">
    <span x-show="tq==='basic'">🔵 기본 — 외부 의존성 없이 즉시 측정. TCR·Accuracy·품질·환각 지표.</span>
    <span x-show="tq==='advanced'">🟡 RAG (Ragas 기반) — RAG 컨텍스트 데이터가 있을 때 활성화. Faithfulness·Context 지표.</span>
    <span x-show="tq==='integrated'">🟣 외부 라이브러리 (DeepEval 기반) — LLM-as-judge 범용 품질 평가. G-Eval·Toxicity·Bias·AnswerRelevancy·Hallucination.</span>
  </div>

  <!-- ── 기본 티어 ── -->
  <div x-show="tq==='basic'">
    <!-- 품질 종합 게이지 -->
    <div class="sec">
      <div class="sec-t">📊 품질 종합</div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px">
        <div class="cbox">
          <div class="ct">TCR</div>
          <div class="cv" x-text="pct(tcr())"></div>
          <div style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text2)">가중치 30%</div>
        </div>
        <div class="cbox">
          <div class="ct">Accuracy</div>
          <div class="cv" x-text="pct(acc())"></div>
          <div style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text2)">가중치 30%</div>
        </div>
        <div class="cbox">
          <div class="ct">Response Quality</div>
          <div class="cv" x-text="(data.quality_detail?.avg_score||0).toFixed(1)+'/5'"></div>
          <div style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text2)">가중치 25%</div>
        </div>
        <div class="cbox">
          <div class="ct">Hallucination</div>
          <div class="cv" x-text="pct(hall())"></div>
          <div style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text2)">가중치 15%</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 기존 Layer 1 서브탭: TCR/Accuracy/Quality/Hallucination -->
    <div class="tabs" style="margin-top:4px">
      <div class="tab" :class="{on:t1==='tcr'}"   @click="t1='tcr'">📋 TCR</div>
      <div class="tab" :class="{on:t1==='acc'}"   @click="t1='acc'">🎯 Accuracy</div>
      <div class="tab" :class="{on:t1==='qual'}"  @click="t1='qual'">⭐ Quality</div>
      <div class="tab" :class="{on:t1==='hall'}"  @click="t1='hall'">🧠 Hallucination</div>
    </div>

    <!-- TCR -->
    <div x-show="t1==='tcr'" x-data="{
      selK: null,
      meta: {
        tcr:            {label:'TCR', unit:'%', desc:'완전·부분 성공을 가중 합산한 태스크 완료율', hint:'Σ completion_score / 전체 태스크 수 × 100 (score 0~1 직접 합산)'},
        full_success:   {label:'완전 성공', unit:'건', desc:'completion_score ≥ 1.0 인 태스크 수', hint:'completion_score ≥ 1.0'},
        partial_success:{label:'부분 성공', unit:'건', desc:'0.7 ≤ completion_score < 1.0 인 태스크 수', hint:'0.7 ≤ completion_score < 1.0'},
        failures:       {label:'실패', unit:'건', desc:'completion_score < 0.7 인 태스크 수', hint:'completion_score < 0.7 (완전 실패 포함)'},
      },
      calcFormula(k, data) {
        const tasks = data.tasks||[];
        const tot = tasks.length||1;
        const fs = tasks.filter(t=>t.completion_score>=1.0).length;
        const ps = tasks.filter(t=>t.completion_score>=0.7&&t.completion_score<1.0).length;
        const fl = tasks.filter(t=>t.completion_score<0.7).length;
        const weighted = tasks.reduce((s,t)=>s+(t.completion_score||0),0);
        if(k==='tcr') return `TCR = Σ completion_score / 전체\n= ${weighted.toFixed(2)} / ${tot}\n= ${(weighted/tot*100).toFixed(1)}%`;
        if(k==='full_success') return `완전 성공 = score ≥ 1.0\n${fs}건 / ${tot}건 = ${(fs/tot*100).toFixed(1)}%`;
        if(k==='partial_success') return `부분 성공 = 0.7 ≤ score < 1.0\n${ps}건 / ${tot}건 = ${(ps/tot*100).toFixed(1)}%`;
        if(k==='failures') return `실패 = score < 0.7\n${fl}건 / ${tot}건 = ${(fl/tot*100).toFixed(1)}%`;
        return '';
      },
      filteredItems(k, data) {
        const tasks = data.tasks||[];
        if(k==='full_success') return tasks.filter(t=>t.completion_score>=1.0);
        if(k==='partial_success') return tasks.filter(t=>t.completion_score>=0.7&&t.completion_score<1.0);
        if(k==='failures') return tasks.filter(t=>t.completion_score<0.7);
        return tasks;
      },
      filterLabel(k) {
        if(k==='full_success') return 'score≥1.0';
        if(k==='partial_success') return '0.7≤score<1.0';
        if(k==='failures') return 'score<0.7';
        return '전체 태스크';
      },
      hlCol(k) { return ''; }
    }">
      <div class="kpi-grid">
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='tcr'}" @click="selK=selK==='tcr'?null:'tcr'" style="cursor:pointer"><div class="kpi-lbl">TCR</div><div class="kpi-val"><span x-text="pct(tcr())"></span><span class="grade" :class="`grade-${benchGrade(tcr()).letter}`" x-text="benchGrade(tcr()).letter"></span></div></div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='full_success'}" @click="selK=selK==='full_success'?null:'full_success'" style="cursor:pointer"><div class="kpi-lbl">완전 성공</div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="data.accuracy_metrics?.tcr?.full_success??'-'"></div></div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='partial_success'}" @click="selK=selK==='partial_success'?null:'partial_success'" style="cursor:pointer"><div class="kpi-lbl">부분 성공</div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="data.accuracy_metrics?.tcr?.partial_success??'-'"></div></div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='failures'}" @click="selK=selK==='failures'?null:'failures'" style="cursor:pointer"><div class="kpi-lbl">실패</div><div class="kpi-val" style="color:var(--red)" x-text="data.accuracy_metrics?.tcr?.failures??'-'"></div></div>
      </div>
      {% call kpi_detail_panel("{tcr:pct(tcr()),full_success:String(data.accuracy_metrics?.tcr?.full_success??'-'),partial_success:String(data.accuracy_metrics?.tcr?.partial_success??'-'),failures:String(data.accuracy_metrics?.tcr?.failures??'-')}[selK]||''", "data", "관련 태스크") %}
      <div class="dtx" style="max-height:240px;overflow-y:auto">
        <div class="dtx-row dtx-head" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 80px 80px 50px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1">
          <span>태스크 ID</span><span style="text-align:center">유형</span><span style="text-align:center">완료율</span><span style="text-align:center">시도</span>
        </div>
        <template x-for="t in filteredItems(selK, data)" :key="t.task_id">
          <div class="dtx-row" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 80px 80px 50px">
            <span class="dtx-id" x-text="t.task_id"></span>
            <span style="text-align:center;color:var(--text2)" x-text="t.task_type||'-'"></span>
            <span style="text-align:center;font-weight:600" :style="t.completion_score>=1?'color:var(--green)':t.completion_score>0?'color:var(--yellow)':'color:var(--red)'" x-text="pct(t.completion_score*100)"></span>
            <span style="text-align:center;color:var(--text2)" x-text="(t.attempts||1)+'회'"></span>
          </div>
        </template>
      </div>
      {% endcall %}
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 2fr;gap:12px;margin-top:16px">
        <div class="cbox"><div class="ct">성공/실패 비율</div><div id="q-l1-donut" class="plt-chart"></div></div>
        <div class="cbox" style="overflow:visible"><div class="ct">TaskType별 성공률</div><div id="q-l1-type" class="plt-chart"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="cbox" style="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:12px">
        <div class="ct">실패 원인 분류</div>
        <div id="q-l1-fail-reason" class="plt-chart"></div>
        <div x-show="!(data.accuracy_metrics?.tcr?.failures>0)" style="text-align:center;padding:16px;color:var(--text2);font-size:13px">실패 태스크 없음 ✅</div>
      </div>
      <div class="sec" x-show="typeBreakdown().length>0">
        <div class="sec-t">TaskType별 상세</div>
        <div class="dtx">
          <div class="dtx-row dtx-head" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 64px 72px">
            <span>유형</span><span style="text-align:right">건수</span><span style="text-align:right">성공률</span>
          </div>
          <template x-for="tp in typeBreakdown()" :key="tp.type">
            <div class="dtx-row" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 64px 72px">
              <span class="dtx-id" x-text="tp.type"></span>
              <span x-text="`${tp.n}건`" style="color:var(--text2);text-align:right"></span>
              <span style="text-align:right" :style="`color:${tp.rate>=thresholds.tcr?'var(--green)':tp.rate>=(thresholds.tcr-15)?'var(--yellow)':'var(--red)'}`" x-text="pct(tp.rate)"></span>
            </div>
          </template>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 부분 성공 태스크 상세 -->
      <div class="sec" x-show="partialTasks().length>0" style="margin-top:16px">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:10px">
          <span class="sec-t" style="margin:0">🟡 부분 성공 태스크</span>
          <span class="badge" x-text="partialTasks().length+'건'"></span>
          <span x-show="partialRetryCount()>0" style="font-size:12px;color:var(--orange)">⚠️ 재시도 후 미달 <span x-text="partialRetryCount()+'건'"></span></span>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:12px">
          <span style="background:rgba(251,146,60,.15);color:#fb923c;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 8px">🟠 약한(70~84%): <b x-text="partialTasks().filter(t=>t.completion_score<0.85).length+'건'"></b></span>
          <span style="background:rgba(234,179,8,.15);color:#ca8a04;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 8px">🟡 강한(85~99%): <b x-text="partialTasks().filter(t=>t.completion_score>=0.85).length+'건'"></b></span>
        </div>
        <div class="dtx" style="max-height:320px;overflow-y:auto">
          <div class="dtx-row dtx-head" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 90px 80px 44px 44px 44px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1">
            <span>태스크 ID</span><span style="text-align:center">유형</span><span style="text-align:center">완료율</span><span style="text-align:center">시도</span><span style="text-align:center">정확도</span><span></span>
          </div>
          <template x-for="t in partialTasks()" :key="t.task_id">
            <div style="padding:6px var(--sp-3);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)">
              <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 90px 80px 44px 44px 44px;gap:0 8px;align-items:center">
                <span class="dtx-id" x-text="t.task_id"></span>
                <span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);text-align:center" x-text="t.task_type"></span>
                <div class="pscore-bar"><div class="pscore-fill" :class="t.completion_score>=0.85?'strong':'weak'" :style="`width:${(t.completion_score*100).toFixed(0)}%`"></div></div>
                <span style="font-size:11px;text-align:center" :style="(t.attempts||1)>1?'color:var(--orange);font-weight:600':'color:var(--text2)'" x-text="(t.attempts||1)+'회'"></span>
                <span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);text-align:center" x-text="t.accuracy_score>0?pct(t.accuracy_score*100):'—'"></span>
                <button class="btn" style="font-size:11px;padding:2px 6px;min-width:44px" @click="taskDetail=t">상세</button>
              </div>
              <div style="margin-top:5px;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:12px" :style="(t.errors||[]).length>0?'background:rgba(248,113,113,.08);color:var(--red)':'background:var(--bg3);color:var(--text2)'" x-text="'🔍 '+diagnosisMsg(t)"></div>
            </div>
          </template>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text2)">completion_score 오름차순 정렬 · [상세] 클릭 시 전체 정보 확인</div>
      </div>

      <!-- 실패 태스크 상세 -->
      <div class="sec" x-show="failedTasks().length>0" style="margin-top:16px">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:10px">
          <span class="sec-t" style="margin:0;color:var(--red)">❌ 실패 태스크</span>
          <span class="badge" style="background:rgba(248,113,113,.15);color:var(--red)" x-text="failedTasks().length+'건'"></span>
          <span x-show="failRetryCount()>0" style="font-size:12px;color:var(--orange)">⚠️ 재시도 후 실패 <span x-text="failRetryCount()+'건'"></span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="dtx" style="max-height:320px;overflow-y:auto">
          <div class="dtx-row dtx-head" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 90px 80px 44px 44px 44px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1">
            <span>태스크 ID</span><span style="text-align:center">유형</span><span style="text-align:center">완료율</span><span style="text-align:center">시도</span><span style="text-align:center">정확도</span><span></span>
          </div>
          <template x-for="t in failedTasks()" :key="t.task_id">
            <div style="padding:6px var(--sp-3);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)">
              <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 90px 80px 44px 44px 44px;gap:0 8px;align-items:center">
                <span class="dtx-id" x-text="t.task_id"></span>
                <span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);text-align:center" x-text="t.task_type"></span>
                <div class="pscore-bar"><div class="pscore-fill" style="background:var(--red)" :style="`width:${Math.max(2,(t.completion_score*100)).toFixed(0)}%`"></div></div>
                <span style="font-size:11px;text-align:center" :style="(t.attempts||1)>1?'color:var(--orange);font-weight:600':'color:var(--text2)'" x-text="(t.attempts||1)+'회'"></span>
                <span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);text-align:center" x-text="t.accuracy_score>0?pct(t.accuracy_score*100):'—'"></span>
                <button class="btn" style="font-size:11px;padding:2px 6px;min-width:44px" @click="taskDetail=t">상세</button>
              </div>
              <div style="margin-top:5px;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:12px" :style="(t.errors||[]).length>0?'background:rgba(248,113,113,.08);color:var(--red)':'background:var(--bg3);color:var(--text2)'" x-text="'🔍 '+diagnosisMsg(t)"></div>
            </div>
          </template>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text2)">completion_score 오름차순 정렬 · [상세] 클릭 시 전체 정보 확인</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Accuracy -->
    <div x-show="t1==='acc'" x-data="{
      selK: null,
      meta: {
        overall_acc:{label:'전체 Accuracy', unit:'%', desc:'ground_truth 기반 가중 평균 정확도', hint:'TokenOverlapF1(40%) · Jaccard(30%) · LCS(20%) · CharSim/Levenshtein(10%) 가중 평균'},
        median_acc: {label:'Median', unit:'%', desc:'정확도 점수 중앙값', hint:'정확도 분포의 중간값 — 평균보다 이상값 영향이 적음'},
        min_acc:    {label:'Min', unit:'%', desc:'최저 정확도 점수', hint:'가장 낮은 정확도 태스크 기준'},
        max_acc:    {label:'Max', unit:'%', desc:'최고 정확도 점수', hint:'가장 높은 정확도 태스크 기준'},
        std_acc:    {label:'Std Dev', unit:'%', desc:'정확도 표준 편차', hint:'낮을수록 일관된 성능. 높을수록 태스크별 편차 큼'},
      },
      calcFormula(k, data) {
        const sc = data.accuracy_metrics?.accuracy_scores||{};
        const all = data.tasks||[];
        const n = all.filter(t=>t.accuracy_score>0).length;
        if(k==='overall_acc') return `가중 평균 = TokenOverlapF1(40%) + Jaccard(30%)\n+ LCS Ratio(20%) + CharSim/Levenshtein(10%)\n= ${(sc.overall_accuracy||0).toFixed(1)}% (전체 ${all.length}건)`;
        if(k==='median_acc') return `중앙값 = 정렬 후 중앙 값\n= ${(sc.median_accuracy||0).toFixed(1)}% (평가 ${n}건)`;
        if(k==='min_acc')    return `최솟값 = ${(sc.min_accuracy||0).toFixed(1)}% (평가 ${n}건 중)`;
        if(k==='max_acc')    return `최댓값 = ${(sc.max_accuracy||0).toFixed(1)}% (평가 ${n}건 중)`;
        if(k==='std_acc')    return `표준편차 = √분산\n= ${(sc.std_accuracy||0).toFixed(1)}%`;
        return '';
      },
      filteredItems(k, data) {
        const all = data.tasks||[];
        const withScore = all.filter(t=>t.accuracy_score>0);
        if(k==='overall_acc') return [...all].sort((a,b)=>a.accuracy_score-b.accuracy_score);
        if(k==='median_acc') { const med=(data.accuracy_metrics?.accuracy_scores?.median_accuracy||0)/100; return [...withScore].sort((a,b)=>Math.abs(a.accuracy_score-med)-Math.abs(b.accuracy_score-med)).slice(0,15); }
        if(k==='min_acc') return [...withScore].sort((a,b)=>a.accuracy_score-b.accuracy_score).slice(0,15);
        if(k==='max_acc') return [...withScore].sort((a,b)=>b.accuracy_score-a.accuracy_score).slice(0,15);
        if(k==='std_acc') { const m=(data.accuracy_metrics?.accuracy_scores?.overall_accuracy||0)/100; return [...withScore].sort((a,b)=>Math.abs(b.accuracy_score-m)-Math.abs(a.accuracy_score-m)); }
        return withScore;
      },
      filterLabel(k) {
        if(k==='overall_acc') return '전체 태스크 (점수 낮은 순)';
        if(k==='median_acc') return '중앙값 근접 순 (Top 15)';
        if(k==='min_acc') return '낮은 정확도 순 (Top 15)';
        if(k==='max_acc') return '높은 정확도 순 (Top 15)';
        if(k==='std_acc') return '평균 편차 큰 순';
        return 'accuracy_score>0';
      },
      hlCol(k) { return ''; }
    }">
      <div class="kpi-grid">
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='overall_acc'}" @click="selK=selK==='overall_acc'?null:'overall_acc'" style="cursor:pointer"><div class="kpi-lbl">전체 Accuracy</div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="pct(acc())"></div></div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='median_acc'}" @click="selK=selK==='median_acc'?null:'median_acc'" style="cursor:pointer"><div class="kpi-lbl">Median</div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="pct(data.accuracy_metrics?.accuracy_scores?.median_accuracy)"></div></div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='min_acc'}" @click="selK=selK==='min_acc'?null:'min_acc'" style="cursor:pointer"><div class="kpi-lbl">Min</div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="pct(data.accuracy_metrics?.accuracy_scores?.min_accuracy)"></div></div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='max_acc'}" @click="selK=selK==='max_acc'?null:'max_acc'" style="cursor:pointer"><div class="kpi-lbl">Max</div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="pct(data.accuracy_metrics?.accuracy_scores?.max_accuracy)"></div></div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='std_acc'}" @click="selK=selK==='std_acc'?null:'std_acc'" style="cursor:pointer"><div class="kpi-lbl">Std Dev</div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="pct(data.accuracy_metrics?.accuracy_scores?.std_accuracy)"></div></div>
      </div>
      {% call kpi_detail_panel("{overall_acc:pct(acc()),median_acc:pct(data.accuracy_metrics?.accuracy_scores?.median_accuracy),min_acc:pct(data.accuracy_metrics?.accuracy_scores?.min_accuracy),max_acc:pct(data.accuracy_metrics?.accuracy_scores?.max_accuracy),std_acc:pct(data.accuracy_metrics?.accuracy_scores?.std_accuracy)}[selK]||''", "data", "관련 태스크") %}
      <div class="dtx" style="max-height:240px;overflow-y:auto">
        <div class="dtx-row dtx-head" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 80px 80px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1">
          <span>태스크 ID</span><span style="text-align:center">유형</span><span style="text-align:center">정확도</span>
        </div>
        <template x-for="t in filteredItems(selK, data)" :key="t.task_id">
          <div class="dtx-row" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 80px 80px">
            <span class="dtx-id" x-text="t.task_id"></span>
            <span style="text-align:center;color:var(--text2)" x-text="t.task_type||'-'"></span>
            <span style="text-align:center;font-weight:600" :style="t.accuracy_score>=0.8?'color:var(--green)':t.accuracy_score>=0.5?'color:var(--yellow)':'color:var(--red)'" x-text="pct(t.accuracy_score*100)"></span>
          </div>
        </template>
      </div>
      {% endcall %}
      <div x-show="!(data.accuracy_metrics?.accuracy_scores?.overall_accuracy>0)" style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);padding:10px 0;margin-top:16px">
        정확도 차트 데이터 없음 — 태스크에 <code>ground_truth</code>를 설정하세요.
      </div>
      <div x-show="data.accuracy_metrics?.accuracy_scores?.overall_accuracy>0" style="margin-top:16px">
        <div class="sec">
          <div class="sec-t">📐 정확도 계산 방식</div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:8px">TokenOverlapF1(40%) · Jaccard(30%) · LCS Ratio(20%) · CharSim/Levenshtein(10%) 가중 평균</div>
          <div id="q-acc-weights" style="height:80px"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="sec">
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:6px">
            <div class="sec-t" style="margin-bottom:0">TaskType별 정확도 분포</div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;font-size:11px;color:var(--text2)">
              <span><span style="display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#4ade80;margin-right:3px;vertical-align:middle"></span>성공</span>
              <span><span style="display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#f87171;margin-right:3px;vertical-align:middle"></span>실패</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="q-acc-hist" class="plt-chart"></div>
          <div x-show="!(data.tasks||[]).some(t=>t.accuracy_score>0)" class="empty" style="padding:16px 0">
            <p>정확도 분포 데이터 없음 — 태스크에 <code>ground_truth</code>를 설정하세요.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sec" x-show="lowAccTasks().length>0">
        <div class="sec-t">낮은 정확도 태스크 <span class="badge" x-text="`< ${thresholds.acc}% : ${lowAccTasks().length}건`"></span></div>
        <div class="dtx" style="max-height:300px;overflow-y:auto">
          <div class="dtx-row dtx-head" style="grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr 1fr 50px">
            <span>태스크 ID</span><span style="text-align:center">유형</span><span style="text-align:right">정확도</span><span style="text-align:right">시도</span>
          </div>
          <template x-for="t in lowAccTasks()" :key="t.task_id">
            <div class="dtx-row" style="grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr 1fr 50px">
              <span class="dtx-id" x-text="t.task_id"></span>
              <span style="text-align:center;color:var(--text2)" x-text="t.task_type"></span>
              <span style="text-align:right;color:var(--red)" x-text="pct(t.accuracy_score*100)"></span>
              <span style="text-align:right;color:var(--text2)" x-text="`${t.attempts}회`"></span>
            </div>
          </template>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Quality -->
    <div x-show="t1==='qual'" x-data="{
      selK: null,
      meta: {
        avg_score: {label:'평균 품질 점수', unit:'/5', desc:'5개 차원(relevance·completeness·accuracy·clarity·usefulness) 가중 평균', hint:'각 차원 0~5 점수를 가중 합산 (relevance 25%·completeness 25%·accuracy 20%·clarity 15%·usefulness 15%)'},
        min_score:  {label:'Min', unit:'/5', desc:'최저 품질 점수', hint:'가장 낮은 total_score 태스크'},
        max_score:  {label:'Max', unit:'/5', desc:'최고 품질 점수', hint:'가장 높은 total_score 태스크'},
        std_score:  {label:'Std Dev', unit:'/5', desc:'품질 점수 표준 편차', hint:'낮을수록 일관된 품질. 높을수록 태스크별 편차 큼'},
        grade_A: {label:'등급 A', unit:'건', desc:'품질 점수 4.5~5.0 (최상위)', hint:'total_score ≥ 4.5'},
        grade_B: {label:'등급 B', unit:'건', desc:'품질 점수 4.0~4.4', hint:'4.0 ≤ total_score < 4.5'},
        grade_C: {label:'등급 C', unit:'건', desc:'품질 점수 3.0~3.9', hint:'3.0 ≤ total_score < 4.0'},
        grade_D: {label:'등급 D', unit:'건', desc:'품질 점수 2.0~2.9', hint:'2.0 ≤ total_score < 3.0'},
        grade_F: {label:'등급 F', unit:'건', desc:'품질 점수 2.0 미만', hint:'total_score < 2.0'},
      },
      qualStats(data) {
        const evals = data.quality_detail?.evaluations||[];
        if(!evals.length) return {min:0, max:0, std:0};
        const sc = evals.map(e=>e.total_score||0);
        const mn = Math.min(...sc), mx = Math.max(...sc);
        const avg = sc.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0)/sc.length;
        const std = Math.sqrt(sc.map(s=>(s-avg)**2).reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0)/sc.length);
        return {min:+mn.toFixed(2), max:+mx.toFixed(2), std:+std.toFixed(2)};
      },
      kpiVal(k, data) {
        const st = this.qualStats(data);
        if(k==='avg_score') return (data.quality_detail?.avg_score||0).toFixed(2)+'/5';
        if(k==='min_score')  return st.min+'/5';
        if(k==='max_score')  return st.max+'/5';
        if(k==='std_score')  return st.std+'/5';
        if(k?.startsWith('grade_')) return ((data.quality_detail?.grade_distribution||{})[k.slice(6)]||0)+'건';
        return '';
      },
      calcFormula(k, data) {
        const evals = data.quality_detail?.evaluations||[];
        const n = evals.length||1;
        const avg = data.quality_detail?.avg_score||0;
        const st = this.qualStats(data);
        if(k==='avg_score') return `평균 = 전체 평가 점수 합 / 평가 건수\n= ${(avg*n).toFixed(2)} / ${n}\n= ${avg.toFixed(2)}/5`;
        if(k==='min_score')  return `최솟값 = ${st.min}/5 (${n}건 중)`;
        if(k==='max_score')  return `최댓값 = ${st.max}/5 (${n}건 중)`;
        if(k==='std_score')  return `표준편차 = √(Σ(xi−μ)²/n)\n= ${st.std}/5`;
        if(k?.startsWith('grade_')) { const g=k.slice(6); const cnt=(data.quality_detail?.grade_distribution||{})[g]||0; return `등급 ${g} = ${cnt}건 / ${n}건 = ${(cnt/n*100).toFixed(1)}%`; }
        return '';
      },
      filteredItems(k, data) {
        const evals = data.quality_detail?.evaluations||[];
        if(k==='min_score') return [...evals].sort((a,b)=>(a.total_score||0)-(b.total_score||0)).slice(0,10);
        if(k==='max_score') return [...evals].sort((a,b)=>(b.total_score||0)-(a.total_score||0)).slice(0,10);
        if(k==='std_score') { const avg=data.quality_detail?.avg_score||0; return [...evals].sort((a,b)=>Math.abs((b.total_score||0)-avg)-Math.abs((a.total_score||0)-avg)); }
        if(k?.startsWith('grade_')) { const g=k.slice(6); return evals.filter(e=>e.grade===g); }
        return [...evals].sort((a,b)=>(a.total_score||0)-(b.total_score||0));
      },
      filterLabel(k) {
        if(k==='min_score') return '낮은 점수 순 (Top 10)';
        if(k==='max_score') return '높은 점수 순 (Top 10)';
        if(k==='std_score') return '평균 편차 큰 순';
        if(k?.startsWith('grade_')) return `등급 ${k.slice(6)} 필터`;
        return '낮은 점수 순';
      },
      hlCol(k) { return ''; }
    }">
      <div x-show="!data.has_quality" class="empty es"><p>품질 평가 데이터 없음 — QualityEvaluator를 활성화하세요.</p></div>
      <div x-show="data.has_quality">
        <div class="kpi-grid">
          <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='avg_score'}" @click="selK=selK==='avg_score'?null:'avg_score'" style="cursor:pointer"><div class="kpi-lbl">평균 품질 점수</div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="(data.quality_detail?.avg_score||0).toFixed(2)+'/5'"></div></div>
          <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='min_score'}" @click="selK=selK==='min_score'?null:'min_score'" style="cursor:pointer"><div class="kpi-lbl">Min</div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="qualStats(data).min+'/5'"></div></div>
          <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='max_score'}" @click="selK=selK==='max_score'?null:'max_score'" style="cursor:pointer"><div class="kpi-lbl">Max</div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="qualStats(data).max+'/5'"></div></div>
          <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='std_score'}" @click="selK=selK==='std_score'?null:'std_score'" style="cursor:pointer"><div class="kpi-lbl">Std Dev</div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="qualStats(data).std+'/5'"></div></div>
          <template x-for="[g,n] in Object.entries(data.quality_detail?.grade_distribution||{}).sort((a,b)=>['A','B','C','D','F'].indexOf(a[0])-['A','B','C','D','F'].indexOf(b[0]))" :key="g">
            <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='grade_'+g}" @click="selK=selK===('grade_'+g)?null:'grade_'+g" style="cursor:pointer"><div class="kpi-lbl">등급 <span x-text="g"></span></div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="n"></div></div>
          </template>
        </div>
        {% call kpi_detail_panel("kpiVal(selK, data)", "data", "품질 평가 항목") %}
        <div class="dtx" style="max-height:260px;overflow-y:auto">
          <div class="dtx-row dtx-head" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 50px 40px 42px 42px 42px 42px 42px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1">
            <span>태스크 ID</span><span style="text-align:center">점수</span><span style="text-align:center">등급</span>
            <span style="text-align:center" title="Relevance (관련성 25%)">rel</span>
            <span style="text-align:center" title="Completeness (완성도 25%)">com</span>
            <span style="text-align:center" title="Accuracy (정확도 20%)">acc</span>
            <span style="text-align:center" title="Clarity (명확성 15%)">cla</span>
            <span style="text-align:center" title="Usefulness (유용성 15%)">use</span>
          </div>
          <template x-for="ev in filteredItems(selK, data)" :key="ev.task_id||ev.id">
            <div class="dtx-row" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 50px 40px 42px 42px 42px 42px 42px">
              <span class="dtx-id" x-text="ev.task_id||ev.id||'-'"></span>
              <span style="text-align:center;font-weight:600" :style="`color:${bc((ev.total_score||0)*20)}`" x-text="(ev.total_score||0).toFixed(2)"></span>
              <span style="text-align:center;color:var(--text2)" x-text="ev.grade||'-'"></span>
              <span style="text-align:center;font-size:11px;color:var(--text2)" x-text="(ev.dimension_scores?.relevance||0).toFixed(1)"></span>
              <span style="text-align:center;font-size:11px;color:var(--text2)" x-text="(ev.dimension_scores?.completeness||0).toFixed(1)"></span>
              <span style="text-align:center;font-size:11px;color:var(--text2)" x-text="(ev.dimension_scores?.accuracy||0).toFixed(1)"></span>
              <span style="text-align:center;font-size:11px;color:var(--text2)" x-text="(ev.dimension_scores?.clarity||0).toFixed(1)"></span>
              <span style="text-align:center;font-size:11px;color:var(--text2)" x-text="(ev.dimension_scores?.usefulness||0).toFixed(1)"></span>
            </div>
          </template>
          <div x-show="filteredItems(selK, data).length===0" style="text-align:center;padding:16px;color:var(--text2)">평가 데이터 없음</div>
        </div>
        <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text2);padding:4px 0 0">rel·com·acc·cla·use = 각 차원 점수 (0~5), 가중치: rel·com 25% · acc 20% · cla·use 15%</div>
        {% endcall %}
        <div class="cg" style="margin-top:16px">
          <div class="cbox"><div class="ct">품질 레이더 (5차원)</div><div id="q-qual-radar" class="plt-chart"></div></div>
          <div class="cbox">
            <div class="ct">차원별 평균 점수</div>
            <template x-for="[dim,val] in Object.entries(data.quality_detail?.dimension_summary||{})" :key="dim">
              <div class="brow" style="margin-bottom:10px">
                <div class="blbl"><span x-text="dim"></span><span x-text="val.toFixed(2)+'/5'"></span></div>
                <div class="btrack"><div class="bfill" :style="`width:${val*20}%;background:${bc(val*20)}`"></div></div>
                <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:2px" x-text="{'relevance':'질문과 응답의 관련성 — 키워드 중복도 기반 (가중치 25%)','completeness':'예상 요소 포함 여부 — expected_elements 매칭 기반 (가중치 25%)','accuracy':'정답과의 일치도 — ground_truth 유사도 기반 (가중치 20%)','clarity':'응답 명확성 — 길이·구조(줄바꿈·마침표) 기반 (가중치 15%)','usefulness':'실용적 가치 — 예시·구조·수치 포함 여부 기반 (가중치 15%)'}[dim]||dim"></div>
              </div>
            </template>
            <div x-show="Object.keys(data.quality_detail?.dimension_summary||{}).length>0 && new Set(Object.values(data.quality_detail?.dimension_summary||{})).size===1" style="margin-top:8px;font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:6px">
              ℹ️ G-Eval 단일 점수 기반 — 차원별 구분 없음
            </div>
            <div x-show="Object.keys(data.quality_detail?.dimension_summary||{}).length>0 && new Set(Object.values(data.quality_detail?.dimension_summary||{})).size>1" style="margin-top:8px;font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:6px">
              ℹ️ ResponseQualityEvaluator 기반 — relevance·completeness·clarity·accuracy·usefulness 개별 측정
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="sec" style="margin-top:20px" x-show="data.quality_detail?.dimension_summary && Object.keys(data.quality_detail?.dimension_summary||{}).length>0">
          <div class="sec-t">🗺️ TaskType × 품질 차원 히트맵</div>
          <div id="q-qual-heatmap" style="height:220px"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Hallucination -->
    <div x-show="t1==='hall'" x-data="{
      selK: null,
      meta: {
        hall_rate:          {label:'환각 발생률', unit:'%', desc:'평가 태스크 중 환각이 1건 이상 감지된 비율', hint:'감지 태스크 수 / 평가 태스크 수 × 100'},
        total_evaluated:    {label:'평가 건수', unit:'건', desc:'환각 탐지 평가가 수행된 총 태스크 수', hint:'HallucinationDetector가 분석한 태스크 수 (hallucination_rate가 저장된 건)'},
        total_flagged:      {label:'감지 건수', unit:'건', desc:'환각이 1건 이상 감지된 태스크 수', hint:'hallucination_rate > 0인 태스크 (빈 응답 포함)'},
        unsupported_claims: {label:'미지원 주장', unit:'건 (태스크)', desc:'unsupported_claim이 감지된 태스크 수', hint:'응답 문장의 컨텍스트 단어 중복도 < 30%인 문장이 있는 태스크 수 (indicator 개수 아님)'},
      },
      hallUnsupportedTasks(data) {
        return (data.hallucination_detail?.detections||[]).filter(d=>(d.indicators||[]).some(i=>i.type==='unsupported_claim')).length;
      },
      calcFormula(k, data) {
        const ev  = data.accuracy_metrics?.hallucination||{};
        const tot     = ev.total_evaluated??0;
        const flagged = ev.total_flagged??0;
        const rate    = ev.overall_rate??0;
        const dets    = data.hallucination_detail?.detections||[];
        const ust     = dets.filter(d=>(d.indicators||[]).some(i=>i.type==='unsupported_claim')).length;
        if(k==='hall_rate')          return `환각 발생률 = 감지 태스크 / 평가 태스크 × 100\n= ${flagged}건 / ${tot}건 × 100\n= ${tot>0?(flagged/tot*100).toFixed(1):0}%`;
        if(k==='total_evaluated')    { const dd=this.dedupDets(dets).length; return `평가 건수 = HallucinationDetector 분석 고유 태스크\n= ${dd}건 (중복 제거 후)`; }
        if(k==='total_flagged')      return `감지 건수 = 환각이 감지된 태스크\n= ${flagged}건 / ${tot}건 = ${tot>0?(flagged/tot*100).toFixed(1):0}%\n(환각 발생률과 동일 기준)`;
        if(k==='unsupported_claims') return `미지원 주장 감지 태스크\n= 컨텍스트 중복도 < 30% 문장 보유\n= ${ust}건 / ${tot}건 = ${tot>0?(ust/tot*100).toFixed(1):0}%`;
        return '';
      },
      dedupDets(dets) {
        // Keep one entry per task_id — prefer highest hallucination_rate
        const map = new Map();
        for(const d of dets) {
          const tid = d.task_id||'__unknown__';
          if(!map.has(tid)||(d.hallucination_rate||0)>(map.get(tid).hallucination_rate||0)) map.set(tid, d);
        }
        return [...map.values()];
      },
      filteredItems(k, data) {
        const dets = this.dedupDets(data.hallucination_detail?.detections||[]);
        if(k==='hall_rate')          return [...dets.filter(d=>(d.hallucination_rate||0)>0)].sort((a,b)=>(b.hallucination_rate||0)-(a.hallucination_rate||0));
        if(k==='total_evaluated')    return [...dets].sort((a,b)=>(b.hallucination_rate||0)-(a.hallucination_rate||0));
        if(k==='total_flagged')      return [...dets.filter(d=>(d.hallucination_rate||0)>0)].sort((a,b)=>(b.hallucination_rate||0)-(a.hallucination_rate||0));
        if(k==='unsupported_claims') return dets.filter(d=>(d.indicators||[]).some(i=>i.type==='unsupported_claim'));
        return [...dets].sort((a,b)=>(b.hallucination_rate||0)-(a.hallucination_rate||0));
      },
      filterLabel(k) {
        if(k==='hall_rate')          return '환각률 높은 순';
        if(k==='total_flagged')      return '환각률>0 (높은 순)';
        if(k==='unsupported_claims') return '미지원 주장 포함 태스크';
        return '전체 평가 탐지 (환각률 높은 순)';
      },
      hlCol(k) { return ''; }
    }">
      <div class="kpi-grid">
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='hall_rate'}" @click="selK=selK==='hall_rate'?null:'hall_rate'" style="cursor:pointer"><div class="kpi-lbl">환각 발생률</div><div class="kpi-val" :style="hr_col(hall())" x-text="pct(hall())"></div></div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='total_evaluated'}" @click="selK=selK==='total_evaluated'?null:'total_evaluated'" style="cursor:pointer"><div class="kpi-lbl">평가 건수</div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="dedupDets(data.hallucination_detail?.detections||[]).length"></div></div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='total_flagged'}" @click="selK=selK==='total_flagged'?null:'total_flagged'" style="cursor:pointer"><div class="kpi-lbl">감지 건수</div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="data.accuracy_metrics?.hallucination?.total_flagged??0"></div></div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='unsupported_claims'}" @click="selK=selK==='unsupported_claims'?null:'unsupported_claims'" style="cursor:pointer"><div class="kpi-lbl">미지원 주장</div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="hallUnsupportedTasks(data)"></div></div>
      </div>
      {% call kpi_detail_panel("{hall_rate:pct(hall()),total_evaluated:String(dedupDets(data.hallucination_detail?.detections||[]).length),total_flagged:String(data.accuracy_metrics?.hallucination?.total_flagged??0),unsupported_claims:hallUnsupportedTasks(data)+'건'}[selK]||''", "data", "탐지 항목") %}
      <div class="dtx" style="max-height:260px;overflow-y:auto">
        <div class="dtx-row dtx-head" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 58px 50px 60px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1">
          <span>태스크 ID</span>
          <span style="text-align:center">환각률</span>
          <span style="text-align:center">상태</span>
          <span style="text-align:center">지표 수</span>
        </div>
        <template x-for="(hdet, _hi) in filteredItems(selK, data)" :key="_hi">
          <div class="dtx-row" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 58px 50px 60px">
            <span class="dtx-id" x-text="hdet.task_id||'-'"></span>
            <span style="text-align:center;font-weight:600" :style="(hdet.hallucination_rate||0)>0.3?'color:var(--red)':(hdet.hallucination_rate||0)>0?'color:var(--yellow)':'color:var(--green)'" x-text="((hdet.hallucination_rate||0)*100).toFixed(0)+'%'"></span>
            <span style="text-align:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:600" :style="(hdet.hallucination_rate||0)>0?'color:var(--red)':'color:var(--green)'" x-text="(hdet.hallucination_rate||0)>0?'감지':'정상'"></span>
            <span style="text-align:center;color:var(--text2)" x-text="(hdet.indicators||[]).length+'개'"></span>
          </div>
        </template>
        <div x-show="filteredItems(selK, data).length===0" style="text-align:center;padding:16px;color:var(--text2)">탐지 데이터 없음</div>
      </div>
      <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text2);padding:4px 0 0">카드 환각 발생률 = 감지 태스크/평가 태스크 × 100 | 테이블 환각률 컬럼 = 해당 태스크 내 환각 의심 문장 수/전체 문장 수</div>
      {% endcall %}
      <div class="sec" style="margin-top:16px">
        <div class="sec-t">환각 위험 수준</div>
        <div class="rg">
          <div class="rgt" style="position:relative">
            <div class="rgf" :style="`width:${Math.min(100,hall())}%;background:${hr_col2(hall())}`"></div>
            <div style="position:absolute;top:0;left:30%;width:2px;height:100%;background:#f97316;border-radius:0"></div>
          </div>
          <div style="position:relative;height:18px;font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:3px">
            <span style="position:absolute;left:0">0%</span>
            <span style="position:absolute;left:30%;transform:translateX(-50%);color:#f97316;white-space:nowrap">⚠ 임계치 30%</span>
            <span style="position:absolute;right:0">100%</span>
          </div>
          <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:2px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600" :style="`color:${hr_col2(hall())}`" x-text="pct(hall())+' 현재 · '+hr_lbl(hall())"></div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:8px;font-size:11px;color:var(--text2)">
          ℹ️ SAFE ≤ <span x-text="thresholds.hall+'%'"></span> · WARNING ≤ <span x-text="(thresholds.hall*3)+'%'"></span> · DANGER 초과
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sec" x-show="Object.keys(data.hallucination_detail?.indicator_types||{}).length>0">
        <div class="sec-t">환각 유형별 분류</div>
        <template x-for="[t,n] in Object.entries(data.hallucination_detail?.indicator_types||{})" :key="t">
          <div style="margin-bottom:10px" x-data="{open:false}">
            <div class="drow" style="cursor:pointer;align-items:flex-start" @click="open=!open">
              <div style="flex:1">
                <span class="dk" x-text="{'unsupported_claim':'미지원 주장 (Unsupported Claim)','numerical_inconsistency':'수치 불일치 (Numerical Inconsistency)'}[t]||t"></span>
                <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:2px" x-text="{'unsupported_claim':'컨텍스트 단어 중복도 30% 미만 문장 — 근거 없는 주장으로 환각 의심','numerical_inconsistency':'컨텍스트·정답에 없는 숫자 포함 — 수치 왜곡 또는 조작 환각'}[t]||''"></div>
              </div>
              <span style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);margin-left:8px" x-text="`${n}건`"></span>
              <span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);margin-left:6px" x-text="open?'▲':'▼'"></span>
            </div>
            <div x-show="open" style="margin-top:6px;padding:8px;background:var(--bg3);border-radius:6px;font-size:11px;max-height:220px;overflow-y:auto">
              <template x-for="det in (data.hallucination_detail?.detections||[]).filter(d=>(d.indicators||[]).some(i=>i.type===t))" :key="det.task_id">
                <div style="margin-bottom:8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding-bottom:6px">
                  <div style="font-weight:600;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:3px" x-text="'🔍 '+det.task_id"></div>
                <div x-show="det.question" style="font-size:10px;color:var(--accent);background:var(--bg);border-radius:4px;padding:4px 6px;margin-bottom:4px;word-break:break-word" x-text="'❓ 질문: '+det.question"></div>
                <div x-show="det.context" style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text2);background:var(--bg);border-radius:4px;padding:4px 6px;margin-bottom:4px;word-break:break-word" x-text="'📄 컨텍스트: '+det.context"></div>
                  <template x-for="(ind,idx) in (det.indicators||[]).filter(i=>i.type===t)" :key="idx">
                    <div style="padding:2px 0;display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:baseline">
                      <span :style="`color:${ind.severity==='high'?'var(--red)':ind.severity==='medium'?'var(--yellow)':'var(--green)'};flex-shrink:0`" x-text="{'high':'⚠ 높음','medium':'△ 중간','low':'○ 낮음'}[ind.severity]||ind.severity"></span>
                      <span style="color:var(--fg);word-break:break-word" x-text="ind.sentence||ind.value||'—'"></span>
                    </div>
                  </template>
                </div>
              </template>
            </div>
          </div>
        </template>
      </div>
      <div x-show="!(data.accuracy_metrics?.hallucination?.total_evaluated>0)" style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);padding:10px 0">
        환각 탐지 데이터 없음 — <code>enable_hallucination_detection=True</code>로 PerformanceMonitor를 초기화하세요.
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- ── 심화 티어 ── -->
  <div x-show="tq==='advanced'">
    <!-- RAG (Ragas) 심화 평가 -->
    <div x-show="!data.has_rag" class="es">
      <div class="es-icon">📊</div>
      <div class="es-title">RAG 지표 없음</div>
      <div class="es-desc">HybridPerformanceMonitor에서 Ragas를 활성화하거나 RAG 평가 예제를 실행하세요.</div>
    </div>
    <div x-show="data.has_rag" x-data="{
      selK: null,
      meta: {
        faithfulness:      {label:'Faithfulness',      desc:'생성된 답변의 모든 주장이 검색된 컨텍스트에 의해 지지되는지 측정', hint:'지지 문장 수 / 전체 문장 수 (LLM-as-judge). 1.0 = 완전 충실'},
        answer_relevancy:  {label:'Answer Relevancy',  desc:'답변이 원래 질문에 얼마나 관련있고 간결한지 측정', hint:'역생성 질문과 원질문의 코사인 유사도 평균. 1.0 = 완전 관련'},
        context_recall:    {label:'Context Recall',    desc:'정답의 모든 정보가 검색된 컨텍스트에 포함되어 있는지', hint:'귀속 가능 문장 / 전체 문장 (LLM-as-judge). 1.0 = 완전 재현'},
        context_precision: {label:'Context Precision', desc:'검색된 컨텍스트 중 실제로 관련있는 항목의 비율', hint:'순위 가중 정밀도. 1.0 = 완전 정밀'},
        ragas_overall:     {label:'Ragas Overall',     desc:'4개 지표의 평균 종합 RAG 점수', hint:'(Faithfulness + Ans.Relevancy + Ctx.Recall + Ctx.Precision) / 4. 0.8+ = 양호'},
      },
      calcFormula(k, data) {
        const m = data.advanced?.rag_metrics||{};
        const s = data.advanced?.summary||{};
        const vals = m[k]||[];
        const n = vals.length||1;
        const avg = vals.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0)/n;
        const labels = {faithfulness:'지지 문장 수 / 전체 문장 수',answer_relevancy:'역생성 질문 코사인 유사도 평균',context_recall:'귀속 가능 문장 / 전체 문장',context_precision:'순위 가중 정밀도'};
        if(k==='ragas_overall'){const os=s.ragas_overall_score;return `Overall = (Faithfulness + Ans.Relevancy\n+ Ctx.Recall + Ctx.Precision) / 4\n평균: ${(os?.mean??0).toFixed(3)}`;}
        return `${labels[k]||k}\n평균: ${avg.toFixed(3)} (${vals.length}건)\nmin: ${vals.length?Math.min(...vals).toFixed(3):'—'} / max: ${vals.length?Math.max(...vals).toFixed(3):'—'}`;
      },
      filteredItems(k, data) {
        const per = data.advanced?.per_task||[];
        if(k==='ragas_overall') return per.filter(t=>t.ragas_faithfulness!=null||t.ragas_answer_relevancy!=null||t.ragas_context_recall!=null||t.ragas_context_precision!=null);
        return per.filter(t=>t['ragas_'+k]!=null).sort((a,b)=>(a['ragas_'+k]||0)-(b['ragas_'+k]||0));
      },
      filterLabel(k) { return k==='ragas_overall'?'RAG 데이터 있는 태스크':'낮은 점수 순'; },
      hlCol(k) { return ''; }
    }">
      <div class="kpi-grid">
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='faithfulness'}" @click="selK=selK==='faithfulness'?null:'faithfulness'">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">FAITHFULNESS</div>
          <div class="kpi-val" x-text="ragAvg('faithfulness')"></div>
          <div class="kpi-sub" style="color:var(--text2)" x-text="(()=>{const a=data.advanced?.rag_metrics?.faithfulness||[];return a.length?`${a.length}건 | min ${Math.min(...a).toFixed(3)} / max ${Math.max(...a).toFixed(3)}`:'데이터 없음'})()"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='answer_relevancy'}" @click="selK=selK==='answer_relevancy'?null:'answer_relevancy'">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">ANSWER RELEVANCY</div>
          <div class="kpi-val" x-text="ragAvg('answer_relevancy')"></div>
          <div class="kpi-sub" style="color:var(--text2)" x-text="(()=>{const a=data.advanced?.rag_metrics?.answer_relevancy||[];return a.length?`${a.length}건 | min ${Math.min(...a).toFixed(3)} / max ${Math.max(...a).toFixed(3)}`:'데이터 없음'})()"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='context_recall'}" @click="selK=selK==='context_recall'?null:'context_recall'">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">CONTEXT RECALL</div>
          <div class="kpi-val" x-text="ragAvg('context_recall')"></div>
          <div class="kpi-sub" style="color:var(--text2)" x-text="(()=>{const a=data.advanced?.rag_metrics?.context_recall||[];return a.length?`${a.length}건 | min ${Math.min(...a).toFixed(3)} / max ${Math.max(...a).toFixed(3)}`:'데이터 없음'})()"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='context_precision'}" @click="selK=selK==='context_precision'?null:'context_precision'">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">CONTEXT PRECISION</div>
          <div class="kpi-val" x-text="ragAvg('context_precision')"></div>
          <div class="kpi-sub" style="color:var(--text2)" x-text="(()=>{const a=data.advanced?.rag_metrics?.context_precision||[];return a.length?`${a.length}건 | min ${Math.min(...a).toFixed(3)} / max ${Math.max(...a).toFixed(3)}`:'데이터 없음'})()"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='ragas_overall'}" @click="selK=selK==='ragas_overall'?null:'ragas_overall'" x-show="data.advanced?.summary?.ragas_overall_score?.mean!=null">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">RAGAS OVERALL</div>
          <div class="kpi-val" x-text="(data.advanced?.summary?.ragas_overall_score?.mean??0).toFixed(3)"></div>
          <div class="kpi-sub" style="color:var(--text2)" x-text="`min ${(data.advanced?.summary?.ragas_overall_score?.min??0).toFixed(2)} / max ${(data.advanced?.summary?.ragas_overall_score?.max??0).toFixed(2)}`"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% call kpi_detail_panel("{faithfulness:ragAvg('faithfulness'),answer_relevancy:ragAvg('answer_relevancy'),context_recall:ragAvg('context_recall'),context_precision:ragAvg('context_precision'),ragas_overall:(data.advanced?.summary?.ragas_overall_score?.mean??0).toFixed(3)}[selK]||''", "data", "태스크별 상세") %}
      <div class="dtx" style="max-height:240px;overflow-y:auto">
        <div class="dtx-row dtx-head" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 80px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1">
          <span>태스크 ID</span><span style="text-align:center">점수</span>
        </div>
        <template x-for="(t,i) in filteredItems(selK, data)" :key="t.task_id||i">
          <div class="dtx-row" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 80px">
            <span class="dtx-id" x-text="t.task_id||'-'"></span>
            <span style="text-align:center;font-weight:600" :style="(()=>{const f=selK==='ragas_overall'?null:'ragas_'+selK;const v=f?+(t[f]||0):((t.ragas_faithfulness||0)+(t.ragas_answer_relevancy||0)+(t.ragas_context_recall||0)+(t.ragas_context_precision||0))/4;return v>=0.8?'color:var(--green)':v>=0.5?'color:var(--yellow)':'color:var(--red)';})()" x-text="(()=>{const f=selK==='ragas_overall'?null:'ragas_'+selK;const v=f?t[f]:((t.ragas_faithfulness||0)+(t.ragas_answer_relevancy||0)+(t.ragas_context_recall||0)+(t.ragas_context_precision||0))/4;return v!=null?(+v).toFixed(3):'—';})()"></span>
          </div>
        </template>
        <div class="dtx-empty" x-show="filteredItems(selK, data).length===0">데이터 없음</div>
      </div>
      {% endcall %}
      <!-- Ragas 지표 설명 -->
      <div class="sec" style="margin-top:16px">
        <div class="sec-t">📖 지표 설명</div>
        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;font-size:12px">
          <div style="background:var(--bg3);border-radius:8px;padding:10px">
            <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--fg);margin-bottom:4px">Faithfulness (충실도)</div>
            <div style="color:var(--text2);line-height:1.5">생성된 답변의 모든 주장이 검색된 컨텍스트에 의해 지지되는지 측정. LLM이 각 문장의 근거를 컨텍스트에서 확인하여 산출 (지지 문장 수 / 전체 문장 수). <span style="color:var(--green)">1.0 = 완전 충실</span></div>
          </div>
          <div style="background:var(--bg3);border-radius:8px;padding:10px">
            <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--fg);margin-bottom:4px">Answer Relevancy (답변 관련성)</div>
            <div style="color:var(--text2);line-height:1.5">답변이 원래 질문에 얼마나 관련있고 간결한지 측정. LLM이 답변에서 역으로 질문을 여러 개 생성하고, 원질문과의 코사인 유사도 평균으로 산출. <span style="color:var(--green)">1.0 = 완전 관련</span></div>
          </div>
          <div style="background:var(--bg3);border-radius:8px;padding:10px">
            <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--fg);margin-bottom:4px">Context Recall (컨텍스트 재현율)</div>
            <div style="color:var(--text2);line-height:1.5">정답(ground truth)의 모든 정보가 검색된 컨텍스트에 포함되어 있는지 측정. LLM이 정답의 각 문장을 컨텍스트로 귀속 가능한지 판단 (귀속 가능 문장 / 전체 문장). <span style="color:var(--green)">1.0 = 완전 재현</span></div>
          </div>
          <div style="background:var(--bg3);border-radius:8px;padding:10px">
            <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--fg);margin-bottom:4px">Context Precision (컨텍스트 정밀도)</div>
            <div style="color:var(--text2);line-height:1.5">검색된 컨텍스트 중 실제로 관련있는 항목의 비율. 관련 항목이 상위에 랭크될수록 높은 점수 (순위 가중 정밀도). 노이즈가 많은 컨텍스트를 탐지. <span style="color:var(--green)">1.0 = 완전 정밀</span></div>
          </div>
          <div style="background:var(--bg3);border-radius:8px;padding:10px;grid-column:1/-1">
            <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--fg);margin-bottom:4px">Ragas Overall Score (종합 RAG 점수)</div>
            <div style="color:var(--text2);line-height:1.5">Faithfulness · Answer Relevancy · Context Recall · Context Precision 4개 지표의 평균. RAG 파이프라인 전체 품질을 하나의 점수로 요약. <span style="color:var(--green)">0.8+ = 양호</span> — 개별 지표를 함께 검토하여 약점 지표를 파악하는 것을 권장.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Ragas 지표 비교 차트 -->
      <div class="sec">
        <div class="sec-t">Ragas 지표 비교</div>
        <div id="q-rag-bar" style="height:220px"></div>
      </div>
      <!-- 태스크별 RAG 상세 -->
      <div class="sec">
        <div class="sec-t">태스크별 RAG 상세</div>
        <div x-show="!(data.advanced?.per_task||[]).some(t=>t.ragas_faithfulness||t.ragas_answer_relevancy||t.ragas_context_recall||t.ragas_context_precision)" style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);padding:10px">태스크별 Ragas 데이터 없음</div>
        <div x-show="(data.advanced?.per_task||[]).some(t=>t.ragas_faithfulness||t.ragas_answer_relevancy||t.ragas_context_recall||t.ragas_context_precision)">
          <div class="dtx" style="max-height:360px;overflow-y:auto">
            <div class="dtx-row dtx-head" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 108px 116px 90px 108px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1">
              <span>Task ID</span>
              <span style="text-align:right">Faithfulness</span>
              <span style="text-align:right">Ans.Relevancy</span>
              <span style="text-align:right">Ctx.Recall</span>
              <span style="text-align:right">Ctx.Precision</span>
            </div>
            <template x-for="(t,i) in (data.advanced?.per_task||[]).filter(t=>t.ragas_faithfulness||t.ragas_answer_relevancy||t.ragas_context_recall||t.ragas_context_precision)" :key="i">
              <div class="dtx-row" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 108px 116px 90px 108px">
                <span class="dtx-id" x-text="t.task_id||`#${i+1}`"></span>
                <span :style="`text-align:right;font-weight:600;color:${(t.ragas_faithfulness||0)>=0.8?'var(--green)':(t.ragas_faithfulness||0)>=0.5?'var(--yellow)':'var(--red)'}`" x-text="t.ragas_faithfulness!=null?(+t.ragas_faithfulness).toFixed(3):'—'"></span>
                <span :style="`text-align:right;font-weight:600;color:${(t.ragas_answer_relevancy||0)>=0.8?'var(--green)':(t.ragas_answer_relevancy||0)>=0.5?'var(--yellow)':'var(--red)'}`" x-text="t.ragas_answer_relevancy!=null?(+t.ragas_answer_relevancy).toFixed(3):'—'"></span>
                <span :style="`text-align:right;font-weight:600;color:${(t.ragas_context_recall||0)>=0.8?'var(--green)':(t.ragas_context_recall||0)>=0.5?'var(--yellow)':'var(--red)'}`" x-text="t.ragas_context_recall!=null?(+t.ragas_context_recall).toFixed(3):'—'"></span>
                <span :style="`text-align:right;font-weight:600;color:${(t.ragas_context_precision||0)>=0.8?'var(--green)':(t.ragas_context_precision||0)>=0.5?'var(--yellow)':'var(--red)'}`" x-text="t.ragas_context_precision!=null?(+t.ragas_context_precision).toFixed(3):'—'"></span>
              </div>
            </template>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- ── 통합 티어 ── -->
  <div x-show="tq==='integrated'">
    <!-- DeepEval 단일 뷰 -->
    <div x-show="!data.has_advanced" class="es">
      <div class="es-icon">🔬</div>
      <div class="es-title">DeepEval 지표 없음</div>
      <div class="es-desc">HybridPerformanceMonitor에서 DeepEval (G-Eval, Hallucination, Answer Relevancy)을 활성화하세요.</div>
    </div>
    <div x-show="data.has_advanced" x-data="{
      selK: null,
      meta: {
        g_eval_score:          {label:'G-Eval Score',     desc:'LLM이 사용자 정의 기준(Correctness·Coherence 등)에 따라 0–1로 평가', hint:'LLM-as-judge. 별도 컨텍스트 없이도 범용 품질 측정 가능. 0.8+ = 양호'},
        hallucination_score:   {label:'Hallucination',    desc:'컨텍스트 대비 환각 없는 비율. 1.0=환각 없음 (↑ 높을수록 좋음)', hint:'컨텍스트 제공 필요. 생성 문장의 컨텍스트 지지 여부를 LLM이 판정'},
        toxicity_score:        {label:'Toxicity',         desc:'유해·공격적 표현 탐지. 0.0=문제없음 (↓ 낮을수록 좋음)', hint:'0.0 = 안전 (정상값). 0.1 이하 = 안전. 사실적 응답은 0.000이 정상'},
        bias_score:            {label:'Bias',             desc:'성별·인종 편향 탐지. 0.0=편향없음 (↓ 낮을수록 좋음)', hint:'0.0 = 안전 (정상값). 0.1 이하 = 안전. 중립적 응답은 0.000이 정상'},
        answer_relevancy_score:{label:'Ans. Relevancy',   desc:'응답이 질문에 얼마나 관련있고 간결한지. 1.0=완전 관련', hint:'역생성 질문의 코사인 유사도. QA / IR 태스크만 적용. 0.8+ = 양호'},
      },
      calcFormula(k, data) {
        const s = data.advanced?.summary||{};
        const v = s[k];
        if(!v) return '데이터 없음';
        const n = v.count||(data.advanced?.per_task||[]).length;
        const labels = {g_eval_score:'G-Eval = LLM-judge 평가 (0–1)',hallucination_score:'Hallucination = 컨텍스트 일치율 (1.0=환각없음)',toxicity_score:'Toxicity = 유해 표현 탐지 (0.0=안전)',bias_score:'Bias = 편향 탐지 (0.0=편향없음)',answer_relevancy_score:'Ans.Relevancy = 역생성 질문 유사도 평균'};
        return `${labels[k]||k}\n평균: ${(v.mean??0).toFixed(3)} (${n}건)\nmin: ${(v.min??0).toFixed(3)} / max: ${(v.max??0).toFixed(3)}`;
      },
      filteredItems(k, data) {
        const per = data.advanced?.per_task||[];
        const inv = k==='toxicity_score'||k==='bias_score';
        return per.filter(t=>t[k]!=null).sort((a,b)=>inv?(b[k]||0)-(a[k]||0):(a[k]||0)-(b[k]||0));
      },
      filterLabel(k) {
        return (k==='toxicity_score'||k==='bias_score')?'위험 높은 순':'낮은 점수 순';
      },
      hlCol(k) { return ''; }
    }">
      <!-- KPI 카드 -->
      <div class="kpi-grid">
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='g_eval_score'}" @click="selK=selK==='g_eval_score'?null:'g_eval_score'" x-show="data.advanced?.summary?.g_eval_score?.mean!=null">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">G-EVAL SCORE</div>
          <div class="kpi-val" style="font-size:20px" x-text="(data.advanced?.summary?.g_eval_score?.mean??0).toFixed(3)"></div>
          <div class="kpi-sub" style="color:var(--text2)" x-text="(()=>{const v=data.advanced?.summary?.g_eval_score;const n=v?.count||(data.advanced?.per_task||[]).length;return `${n}건 | min ${(v?.min??0).toFixed(2)} / max ${(v?.max??0).toFixed(2)}`})()"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='hallucination_score'}" @click="selK=selK==='hallucination_score'?null:'hallucination_score'" x-show="data.advanced?.summary?.hallucination_score?.mean!=null">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">HALLUCINATION</div>
          <div class="kpi-val" style="font-size:20px" x-text="(data.advanced?.summary?.hallucination_score?.mean??0).toFixed(3)"></div>
          <div class="kpi-sub" style="color:var(--text2)" x-text="(()=>{const v=data.advanced?.summary?.hallucination_score;const n=v?.count||(data.advanced?.per_task||[]).length;return `${n}건 | min ${(v?.min??0).toFixed(2)} / max ${(v?.max??0).toFixed(2)}`})()"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='toxicity_score'}" @click="selK=selK==='toxicity_score'?null:'toxicity_score'" x-show="data.advanced?.summary?.toxicity_score?.mean!=null">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">TOXICITY</div>
          <div class="kpi-val" style="font-size:20px" x-text="(data.advanced?.summary?.toxicity_score?.mean??0).toFixed(3)"></div>
          <div class="kpi-sub" style="color:var(--text2)" x-text="(()=>{const v=data.advanced?.summary?.toxicity_score;const n=v?.count||(data.advanced?.per_task||[]).length;return `${n}건 | min ${(v?.min??0).toFixed(2)} / max ${(v?.max??0).toFixed(2)}`})()"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='bias_score'}" @click="selK=selK==='bias_score'?null:'bias_score'" x-show="data.advanced?.summary?.bias_score?.mean!=null">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">BIAS</div>
          <div class="kpi-val" style="font-size:20px" x-text="(data.advanced?.summary?.bias_score?.mean??0).toFixed(3)"></div>
          <div class="kpi-sub" style="color:var(--text2)" x-text="(()=>{const v=data.advanced?.summary?.bias_score;const n=v?.count||(data.advanced?.per_task||[]).length;return `${n}건 | min ${(v?.min??0).toFixed(2)} / max ${(v?.max??0).toFixed(2)}`})()"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='answer_relevancy_score'}" @click="selK=selK==='answer_relevancy_score'?null:'answer_relevancy_score'" x-show="data.advanced?.summary?.answer_relevancy_score?.mean!=null">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">ANS. RELEVANCY</div>
          <div class="kpi-val" style="font-size:20px" x-text="(data.advanced?.summary?.answer_relevancy_score?.mean??0).toFixed(3)"></div>
          <div class="kpi-sub" style="color:var(--text2)" x-text="(()=>{const v=data.advanced?.summary?.answer_relevancy_score;const n=v?.count||(data.advanced?.per_task||[]).length;return `${n}건 | min ${(v?.min??0).toFixed(2)} / max ${(v?.max??0).toFixed(2)}`})()"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% call kpi_detail_panel("{g_eval_score:(data.advanced?.summary?.g_eval_score?.mean??0).toFixed(3),hallucination_score:(data.advanced?.summary?.hallucination_score?.mean??0).toFixed(3),toxicity_score:(data.advanced?.summary?.toxicity_score?.mean??0).toFixed(3),bias_score:(data.advanced?.summary?.bias_score?.mean??0).toFixed(3),answer_relevancy_score:(data.advanced?.summary?.answer_relevancy_score?.mean??0).toFixed(3)}[selK]||''", "data", "태스크별 상세") %}
      <div class="dtx" style="max-height:240px;overflow-y:auto">
        <div class="dtx-row dtx-head" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 80px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1">
          <span>태스크 ID</span><span style="text-align:center">점수</span>
        </div>
        <template x-for="(t,i) in filteredItems(selK, data)" :key="t.task_id||i">
          <div class="dtx-row" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 80px">
            <span class="dtx-id" x-text="t.task_id||'-'"></span>
            <span style="text-align:center;font-weight:600" :style="(()=>{const inv=selK==='toxicity_score'||selK==='bias_score';const v=t[selK]||0;return inv?(v<=0.1?'color:var(--green)':v<=0.3?'color:var(--yellow)':'color:var(--red)'):(v>=0.8?'color:var(--green)':v>=0.5?'color:var(--yellow)':'color:var(--red)');})()" x-text="t[selK]!=null?(+t[selK]).toFixed(3):'—'"></span>
          </div>
        </template>
        <div class="dtx-empty" x-show="filteredItems(selK, data).length===0">데이터 없음</div>
      </div>
      {% endcall %}
      <!-- DeepEval 지표 설명 -->
      <div class="sec" style="margin-top:16px">
        <div class="sec-t">📖 지표 설명</div>
        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;font-size:12px">
          <div style="background:var(--bg3);border-radius:8px;padding:10px">
            <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--fg);margin-bottom:4px">G-Eval (범용 품질 평가)</div>
            <div style="color:var(--text2);line-height:1.5">LLM을 판정자로 사용해 사용자 정의 기준(Correctness·Coherence·Relevance 등)으로 0–1 점수 산출. 별도 컨텍스트 없이도 범용 품질 측정 가능. <span style="color:var(--green)">0.8+ = 양호</span></div>
          </div>
          <div style="background:var(--bg3);border-radius:8px;padding:10px">
            <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--fg);margin-bottom:4px">Hallucination (환각 탐지)</div>
            <div style="color:var(--text2);line-height:1.5">제공된 컨텍스트에 근거하지 않는 내용을 LLM이 생성했는지 탐지. 1.0=컨텍스트와 완전 일치 (환각 없음), 낮을수록 환각 많음. <span style="color:var(--green)">1.0 = 완전 일치</span></div>
          </div>
          <div style="background:var(--bg3);border-radius:8px;padding:10px">
            <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--fg);margin-bottom:4px">Toxicity (유해성 탐지)</div>
            <div style="color:var(--text2);line-height:1.5">응답에 포함된 욕설·혐오·공격적 표현을 LLM-judge가 탐지. <b>0.0 = 문제 없음</b> (정상), 1.0 = 매우 유해. 일반 QA·추론 응답은 0.000이 정상 결과. 배포 전 콘텐츠 안전성 검증에 활용. <span style="color:var(--green)">0.1 이하 = 안전</span></div>
          </div>
          <div style="background:var(--bg3);border-radius:8px;padding:10px">
            <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--fg);margin-bottom:4px">Bias (편향 탐지)</div>
            <div style="color:var(--text2);line-height:1.5">성별·인종·종교·정치 편향을 LLM-judge가 탐지. <b>0.0 = 편향 없음</b> (정상), 높을수록 편향 심함. 사실적·중립적 응답은 0.000이 정상 결과. 민감한 주제를 다루는 에이전트 검증에 활용. <span style="color:var(--green)">0.1 이하 = 안전</span></div>
          </div>
          <div style="background:var(--bg3);border-radius:8px;padding:10px;grid-column:1/-1">
            <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--fg);margin-bottom:4px">Answer Relevancy (답변 관련성)</div>
            <div style="color:var(--text2);line-height:1.5">응답이 원래 질문에 얼마나 관련있고 간결한지 측정. LLM이 답변에서 역으로 질문을 여러 개 재생성하고, 원질문과의 코사인 유사도 평균으로 산출. QA·정보 검색 태스크에만 적용됨 (<code>task_type='qa'</code> 또는 <code>'information_retrieval'</code>). <span style="color:var(--green)">0.8+ = 양호</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- 차트: DeepEval 지표 비교 + G-Eval 분포 -->
      <div class="cg">
        <div class="cbox">
          <div class="ct">DeepEval 지표 비교</div>
          <div id="q-deepeval-bar" style="height:220px"></div>
          <div x-show="!Object.entries(data.advanced?.summary||{}).some(([k,v])=>!k.startsWith('ragas_')&&typeof v==='object'&&(v.mean??0)>0)" style="text-align:center;padding:16px;color:var(--text2);font-size:13px">지표 데이터 없음</div>
        </div>
        <div class="cbox">
          <div class="ct">G-Eval Score (태스크별)</div>
          <div id="q-deepeval-hist" style="height:220px"></div>
          <div x-show="!(data.advanced?.per_task||[]).some(t=>t.g_eval_score>0)" style="text-align:center;padding:16px;color:var(--text2);font-size:13px">G-Eval Score 데이터 없음</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- 태스크별 상세 -->
      <div class="sec" style="margin-top:12px">
        <div class="sec-t">태스크별 상세 <span class="badge" x-text="`${(data.advanced?.per_task||[]).length}건`"></span></div>
        <div x-show="!(data.advanced?.per_task?.length>0)" style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);padding:10px">태스크별 데이터 없음</div>
        <div x-show="data.advanced?.per_task?.length>0">
          <div class="dtx" style="max-height:360px;overflow-y:auto">
          <!-- 헤더 행 -->
          <div class="dtx-row dtx-head" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 90px 116px 80px 68px 120px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1">
            <span>Task ID</span>
            <span style="text-align:right;white-space:nowrap" title="LLM이 사용자 정의 기준으로 평가. ↑ 높을수록 좋음">G-Eval ↑</span>
            <span style="text-align:right;white-space:nowrap" title="컨텍스트 대비 환각 없는 비율. 1.0=환각 없음. ↑ 높을수록 좋음">Hallucination ↑</span>
            <span style="text-align:right;white-space:nowrap" title="유해·공격적 표현 탐지. 0.0=문제 없음. ↓ 낮을수록 좋음">Toxicity ↓</span>
            <span style="text-align:right;white-space:nowrap" title="성별·인종 편향 탐지. 0.0=편향 없음. ↓ 낮을수록 좋음">Bias ↓</span>
            <span style="text-align:right;white-space:nowrap" title="응답이 질문에 얼마나 관련있는지. 1.0=완전 관련. ↑ 높을수록 좋음">Ans.Relevancy ↑</span>
          </div>
          <!-- 데이터 행 -->
          <template x-for="(t,i) in (data.advanced?.per_task||[]).slice(0,50)" :key="i">
            <div class="dtx-row" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 90px 116px 80px 68px 120px">
              <span class="dtx-id" x-text="t.task_id||`#${i+1}`"></span>
              <span :style="`text-align:right;font-weight:600;color:${t.g_eval_score!=null?((+t.g_eval_score)>=0.8?'var(--green)':(+t.g_eval_score)>=0.5?'var(--yellow)':'var(--red)'):'var(--text2)'}`"
                x-text="t.g_eval_score!=null?(+t.g_eval_score).toFixed(3):'—'"></span>
              <span :style="`text-align:right;font-weight:600;color:${t.hallucination_score!=null?((+t.hallucination_score)>=0.8?'var(--green)':(+t.hallucination_score)>=0.5?'var(--yellow)':'var(--red)'):'var(--text2)'}`"
                x-text="t.hallucination_score!=null?(+t.hallucination_score).toFixed(3):'—'"></span>
              <span :style="`text-align:right;font-weight:600;color:${t.toxicity_score!=null?((+t.toxicity_score)<=0.1?'var(--green)':(+t.toxicity_score)<=0.3?'var(--yellow)':'var(--red)'):'var(--text2)'}`"
                x-text="t.toxicity_score!=null?(+t.toxicity_score).toFixed(3):'—'"></span>
              <span :style="`text-align:right;font-weight:600;color:${t.bias_score!=null?((+t.bias_score)<=0.1?'var(--green)':(+t.bias_score)<=0.3?'var(--yellow)':'var(--red)'):'var(--text2)'}`"
                x-text="t.bias_score!=null?(+t.bias_score).toFixed(3):'—'"></span>
              <span :style="`text-align:right;font-weight:600;color:${t.answer_relevancy_score!=null?((+t.answer_relevancy_score)>=0.8?'var(--green)':(+t.answer_relevancy_score)>=0.5?'var(--yellow)':'var(--red)'):'var(--text2)'}`"
                x-text="t.answer_relevancy_score!=null?(+t.answer_relevancy_score).toFixed(3):'—'"></span>
            </div>
          </template>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ══ 에이전틱 (Agentic) ══ -->
<div x-show="data && sec==='agentic'" x-cloak>

  <div class="tabs">
    <div class="tab" :class="{on:tag==='basic'}"      @click="tag='basic';t2='retry'">⚡ 실행·재시도</div>
    <div class="tab" :class="{on:tag==='advanced'}"   @click="tag='advanced';t2='tsel'">🎯 도구·협업·흐름</div>
    <div class="tab" :class="{on:tag==='integrated'}" @click="tag='integrated'">🔍 실행 트레이스</div>
    <span style="margin-left:auto;font-size:14px;color:var(--text2)">
      에이전틱 Score: <b x-text="perspScore('agentic',data)"></b>/100
    </span>
  </div>

  <div x-show="!data.has_agentic" class="es">
    <div class="es-icon">⚙️</div>
    <div class="es-title">Agentic 지표 없음</div>
    <div class="es-desc">Tool Selection, Multi-Agent, Workflow 평가가 포함된 예제를 실행하세요.</div>
  </div>
  <div x-show="data.has_agentic">

  <!-- ── 기본 티어 ── -->
  <div x-show="tag==='basic'">
    <!-- 에이전틱 역량 레이더 차트 -->
    <div class="sec">
      <div class="sec-t">🕸️ 에이전틱 역량 레이더</div>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start">

        <!-- 레이더 차트 (왼쪽) -->
        <div style="flex:1 1 0;min-width:0"><div id="ag-radar" style="height:420px"></div></div>

        <!-- 지표 설명 (오른쪽 1열) -->
        <div style="flex:0 0 310px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px">

          <div style="background:var(--bg3);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 12px">
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:4px">
              <span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text1)">⚡ Tool 효율</span>
              <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);margin-left:auto"
                    x-text="((data.agentic?.tool_efficiency?.avg_efficiency_score)||0).toFixed(1)"></span>
            </div>
            <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.5">
              성공률·중복 없음·불필요 호출 없음을 종합한 도구 사용 효율<br>
              <span style="font-family:monospace;color:var(--accent)">avg(efficiency_score per task)</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="background:var(--bg3);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 12px">
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:4px">
              <span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text1)">🎯 Tool 선택</span>
              <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);margin-left:auto"
                    x-text="((data.agentic?.tool_selection_summary?.avg_f1_score)||0).toFixed(1)"></span>
            </div>
            <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.5">
              expected_tools 대비 실제 선택 도구의 F1 Score 평균<br>
              <span style="font-family:monospace;color:var(--accent)">avg(2·P·R / (P+R))</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="background:var(--bg3);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 12px">
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:4px">
              <span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text1)">🔁 재시도 정확도</span>
              <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);margin-left:auto"
                    x-text="Math.max(0,100-((data.agentic?.retry_summary?.avg_attempts_per_task||1)-1)*30).toFixed(1)"></span>
            </div>
            <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.5">
              평균 시도 횟수 역산 — 1회(100), 2회(70), 3회(40), 4회+(0)<br>
              <span style="font-family:monospace;color:var(--accent)">max(0, 100 − (avg_attempts − 1) × 30)</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="background:var(--bg3);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 12px">
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:4px">
              <span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text1)">🔀 워크플로</span>
              <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);margin-left:auto"
                    x-text="((data.agentic?.workflow_summary?.step_success_rate)||0).toFixed(1)"></span>
            </div>
            <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.5">
              워크플로우 전체 스텝 중 성공한 스텝의 비율<br>
              <span style="font-family:monospace;color:var(--accent)">성공 스텝 ÷ 전체 스텝 × 100</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="background:var(--bg3);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 12px">
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:4px">
              <span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text1)">🤝 멀티에이전트</span>
              <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);margin-left:auto"
                    x-text="((data.agentic?.coordination_summary?.success_rate)||0).toFixed(1)"></span>
            </div>
            <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.5">
              에이전트 간 상호작용(위임·통신·협업) 성공 비율<br>
              <span style="font-family:monospace;color:var(--accent)">성공 상호작용 ÷ 전체 상호작용 × 100</span>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    {# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       공통 KPI 상세 패널 매크로 (kpi_detail_panel)
       ─ 에이전틱 모든 섹션이 공유하는 outer shell
       ─ value_expr  : 헤더 우측에 표시할 Alpine.js 값 표현식 (문자열)
       ─ data_expr   : calcFormula / filteredItems 에 넘길 데이터 배열 표현식
       ─ items_label : 관련 항목 레이블 (기본값 '관련 항목')
       ─ 각 섹션 x-data 는 아래 메서드 이름을 반드시 준수해야 함:
           selK, meta{}, calcFormula(k,data), filteredItems(k,data),
           filterLabel(k), hlCol(k)
       사용법:
         {% call kpi_detail_panel("value_expr", "data.agentic?.xxx||[]", "레이블") %}
           <!-- 섹션별 테이블 헤더 행 + <template x-for> 데이터 행 -->
         {% endcall %}
    ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ #}
    <div class="tabs">
      <div class="tab" :class="{on:t2==='retry'}"  @click="t2='retry'">🔁 Retry</div>
      <div class="tab" :class="{on:t2==='teff'}"   @click="t2='teff'">⚡ Tool Efficiency</div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tool Efficiency -->
    <div x-show="t2==='teff'" x-data="{
      selK: null,
      meta: {
        total_calls:          {label:'총 Tool 호출',  unit:'건', desc:'에이전트가 실행한 도구 호출의 절대 건수입니다. 태스크 수가 아닌 이벤트 수입니다.', hint:'전체 실행에서 기록된 도구 호출 합계입니다. 호출 수가 많을수록 복잡한 에이전트입니다.'},
        success_rate:         {label:'성공률',        unit:'%',  desc:'전체 도구 호출 중 성공한 비율입니다.',                                              hint:'80% 이하이면 특정 도구의 안정성을 점검하세요. success=false 기록 기준입니다.'},
        avg_efficiency_score: {label:'평균 효율성',   unit:'%',  desc:'중복·실패 호출을 제외한 순효율 점수입니다.',                                        hint:'100 − (중복+실패)/전체 × 100으로 산출. 90% 이상이 이상적이며, 낮으면 불필요한 호출이 많음을 의미합니다.'},
        redundancy_rate:      {label:'중복 호출률',   unit:'%',  desc:'동일 도구를 연속 중복 호출한 비율입니다.',                                          hint:'낮을수록 좋습니다. 높으면 에이전트가 결과를 캐싱하지 않거나 루프에 빠질 가능성이 있습니다.'},
        failure_rate:         {label:'실패율',        unit:'%',  desc:'도구 호출 중 실패로 기록된 비율입니다.',                                            hint:'낮을수록 좋습니다. 특정 도구의 실패율이 높으면 해당 도구의 에러 핸들링을 점검하세요.'},
        avg_calls_per_task:   {label:'Task당 평균',   unit:'회', desc:'태스크 하나당 평균 도구 호출 횟수입니다.',                                          hint:'호출 횟수가 많을수록 복잡한 에이전트이지만 불필요한 호출이 포함될 수 있습니다.'},
      },
      calcFormula(k, ex) {
        const te = data.agentic?.tool_efficiency||{};
        const n  = ex.length;
        const totalC = ex.reduce((s,e)=>s+(e.total_calls||0),0);
        switch(k) {
          case 'total_calls':
            return `전체 실행에서 기록된 도구 호출 합계: ${te.total_calls||0}건`;
          case 'success_rate': {
            const fail = ex.reduce((s,e)=>s+(e.failed_calls||0),0);
            return `성공(${totalC-fail}) ÷ 전체(${totalC}) × 100 = ${totalC?((totalC-fail)/totalC*100).toFixed(1):0}%`;
          }
          case 'avg_efficiency_score': {
            const avg = n ? (ex.reduce((s,e)=>s+(e.efficiency_score||0),0)/n).toFixed(1) : 0;
            return `100 − (중복+실패) ÷ 전체 호출 × 100\n태스크별 효율성 평균: ${avg}%`;
          }
          case 'redundancy_rate': {
            const red = ex.reduce((s,e)=>s+(e.redundant_calls||0),0);
            return `중복 호출(${red}) ÷ 전체 호출(${totalC}) × 100 = ${totalC?(red/totalC*100).toFixed(1):0}%`;
          }
          case 'failure_rate': {
            const fail = ex.reduce((s,e)=>s+(e.failed_calls||0),0);
            return `실패 호출(${fail}) ÷ 전체 호출(${totalC}) × 100 = ${totalC?(fail/totalC*100).toFixed(1):0}%`;
          }
          case 'avg_calls_per_task':
            return `전체 호출(${totalC}) ÷ 태스크 수(${n}) = ${n?(totalC/n).toFixed(1):0}회`;
          default: return '';
        }
      },
      filteredItems(k, ex) {
        const s = [...ex];
        if (k==='redundancy_rate')      return s.sort((a,b)=>(b.redundant_calls||0)-(a.redundant_calls||0));
        if (k==='failure_rate'||k==='success_rate') return s.sort((a,b)=>(b.failed_calls||0)-(a.failed_calls||0));
        if (k==='avg_efficiency_score') return s.sort((a,b)=>(a.efficiency_score||0)-(b.efficiency_score||0));
        return s.sort((a,b)=>(b.total_calls||0)-(a.total_calls||0));
      },
      filterLabel(k) {
        if (k==='redundancy_rate')      return '중복 호출 많은 순';
        if (k==='failure_rate'||k==='success_rate') return '실패 호출 많은 순';
        if (k==='avg_efficiency_score') return '효율성 낮은 순';
        return '총 호출 많은 순';
      },
      hlCol(k) {
        if (k==='redundancy_rate')      return 'red';
        if (k==='failure_rate'||k==='success_rate') return 'fail';
        if (k==='avg_efficiency_score') return 'eff';
        return 'total';
      },
      fmtKpiVal(k) {
        const te = data.agentic?.tool_efficiency||{};
        if (k==='total_calls')        return te.total_calls||0;
        if (k==='avg_calls_per_task') return (te.avg_calls_per_task||0).toFixed(1)+'회';
        return pct(te[k]);
      }
    }">
      <div x-show="!data.agentic?.tool_efficiency?.total_calls" class="empty es"><p>Tool Efficiency 데이터 없음</p></div>
      <div x-show="data.agentic?.tool_efficiency?.total_calls">
        <!-- KPI 카드 -->
        <div class="kpi-grid">
          <template x-for="[k,m] in Object.entries(meta)" :key="k">
            <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK===k}" @click="selK=selK===k?null:k" style="cursor:pointer">
              <div class="kpi-lbl" x-text="m.label"></div>
              <div class="kpi-val"
                :style="k==='redundancy_rate'?`color:${(data.agentic?.tool_efficiency?.redundancy_rate||0)>0?'var(--yellow)':'var(--green)'}`:k==='failure_rate'?'color:var(--red)':''"
                x-text="fmtKpiVal(k)"></div>
              <div class="kpi-sub" style="color:var(--text2)" x-text="m.desc"></div>
            </div>
          </template>
        </div>

        <!-- 상세 패널 (클릭 시 펼침) -->
        {% call kpi_detail_panel(
            "fmtKpiVal(selK)",
            "data.agentic?.tool_call_executions||[]",
            "관련 태스크"
        ) %}
          <!-- 헤더 행 -->
          <div class="dtx-row dtx-head" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 72px 72px 72px 72px 80px">
            <span>Task ID</span>
            <span :style="`text-align:center;${hlCol(selK)==='total'?'color:var(--accent)':''}`">총 호출</span>
            <span style="text-align:center">고유 도구</span>
            <span :style="`text-align:center;${hlCol(selK)==='red'?'color:var(--accent)':''}`">중복</span>
            <span :style="`text-align:center;${hlCol(selK)==='fail'?'color:var(--accent)':''}`">실패</span>
            <span :style="`text-align:right;${hlCol(selK)==='eff'?'color:var(--accent)':''}`">효율성</span>
          </div>
          <!-- 데이터 행 -->
          <template x-for="e in filteredItems(selK, data.agentic?.tool_call_executions||[])" :key="e.task_id">
            <div class="dtx-row" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 72px 72px 72px 72px 80px">
              <span class="dtx-id" x-text="e.task_id"></span>
              <span :style="`text-align:center;${hlCol(selK)==='total'?'font-weight:600':''}`"
                    x-text="e.total_calls||0"></span>
              <span style="text-align:center;color:var(--text2)"
                    x-text="e.unique_tools||0"></span>
              <span :style="`text-align:center;${hlCol(selK)==='red'?'font-weight:600':''}`">
                <span :style="(e.redundant_calls||0)>0?'color:var(--yellow)':'color:var(--text2)'"
                      x-text="e.redundant_calls||0"></span>
              </span>
              <span :style="`text-align:center;${hlCol(selK)==='fail'?'font-weight:600':''}`">
                <span :style="(e.failed_calls||0)>0?'color:var(--red)':'color:var(--text2)'"
                      x-text="e.failed_calls||0"></span>
              </span>
              <span :style="`text-align:right;${hlCol(selK)==='eff'?'font-weight:600':''}`">
                <span :class="(e.efficiency_score||0)>=90?'badge-ok':(e.efficiency_score||0)>=70?'badge-warn':'badge-ng'" class="pill"
                      x-text="(e.efficiency_score||0).toFixed(0)+'%'"></span>
              </span>
            </div>
          </template>
        {% endcall %}

        <div class="cbox" style="margin-top:10px"><div class="ct">Tool 효율성 지표 비교</div><div id="teff-bar" class="plt-chart"></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>


    <!-- Retry -->
    <div x-show="t2==='retry'" x-data="{
      selK: null,
      meta: {
        '__total':               {label:'재시도 기록',         unit:'건', desc:'재시도 이벤트가 기록된 총 건수입니다.', hint:'재시도가 발생한 모든 시도를 기록한 절대 건수 — 태스크 수가 아닌 이벤트 수입니다.'},
        total_tasks_with_retries:{label:'재시도 태스크 수',    unit:'건', desc:'재시도가 1회 이상 발생한 태스크 수입니다.', hint:'값이 클수록 에이전트가 많은 태스크에서 첫 시도에 실패했음을 나타냅니다.'},
        retry_rate:              {label:'재시도율',            unit:'%',  desc:'전체 태스크 중 재시도가 발생한 비율입니다.', hint:'낮을수록 좋습니다. 20% 이하를 목표로 합니다. 높으면 에이전트 첫 응답 신뢰도를 점검하세요.'},
        first_attempt_success_rate:{label:'첫 시도 성공률',   unit:'%',  desc:'재시도 없이 첫 번째 시도에서 성공한 비율입니다.', hint:'높을수록 좋습니다. 80% 이상이 이상적입니다. Eventual Success Rate와의 차이가 클수록 재시도 의존도가 높습니다.'},
        eventual_success_rate:   {label:'최종 성공률',         unit:'%',  desc:'재시도를 포함한 최종 성공 비율입니다.', hint:'First Attempt Success Rate와의 차이가 재시도로 회복된 비율입니다. 두 값이 가까울수록 에이전트 신뢰도가 높습니다.'},
        retry_success_count:     {label:'재시도 성공 건수',    unit:'건', desc:'재시도를 통해 최종 성공으로 전환된 태스크 수입니다.', hint:'자기 교정 능력을 나타내는 절대 건수입니다. Correction Success Rate와 함께 해석하세요.'},
        correction_success_rate: {label:'수정 성공률',         unit:'%',  desc:'에러 발생 후 수정 재시도에서 성공한 비율입니다.', hint:'높을수록 에이전트의 자기 교정 능력이 우수합니다. 낮으면 프롬프트 개선 또는 에러 핸들링 로직 검토가 필요합니다.'},
        avg_attempts_per_task:   {label:'태스크당 평균 시도',  unit:'회', desc:'태스크 하나를 완료하기까지 평균 시도 횟수입니다.', hint:'1.0이 이상적입니다. 2.0을 초과하면 재시도 비용·지연이 유의미하게 증가합니다.'},
        total_retry_time:        {label:'총 재시도 소요시간',  unit:'s',  desc:'모든 재시도에 소요된 총 시간(초)입니다.', hint:'재시도로 인한 전체 지연 오버헤드를 파악합니다. Avg Retry Time과 함께 단위 비용을 계산하세요.'},
        avg_retry_time:          {label:'평균 재시도 시간',    unit:'s',  desc:'재시도 1회당 평균 소요 시간(초)입니다.', hint:'낮을수록 좋습니다. 높으면 재시도 자체가 지연·비용을 크게 증가시킵니다.'},
        overall_retry_rate:      {label:'전체 재시도율',       unit:'%',  desc:'전체 시도 횟수 기준 재시도 비율입니다.', hint:'Retry Rate(태스크 기준)와 달리 시도 횟수 기준으로 계산됩니다. 두 값의 차이로 태스크당 재시도 집중도를 파악할 수 있습니다.'},
        avg_retries_per_task:    {label:'태스크당 평균 재시도', unit:'회', desc:'태스크 하나당 평균 재시도 횟수입니다.', hint:'0에 가까울수록 좋습니다. Avg Attempts Per Task − 1과 유사합니다.'},
      },
      calcFormula(k, ra) {
        if (!ra || !ra.length) return '';
        const total = ra.length;
        const withRetry = ra.filter(a=>(a.total_attempts||1)>1).length;
        const firstOk   = ra.filter(a=>a.first_attempt_success).length;
        const finalOk   = ra.filter(a=>a.final_success).length;
        const retryOk   = ra.filter(a=>!a.first_attempt_success && a.final_success).length;
        const totalAtt  = ra.reduce((s,a)=>s+(a.total_attempts||1),0);
        const totalTime = ra.reduce((s,a)=>s+(a.total_retry_time||0),0);
        const retries   = totalAtt - total;
        switch(k) {
          case '__total':               return `기록된 이벤트 수 = ${total}건`;
          case 'total_tasks_with_retries': return `total_attempts > 1인 태스크 수 = ${withRetry}건`;
          case 'retry_rate':            return `재시도 발생(${withRetry}) ÷ 전체 태스크(${total}) × 100 = ${(withRetry/total*100).toFixed(1)}%`;
          case 'first_attempt_success_rate': return `첫 시도 성공(${firstOk}) ÷ 전체 태스크(${total}) × 100 = ${(firstOk/total*100).toFixed(1)}%`;
          case 'eventual_success_rate': return `최종 성공(${finalOk}) ÷ 전체 태스크(${total}) × 100 = ${(finalOk/total*100).toFixed(1)}%`;
          case 'retry_success_count':   return `첫 시도 실패 & 최종 성공 태스크 = ${retryOk}건`;
          case 'correction_success_rate': return `재시도 성공(${retryOk}) ÷ 재시도 발생(${withRetry}) × 100 = ${withRetry?((retryOk/withRetry)*100).toFixed(1):0}%`;
          case 'avg_attempts_per_task': return `총 시도 횟수(${totalAtt}) ÷ 전체 태스크(${total}) = ${(totalAtt/total).toFixed(2)}회`;
          case 'total_retry_time':      return `모든 재시도 소요 시간 합계 = ${totalTime.toFixed(1)}s`;
          case 'avg_retry_time': {
            const rtTasks = ra.filter(a=>(a.total_attempts||1)>1);
            const rtSum = rtTasks.reduce((s,a)=>s+(a.total_retry_time||0),0);
            return `재시도 발생 태스크 합계(${rtSum.toFixed(1)}s) ÷ 재시도 발생(${rtTasks.length}) = ${rtTasks.length?(rtSum/rtTasks.length).toFixed(2):0}s`;
          }
          case 'overall_retry_rate':    return `재시도 횟수(${retries}) ÷ 총 시도 횟수(${totalAtt}) × 100 = ${totalAtt?((retries/totalAtt)*100).toFixed(1):0}%`;
          case 'avg_retries_per_task':  return `총 재시도 횟수(${retries}) ÷ 전체 태스크(${total}) = ${(retries/total).toFixed(2)}회`;
          default: return '';
        }
      },
      filterLabel(k) {
        const m = {
          '__total':'전체 태스크',
          'total_tasks_with_retries':'재시도 발생 태스크만',
          'retry_rate':'재시도 발생 태스크 — 시도 횟수 내림차순',
          'first_attempt_success_rate':'첫 시도 결과 기준 정렬 (실패 우선)',
          'eventual_success_rate':'최종 결과 기준 정렬 (실패 우선)',
          'retry_success_count':'첫 시도 실패 태스크만 (최종 성공 우선)',
          'correction_success_rate':'첫 시도 실패 태스크만 (최종 성공 우선)',
          'avg_attempts_per_task':'시도 횟수 내림차순',
          'total_retry_time':'재시도 소요시간 내림차순',
          'avg_retry_time':'재시도 소요시간 내림차순',
          'overall_retry_rate':'전체 태스크 — 시도 횟수 내림차순',
          'avg_retries_per_task':'시도 횟수 내림차순',
        };
        return m[k]||'전체 태스크';
      },
      filteredItems(k, ra) {
        if (!ra||!ra.length) return [];
        const s = [...ra];
        if (['retry_success_count','correction_success_rate'].includes(k))
          return s.filter(a=>!a.first_attempt_success).sort((a,b)=>(b.final_success?1:0)-(a.final_success?1:0));
        if (['total_tasks_with_retries'].includes(k))
          return s.filter(a=>(a.total_attempts||1)>1).sort((a,b)=>(b.total_attempts||1)-(a.total_attempts||1));
        if (['first_attempt_success_rate'].includes(k))
          return s.sort((a,b)=>(a.first_attempt_success?1:0)-(b.first_attempt_success?1:0));
        if (['eventual_success_rate'].includes(k))
          return s.sort((a,b)=>(a.final_success?1:0)-(b.final_success?1:0));
        if (['total_retry_time','avg_retry_time'].includes(k))
          return s.sort((a,b)=>(b.total_retry_time||0)-(a.total_retry_time||0));
        return s.filter(a=>(a.total_attempts||1)>1).sort((a,b)=>(b.total_attempts||1)-(a.total_attempts||1));
      },
      hlCol(k) {
        if (['first_attempt_success_rate'].includes(k)) return 'first';
        if (['eventual_success_rate','retry_success_count','correction_success_rate'].includes(k)) return 'final';
        if (['total_retry_time','avg_retry_time'].includes(k)) return 'time';
        return 'attempts';
      }
    }">
      <div class="kpi-grid">
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='__total'}" @click="selK=selK==='__total'?null:'__total'">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">재시도 기록</div>
          <div class="kpi-val" x-text="(data.agentic?.retry_attempts||[]).length"></div>
          <div class="kpi-sub" style="color:var(--text2)">이벤트 총 건수</div>
        </div>
        <template x-for="[k,v] in Object.entries(data.agentic?.retry_summary||{})" :key="k">
          <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK===k}" @click="selK=selK===k?null:k">
            <div class="kpi-lbl" x-text="meta[k]?.label || k.replace(/_/g,' ').toUpperCase()"></div>
            <div class="kpi-val" x-text="typeof v==='number'?v.toFixed(1):v"></div>
            <div class="kpi-sub" style="color:var(--text2)" x-text="meta[k]?.desc || ''"></div>
          </div>
        </template>
      </div>

      {% call kpi_detail_panel(
          "selK==='__total'?(data.agentic?.retry_attempts||[]).length:typeof (data.agentic?.retry_summary||{})[selK]==='number'?(data.agentic?.retry_summary||{})[selK].toFixed(1):((data.agentic?.retry_summary||{})[selK]??'—')",
          "data.agentic?.retry_attempts||[]",
          "관련 태스크"
      ) %}
        <!-- 헤더 행 -->
        <div class="dtx-row dtx-head" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 90px 100px 100px 90px">
          <span>Task ID</span>
          <span :style="`text-align:center;${hlCol(selK)==='attempts'?'color:var(--accent)':''}`">시도 횟수</span>
          <span :style="`text-align:center;${hlCol(selK)==='first'?'color:var(--accent)':''}`">첫 시도</span>
          <span :style="`text-align:center;${hlCol(selK)==='final'?'color:var(--accent)':''}`">최종 결과</span>
          <span :style="`text-align:right;${hlCol(selK)==='time'?'color:var(--accent)':''}`">재시도 시간</span>
        </div>
        <!-- 데이터 행 -->
        <template x-for="a in filteredItems(selK, data.agentic?.retry_attempts||[])" :key="a.task_id">
          <div class="dtx-row" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 90px 100px 100px 90px">
            <span class="dtx-id" x-text="a.task_id"></span>
            <span style="text-align:center">
              <span :style="(a.total_attempts||1)>=3?'color:var(--red);font-weight:600':(a.total_attempts||1)===2?'color:var(--orange)':'color:var(--green)'"
                    x-text="(a.total_attempts||1)+'회'"></span>
            </span>
            <span :style="`text-align:center;${hlCol(selK)==='first'?'font-weight:600':''}`">
              <span :style="a.first_attempt_success?'color:var(--green)':'color:var(--red)'" x-text="a.first_attempt_success?'✅ 성공':'❌ 실패'"></span>
            </span>
            <span :style="`text-align:center;${hlCol(selK)==='final'?'font-weight:600':''}`">
              <span :style="a.final_success?'color:var(--green)':'color:var(--red)'" x-text="a.final_success?'✅ 성공':'❌ 실패'"></span>
            </span>
            <span :style="`text-align:right;${hlCol(selK)==='time'?'color:var(--accent);font-weight:600':''}`"
                  x-text="(a.total_retry_time||0).toFixed(1)+'s'"></span>
          </div>
        </template>
      {% endcall %}

      <div class="sec" x-show="(data.agentic?.retry_attempts||[]).length===0">
        <div style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text2)">재시도 기록 없음 (재시도가 발생한 태스크가 없거나 TrackerRetry가 비활성화됨)</div>
      </div>
      <div x-show="(data.agentic?.retry_attempts||[]).length>0" class="cg" style="margin-top:20px">
        <div class="cbox"><div class="ct">시도 횟수 분포</div><div id="l2-retry-dist" class="plt-chart"></div></div>
        <div class="cbox"><div class="ct">태스크 유형별 평균 시도 횟수</div><div id="l2-retry-type" class="plt-chart"></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ── 심화 티어 ── -->
  <div x-show="tag==='advanced'">
    <div class="tabs">
      <div class="tab" :class="{on:t2==='tsel'}"    @click="t2='tsel'">🎯 Tool 선택</div>
      <div class="tab" :class="{on:t2==='coord'}"   @click="t2='coord'">🤝 멀티에이전트</div>
      <div class="tab" :class="{on:t2==='wf'}"      @click="t2='wf'">🔀 워크플로우</div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tool Selection -->
    <div x-show="t2==='tsel'"
      x-data="{
        selK: null,
        meta: {
          avg_precision: {label:'평균 PRECISION', unit:'%',
            desc:'실제 선택한 도구 중 정답(expected)인 도구의 비율입니다.',
            hint:'높을수록 불필요한 도구 호출이 적습니다. 90% 이상이 이상적입니다.',
            formula_key:'precision'},
          avg_recall: {label:'평균 RECALL', unit:'%',
            desc:'필요한 도구(expected) 중 실제로 선택한 도구의 비율입니다.',
            hint:'높을수록 필요한 도구를 빠짐없이 선택하고 있습니다. 90% 이상이 이상적입니다.',
            formula_key:'recall'},
          avg_f1_score: {label:'평균 F1', unit:'%',
            desc:'Precision과 Recall의 조화평균입니다. 도구 선택의 종합 성능 지표입니다.',
            hint:'두 지표를 균형 있게 반영합니다. 87% 이상이 양호한 수준입니다.',
            formula_key:'f1_score'},
          avg_accuracy: {label:'평균 ACCURACY', unit:'%',
            desc:'각 태스크의 도구 선택 정확도(F1과 동일)의 평균입니다.',
            hint:'현재 구현에서 Accuracy는 F1 Score와 동일하게 계산됩니다.',
            formula_key:'accuracy'},
          total_selections: {label:'평가 TASKS', unit:'건',
            desc:'Tool Selection이 평가된 총 태스크 수입니다.',
            hint:'',
            formula_key:null}
        },
        calcFormula(k, ts) {
          const sm = data.agentic?.tool_selection_summary||{};
          const n = ts.length;
          if (!n) return '데이터 없음';
          switch(k) {
            case 'avg_precision': {
              const totalTP = ts.reduce((s,t)=>s+(t.true_positives||0),0);
              const totalAct = ts.reduce((s,t)=>s+(t.actual_tools||[]).length,0);
              return `태스크별 Precision 평균: Σ(TP/실제선택) ÷ N = ${sm.avg_precision}%\n예: TP합계(${totalTP}) / 실제선택합계(${totalAct}) ≈ ${totalAct?((totalTP/totalAct)*100).toFixed(1):0}%`;
            }
            case 'avg_recall': {
              const totalTP = ts.reduce((s,t)=>s+(t.true_positives||0),0);
              const totalExp = ts.reduce((s,t)=>s+(t.expected_tools||[]).length,0);
              return `태스크별 Recall 평균: Σ(TP/기대도구) ÷ N = ${sm.avg_recall}%\n예: TP합계(${totalTP}) / 기대도구합계(${totalExp}) ≈ ${totalExp?((totalTP/totalExp)*100).toFixed(1):0}%`;
            }
            case 'avg_f1_score': {
              const p = sm.avg_precision||0, r = sm.avg_recall||0;
              const f1 = (p+r)>0 ? (2*p*r/(p+r)).toFixed(1) : 0;
              return `2 × Precision(${p}%) × Recall(${r}%) ÷ (Precision + Recall) = ${f1}%`;
            }
            case 'avg_accuracy':
              return `각 태스크의 F1 Score를 평균: Σ(F1_i) ÷ ${n} = ${sm.avg_accuracy}%\n(현재 구현에서 Accuracy = F1)`;
            case 'total_selections':
              return `Tool Selection 평가가 완료된 태스크 수: ${n}건`;
            default: return '';
          }
        },
        filteredItems(k, ts) {
          const s = [...ts];
          const fk = this.meta[k]?.formula_key;
          if (!fk || k==='total_selections') return s.sort((a,b)=>(b.f1_score||0)-(a.f1_score||0));
          return s.sort((a,b)=>(a[fk]||0)-(b[fk]||0));
        },
        filterLabel(k) { return '낮은 점수 우선 정렬'; },
        hlCol(k) {
          const fk = this.meta[k]?.formula_key;
          if (fk==='precision') return 'prec';
          if (fk==='recall') return 'rec';
          if (fk==='f1_score'||fk==='accuracy') return 'f1';
          return '';
        }
      }">
      <div x-show="!data.agentic?.tool_selections?.length" class="empty es"><p>Tool Selection 데이터 없음 — expected_tools를 설정하세요.</p></div>
      <div x-show="data.agentic?.tool_selections?.length>0">
        <!-- KPI 카드 -->
        <div class="kpi-grid">
          <template x-for="[k,m] in Object.entries(meta)" :key="k">
            <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK===k}" @click="selK=selK===k?null:k" style="cursor:pointer">
              <div class="kpi-lbl" x-text="m.label"></div>
              <div class="kpi-val"
                x-text="k==='total_selections'
                  ?(data.agentic?.tool_selection_summary?.total_selections??0)
                  :pct(data.agentic?.tool_selection_summary?.[k])">
              </div>
              <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:4px;line-height:1.4" x-text="m.desc"></div>
            </div>
          </template>
        </div>

        <!-- 상세 패널 (클릭 시 펼침) -->
        {% call kpi_detail_panel(
            "selK==='total_selections'?(data.agentic?.tool_selection_summary?.total_selections??0)+'건':pct(data.agentic?.tool_selection_summary?.[selK])",
            "data.agentic?.tool_selections||[]",
            "관련 태스크"
        ) %}
          <!-- 헤더 행 -->
          <div class="dtx-row dtx-head" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 160px 160px 72px 72px 68px">
            <span>Task ID</span>
            <span>기대 도구</span>
            <span>실제 도구</span>
            <span :style="`text-align:center;${hlCol(selK)==='prec'?'color:var(--accent)':''}`">Precision</span>
            <span :style="`text-align:center;${hlCol(selK)==='rec'?'color:var(--accent)':''}`">Recall</span>
            <span :style="`text-align:right;${hlCol(selK)==='f1'?'color:var(--accent)':''}`">F1</span>
          </div>
          <!-- 데이터 행 -->
          <template x-for="s in filteredItems(selK, data.agentic?.tool_selections||[])" :key="s.task_id">
            <div class="dtx-row" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 160px 160px 72px 72px 68px">
              <span class="dtx-id" x-text="s.task_id"></span>
              <span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap"
                    x-text="(s.expected_tools||[]).join(', ')||'—'"></span>
              <span style="font-size:11px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap"
                    x-text="(s.actual_tools||[]).join(', ')||'—'"></span>
              <span :style="`text-align:center;${hlCol(selK)==='prec'?'font-weight:600':''}`">
                <span :style="(s.precision||0)>=90?'color:var(--green)':(s.precision||0)>=70?'color:var(--yellow)':'color:var(--red)'"
                      x-text="(s.precision||0).toFixed(0)+'%'"></span>
              </span>
              <span :style="`text-align:center;${hlCol(selK)==='rec'?'font-weight:600':''}`">
                <span :style="(s.recall||0)>=90?'color:var(--green)':(s.recall||0)>=70?'color:var(--yellow)':'color:var(--red)'"
                      x-text="(s.recall||0).toFixed(0)+'%'"></span>
              </span>
              <span :style="`text-align:right;${hlCol(selK)==='f1'?'font-weight:600':''}`">
                <span :class="(s.f1_score||0)>=90?'badge-ok':(s.f1_score||0)>=70?'badge-warn':'badge-ng'" class="pill"
                      x-text="(s.f1_score||0).toFixed(0)+'%'"></span>
              </span>
            </div>
          </template>
        {% endcall %}

        <!-- 전체 태스크 목록 (상세 미선택 시) -->
        <div class="sec" x-show="!selK">
          <div class="sec-t">태스크별 Tool Selection 상세</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px">
            <div class="dtx-row dtx-head" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 200px 72px 72px 68px">
              <span>Task ID</span>
              <span>기대 도구</span>
              <span style="text-align:center">Precision</span>
              <span style="text-align:center">Recall</span>
              <span style="text-align:right">F1</span>
            </div>
            <template x-for="s in data.agentic?.tool_selections||[]" :key="s.task_id">
              <div class="dtx-row" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 200px 72px 72px 68px">
                <span class="dtx-id" x-text="s.task_id"></span>
                <span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap"
                      x-text="(s.expected_tools||[]).join(', ')||'—'"></span>
                <span style="text-align:center">
                  <span :style="(s.precision||0)>=90?'color:var(--green)':(s.precision||0)>=70?'color:var(--yellow)':'color:var(--red)'"
                        x-text="(s.precision||0).toFixed(0)+'%'"></span>
                </span>
                <span style="text-align:center">
                  <span :style="(s.recall||0)>=90?'color:var(--green)':(s.recall||0)>=70?'color:var(--yellow)':'color:var(--red)'"
                        x-text="(s.recall||0).toFixed(0)+'%'"></span>
                </span>
                <span style="text-align:right">
                  <span :class="(s.f1_score||0)>=90?'badge-ok':(s.f1_score||0)>=70?'badge-warn':'badge-ng'" class="pill"
                        x-text="'F1:'+(s.f1_score||0).toFixed(0)+'%'"></span>
                </span>
              </div>
            </template>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Multi-Agent Coordination -->
    <div x-show="t2==='coord'"
      x-data="{
        selK: null,
        meta: {
          total_interactions: {label:'총 상호작용', unit:'건',
            desc:'에이전트 간 발생한 전체 상호작용(위임·통신·협업) 횟수입니다. 태스크 수가 아닌 이벤트 수이며, 태스크 1개에 여러 상호작용이 기록될 수 있습니다.',
            hint:'상호작용 수가 많을수록 복잡한 멀티에이전트 협업이 이루어지고 있음을 나타냅니다.'},
          successful_interactions: {label:'성공 상호작용', unit:'건',
            desc:'성공으로 완료된 상호작용의 수입니다. 태스크 수가 아닌 이벤트 수입니다.',
            hint:'성공 비율이 낮으면 에이전트 간 통신 오류나 위임 실패가 잦음을 의미합니다.'},
          success_rate: {label:'성공률', unit:'%',
            desc:'전체 상호작용 중 성공한 비율입니다.',
            hint:'90% 이상이 이상적입니다. 낮은 성공률은 에이전트 협업 설계를 재검토해야 함을 의미합니다.'},
          unique_agents: {label:'참여 에이전트', unit:'개',
            desc:'상호작용에 참여한 고유 에이전트의 수입니다.',
            hint:'에이전트 수가 많을수록 분산 처리 능력이 높지만 조율 복잡도도 증가합니다.'}
        },
        calcFormula(k, ia) {
          const sm = data.agentic?.coordination_summary||{};
          const total = ia.length;
          if (!total) return '데이터 없음';
          const succ = ia.filter(i=>i.success).length;
          const agents = new Set();
          ia.forEach(i=>{ if(i.from_agent) agents.add(i.from_agent); if(i.to_agent) agents.add(i.to_agent); });
          switch(k) {
            case 'total_interactions':
              return `기록된 에이전트 간 상호작용 총 합계: ${total}건`;
            case 'successful_interactions':
              return `success=true 인 상호작용 합계: ${succ}건 / 전체 ${total}건`;
            case 'success_rate':
              return `성공(${succ}) ÷ 전체(${total}) × 100 = ${total?(succ/total*100).toFixed(1):0}%`;
            case 'unique_agents':
              return `from_agent + to_agent 합집합 고유값: ${agents.size}개\n[${[...agents].join(', ')}]`;
            default: return '';
          }
        },
        filteredItems(k, ia) {
          const s = [...ia];
          if (k==='successful_interactions') return s.filter(i=>i.success);
          if (k==='success_rate') return s.filter(i=>!i.success);
          return s;
        },
        filterLabel(k) {
          if (k==='successful_interactions') return '성공 상호작용만 표시';
          if (k==='success_rate') return '실패 상호작용 우선';
          return '전체 상호작용';
        },
        hlCol(k) {
          if (k==='successful_interactions'||k==='success_rate') return 'result';
          if (k==='unique_agents') return 'agents';
          return '';
        }
      }">
      <div x-show="!data.agentic?.agent_interactions?.length" class="empty es"><p>Multi-Agent 데이터 없음</p></div>
      <div x-show="data.agentic?.agent_interactions?.length>0">
        <!-- KPI 카드 -->
        <div class="kpi-grid">
          <template x-for="[k,m] in Object.entries(meta)" :key="k">
            <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK===k}" @click="selK=selK===k?null:k" style="cursor:pointer">
              <div class="kpi-lbl" x-text="m.label"></div>
              <div class="kpi-val"
                x-text="k==='success_rate'
                  ?pct(data.agentic?.coordination_summary?.[k])
                  :(data.agentic?.coordination_summary?.[k]??0)">
              </div>
              <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:4px;line-height:1.4" x-text="m.desc"></div>
            </div>
          </template>
        </div>

        <!-- 상세 패널 (클릭 시 펼침) -->
        {% call kpi_detail_panel(
            "selK==='success_rate'?pct(data.agentic?.coordination_summary?.[selK]):(data.agentic?.coordination_summary?.[selK]??0)+(meta[selK]?.unit||'')",
            "data.agentic?.agent_interactions||[]",
            "관련 상호작용"
        ) %}
          <!-- 헤더 행 -->
          <div class="dtx-row dtx-head" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 130px 130px 100px 72px">
            <span>Task ID</span>
            <span :style="`${hlCol(selK)==='agents'?'color:var(--accent)':''}`">From</span>
            <span :style="`${hlCol(selK)==='agents'?'color:var(--accent)':''}`">To</span>
            <span>유형</span>
            <span :style="`text-align:center;${hlCol(selK)==='result'?'color:var(--accent)':''}`">결과</span>
          </div>
          <!-- 데이터 행 -->
          <template x-for="(i,idx) in filteredItems(selK, data.agentic?.agent_interactions||[]).slice(0,50)" :key="idx">
            <div class="dtx-row" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 130px 130px 100px 72px">
              <span class="dtx-id" x-text="i.task_id||'—'"></span>
              <span :style="`overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;${hlCol(selK)==='agents'?'color:var(--accent);font-weight:600':''}`"
                    x-text="i.from_agent||'—'"></span>
              <span :style="`overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;${hlCol(selK)==='agents'?'font-weight:600':''}`"
                    x-text="i.to_agent||'—'"></span>
              <span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2)" x-text="i.interaction_type||'—'"></span>
              <span :style="`text-align:center;${hlCol(selK)==='result'?'font-weight:600':''}`">
                <span :class="i.success?'badge-ok':'badge-ng'" class="pill" x-text="i.success?'✅ 성공':'❌ 실패'"></span>
              </span>
            </div>
          </template>
        {% endcall %}

        <!-- 에이전트 목록 태그 -->
        <div class="sec" x-show="!selK">
          <div class="sec-t">참여 에이전트 목록</div>
          <template x-for="a in data.agentic?.coordination_summary?.agent_list||[]" :key="a">
            <span class="tag" x-text="a"></span>
          </template>
        </div>

        <!-- 네트워크 차트 -->
        <div class="sec" x-show="(data.agentic?.agent_interactions||[]).length>1">
          <div class="sec-t">🕸️ 에이전트 상호작용 네트워크</div>
          <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:8px">노드: 에이전트 | 엣지 두께: 상호작용 횟수 | 색상: 성공률</p>
          <div class="cbox"><div id="agent-network" class="plt-chart" :style="`height:${Math.max(380, Math.min(560, (data.agentic?.agent_interactions?.length||0)*12+260)}px`"></div></div>
        </div>

        <!-- 전체 상호작용 로그 (미선택 시) -->
        <div class="sec" x-show="!selK">
          <div class="sec-t">상호작용 로그 <span class="badge" x-text="`${(data.agentic?.agent_interactions||[]).length}건`"></span></div>
          <div style="font-size:12px">
            <div class="dtx-row dtx-head" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 130px 130px 100px 72px">
              <span>Task ID</span>
              <span>From</span>
              <span>To</span>
              <span>유형</span>
              <span style="text-align:center">결과</span>
            </div>
            <template x-for="(i,idx) in (data.agentic?.agent_interactions||[]).slice(0,50)" :key="idx">
              <div class="dtx-row" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 130px 130px 100px 72px">
                <span class="dtx-id" x-text="i.task_id||'—'"></span>
                <span style="color:var(--accent);overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap" x-text="i.from_agent||'—'"></span>
                <span style="overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap" x-text="i.to_agent||'—'"></span>
                <span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2)" x-text="i.interaction_type||'—'"></span>
                <span style="text-align:center">
                  <span :class="i.success?'badge-ok':'badge-ng'" class="pill" x-text="i.success?'✅ 성공':'❌ 실패'"></span>
                </span>
              </div>
            </template>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Workflow -->
    <div x-show="t2==='wf'"
      x-data="{
        selK: null,
        meta: {
          total_steps: {label:'총 스텝', unit:'건',
            desc:'워크플로우 전체에서 실행된 스텝(노드)의 합계입니다.',
            hint:'스텝 수가 많을수록 복잡한 워크플로우입니다. 실패 스텝이 포함될 수 있습니다.',
            filter:'all'},
          successful_steps: {label:'성공 스텝', unit:'건',
            desc:'성공적으로 완료된 스텝의 수입니다.',
            hint:'성공 스텝 수가 총 스텝에 가까울수록 안정적인 워크플로우입니다.',
            filter:'success'},
          step_success_rate: {label:'스텝 성공률', unit:'%',
            desc:'전체 스텝 중 성공한 스텝의 비율입니다.',
            hint:'90% 이상이 이상적입니다. 낮은 성공률은 특정 스텝에서 반복 실패가 발생함을 의미합니다.',
            filter:'failed'},
          total_tasks: {label:'워크플로우 태스크', unit:'건',
            desc:'chain_steps가 기록된 고유 태스크 수입니다. 전체 태스크 중 워크플로우가 실행된 태스크만 집계됩니다.',
            hint:'전체 태스크 수와 다를 수 있습니다 — chain_steps 필드가 없는 태스크는 포함되지 않습니다.',
            filter:'all'},
          task_success_rate: {label:'워크플로우 완료율', unit:'%',
            desc:'모든 스텝이 성공한 태스크의 비율입니다. 단 하나의 스텝이라도 실패하면 해당 태스크는 미완료로 처리됩니다.',
            hint:'스텝 성공률보다 낮으면 단 하나의 실패 스텝으로 전체 태스크가 실패하는 구조임을 의미합니다.',
            filter:'failed_task'}
        },
        calcFormula(k, we) {
          const sm = data.agentic?.workflow_summary||{};
          const total = we.length;
          if (!total) return '데이터 없음';
          const succ = we.filter(s=>s.success).length;
          switch(k) {
            case 'total_steps':
              return `기록된 워크플로우 스텝 합계: ${total}건`;
            case 'successful_steps':
              return `success=true 인 스텝 합계: ${succ}건 / 전체 ${total}건`;
            case 'step_success_rate':
              return `성공 스텝(${succ}) ÷ 전체 스텝(${total}) × 100 = ${(succ/total*100).toFixed(1)}%`;
            case 'total_tasks': {
              const tasks = new Set(we.map(s=>s.task_id)).size;
              return `task_id 기준 고유 태스크 수: ${tasks}건`;
            }
            case 'task_success_rate': {
              const tg = {};
              we.forEach(s=>{ const t=s.task_id||'_'; (tg[t]=tg[t]||[]).push(s); });
              const tcount = Object.keys(tg).length;
              const tfull = Object.values(tg).filter(steps=>steps.every(s=>s.success)).length;
              return `전체 스텝 성공 태스크(${tfull}) ÷ 전체 태스크(${tcount}) × 100 = ${tcount?(tfull/tcount*100).toFixed(1):0}%`;
            }
            default: return '';
          }
        },
        filteredItems(k, we) {
          const filter = this.meta[k]?.filter||'all';
          if (filter==='success') return we.filter(s=>s.success);
          if (filter==='failed') return we.filter(s=>!s.success);
          if (filter==='failed_task') {
            const tg = {};
            we.forEach(s=>{ const t=s.task_id||'_'; (tg[t]=tg[t]||[]).push(s); });
            const failedTasks = new Set(
              Object.entries(tg).filter(([,steps])=>steps.some(s=>!s.success)).map(([t])=>t)
            );
            return we.filter(s=>failedTasks.has(s.task_id||'_'));
          }
          return we;
        },
        filterLabel(k) {
          const f = this.meta[k]?.filter||'all';
          if (f==='success') return '성공 스텝만 표시';
          if (f==='failed') return '실패 스텝 우선';
          if (f==='failed_task') return '실패 태스크 스텝만 표시';
          return '전체 스텝';
        },
        hlCol(k) {
          if (k==='successful_steps'||k==='step_success_rate') return 'result';
          if (k==='task_success_rate'||k==='total_tasks') return 'task';
          return '';
        },
        fmtVal(k) {
          const sm = data.agentic?.workflow_summary||{};
          if (k==='step_success_rate'||k==='task_success_rate') return pct(sm[k]);
          return (sm[k]??0)+(this.meta[k]?.unit||'');
        }
      }">
      <div x-show="!data.agentic?.workflow_executions?.length" class="empty es"><p>Workflow 데이터 없음</p></div>
      <div x-show="data.agentic?.workflow_executions?.length>0">
        <!-- KPI 카드 -->
        <div class="kpi-grid">
          <template x-for="[k,m] in Object.entries(meta)" :key="k">
            <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK===k}" @click="selK=selK===k?null:k" style="cursor:pointer">
              <div class="kpi-lbl" x-text="m.label"></div>
              <div class="kpi-val"
                x-text="(k==='step_success_rate'||k==='task_success_rate')
                  ?pct(data.agentic?.workflow_summary?.[k])
                  :(data.agentic?.workflow_summary?.[k]??0)">
              </div>
              <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:4px;line-height:1.4" x-text="m.desc"></div>
            </div>
          </template>
        </div>

        <!-- 상세 패널 (클릭 시 펼침) -->
        {% call kpi_detail_panel(
            "fmtVal(selK)",
            "data.agentic?.workflow_executions||[]",
            "관련 스텝"
        ) %}
          <!-- 헤더 행 -->
          <div class="dtx-row dtx-head" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 150px 90px 90px 70px 72px">
            <span :style="`${hlCol(selK)==='task'?'color:var(--accent)':''}`">Task ID</span>
            <span>스텝 이름</span>
            <span>유형</span>
            <span>프레임워크</span>
            <span style="text-align:right">실행시간</span>
            <span :style="`text-align:center;${hlCol(selK)==='result'?'color:var(--accent)':''}`">결과</span>
          </div>
          <!-- 데이터 행 -->
          <template x-for="(s,idx) in filteredItems(selK, data.agentic?.workflow_executions||[]).slice(0,50)" :key="idx">
            <div class="dtx-row" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 150px 90px 90px 70px 72px">
              <span :style="`overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;${hlCol(selK)==='task'?'color:var(--accent);font-weight:600':'color:var(--text2)'}`"
                    x-text="s.task_id||'—'"></span>
              <span style="overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:500"
                    x-text="s.step_name||s.task_id||'—'"></span>
              <span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2)" x-text="s.step_type||'—'"></span>
              <span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2)" x-text="s.framework||'—'"></span>
              <span style="text-align:right;color:var(--text2)"
                    x-text="s.execution_time!=null?(+s.execution_time).toFixed(2)+'s':'—'"></span>
              <span :style="`text-align:center;${hlCol(selK)==='result'?'font-weight:600':''}`">
                <span :class="s.success?'badge-ok':'badge-ng'" class="pill" x-text="s.success?'✅ 성공':'❌ 실패'"></span>
              </span>
            </div>
          </template>
        {% endcall %}


        <!-- 워크플로우 퍼널 차트 -->
        <div class="sec" x-show="data.agentic?.workflow_summary">
          <div class="sec-t">🔀 워크플로우 실행 퍼널</div>
          <div id="l2-wf-funnel" style="height:200px"></div>
        </div>

        <!-- 전체 스텝 목록 (미선택 시) -->
        <div class="sec" x-show="!selK">
          <div class="sec-t">워크플로우 실행 스텝 <span class="badge" x-text="`${(data.agentic?.workflow_executions||[]).length}건`"></span></div>
          <div style="font-size:12px">
            <div class="dtx-row dtx-head" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 150px 90px 90px 70px 72px">
              <span>Task ID</span>
              <span>스텝 이름</span>
              <span>유형</span>
              <span>프레임워크</span>
              <span style="text-align:right">실행시간</span>
              <span style="text-align:center">결과</span>
            </div>
            <template x-for="(s,idx) in (data.agentic?.workflow_executions||[]).slice(0,50)" :key="idx">
              <div class="dtx-row" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 150px 90px 90px 70px 72px">
                <span style="overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--text2)"
                      x-text="s.task_id||'—'"></span>
                <span style="overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:500"
                      x-text="s.step_name||s.task_id||'—'"></span>
                <span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2)" x-text="s.step_type||'—'"></span>
                <span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2)" x-text="s.framework||'—'"></span>
                <span style="text-align:right;color:var(--text2)"
                      x-text="s.execution_time!=null?(+s.execution_time).toFixed(2)+'s':'—'"></span>
                <span style="text-align:center">
                  <span :class="s.success?'badge-ok':'badge-ng'" class="pill" x-text="s.success?'✅ 성공':'❌ 실패'"></span>
                </span>
              </div>
            </template>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- 🏗️ 프레임워크 정보 (워크플로우 탭) -->
    <div class="sec" x-show="tag==='advanced'&&t2==='wf'">
      <div class="sec-t">🏗️ 프레임워크 정보</div>
      <!-- 프레임워크 미설정 -->
      <div x-show="frameworkDist().every(f=>f.name==='unknown')" class="empty" style="padding:16px 0">
        <div style="font-size:24px;margin-bottom:6px">🔌</div>
        <p style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px">프레임워크 정보가 없습니다</p>
        <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:8px">TaskResult 또는 create_taskresult() 에 <code style="background:var(--bg3);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px">framework</code> 필드를 설정하면 여기에 표시됩니다.</p>
        <code style="display:block;background:var(--bg3);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:6px;font-size:13px;text-align:left;max-width:400px;margin:0 auto">create_taskresult(..., framework="crewai")</code>
      </div>
      <!-- 프레임워크 있음 -->
      <div x-show="frameworkDist().some(f=>f.name!=='unknown')">
        <table class="dt-card">
          <colgroup><col style="width:auto"><col style="width:72px"><col style="width:80px"><col style="width:80px"></colgroup>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>프레임워크</th>
              <th>태스크</th>
              <th>성공률</th>
              <th>비율</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <template x-for="fw in frameworkDist().filter(f=>f.name!=='unknown')" :key="fw.name">
              <tr>
                <td style="font-weight:500" x-text="fw.name"></td>
                <td x-text="fw.count"></td>
                <td :style="fw.rate>=80?'color:var(--green)':fw.rate>=50?'color:var(--yellow)':'color:var(--red)'"
                  x-text="fw.rate.toFixed(1)+'%'"></td>
                <td style="color:var(--text2)"
                  x-text="fw.pct.toFixed(1)+'%'"></td>
              </tr>
            </template>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ── 통합 티어 ── -->
  <div x-show="tag==='integrated'">
    <div class="sec">
      <div class="sec-t">🔍 오케스트레이션 트레이스</div>
      <!-- tool_calls 없음 -->
      <div x-show="!(data.tasks||[]).some(t=>(t.tool_calls||[]).length>0)" class="empty" style="padding:16px 0">
        <div style="font-size:24px;margin-bottom:6px">🔌</div>
        <p style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px">Tool 호출 기록이 없습니다</p>
        <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2)">TaskResult의 <code style="background:var(--bg3);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px">tool_calls</code> 필드에 데이터가 있을 때 인라인 트레이스가 표시됩니다.</p>
      </div>
      <!-- tool_calls 있음 -->
      <div x-show="(data.tasks||[]).some(t=>(t.tool_calls||[]).length>0)">
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:10px"
          x-text="`총 ${(data.tasks||[]).filter(t=>(t.tool_calls||[]).length>0).length}개 태스크에서 tool 호출 기록됨`"></div>
        <template x-for="t in (data.tasks||[]).filter(t=>(t.tool_calls||[]).length>0).slice(0,30)" :key="t.task_id">
          <div style="margin-bottom:10px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden">
            <!-- 태스크 헤더 -->
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;padding:7px 10px;background:var(--bg3);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)">
              <span :class="t.success?'badge-ok':'badge-ng'" class="pill" x-text="t.success?'✓':'✗'"></span>
              <span style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px" x-text="t.task_id"></span>
              <span class="tag" x-text="t.task_type"></span>
              <span style="margin-left:auto;color:var(--text2);font-size:13px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums" x-text="(t.execution_time||0).toFixed(2)+'s'"></span>
            </div>
            <!-- tool_calls 목록 -->
            <div x-data="{selTc:null}" style="padding:6px 10px 6px 16px;border-left:3px solid var(--accent);margin:6px 8px;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0">
              <template x-for="(tc,i) in t.tool_calls||[]" :key="i">
                <div>
                  <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;padding:3px 0;font-size:13px">
                    <span style="color:var(--text2);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;min-width:18px;text-align:right" x-text="(i+1)+'.'"></span>
                    <span class="tag" x-text="typeof tc==='string'?tc:(tc.tool_name||tc.tool||tc.name||tc.function||JSON.stringify(tc))"></span>
                    <template x-if="typeof tc==='object' && tc!=null">
                      <span :class="tc.success===false?'badge-ng':tc.success===true?'badge-ok':''" class="pill"
                        x-show="tc.success!=null"
                        :style="tc.success===false?'cursor:pointer;user-select:none':''"
                        @click="tc.success===false && (selTc = selTc===i ? null : i)"
                        x-text="tc.success?'OK':(selTc===i?'FAIL ▴':'FAIL ▾')"
                        style="font-size:11px"></span>
                    </template>
                    <!-- duration: 프레임워크별 실제 필드명 'duration', 폴백으로 'execution_time' -->
                    <template x-if="typeof tc==='object' && tc!=null && (tc.duration||tc.execution_time)">
                      <span style="color:var(--text2);margin-left:auto;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:13px">
                        <span x-text="((tc.duration||tc.execution_time)||0).toFixed(2)+'s'"></span>
                        <template x-if="tc.duration_estimated">
                          <span style="color:var(--text2);font-size:10px" title="측정값이 아닌 추정값">*</span>
                        </template>
                      </span>
                    </template>
                  </div>
                  <!-- FAIL 상세 패널 -->
                  <template x-if="typeof tc==='object' && tc!=null && tc.success===false && selTc===i">
                    <div style="margin:2px 0 8px 26px;padding:10px 12px;background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid #e55;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0;font-size:12px">

                      <!-- ① 오류 메시지 (LangChain: error 필드) -->
                      <template x-if="tc.error||tc.error_message||tc.error_type">
                        <div style="margin-bottom:8px">
                          <div style="font-weight:600;color:#e55;margin-bottom:4px">⚠ 오류 정보</div>
                          <template x-if="tc.error_type">
                            <div style="margin-bottom:3px"><span style="color:var(--text2)">유형: </span><span style="color:var(--text1)" x-text="tc.error_type"></span></div>
                          </template>
                          <template x-if="tc.error||tc.error_message">
                            <div style="word-break:break-all"><span style="color:var(--text2)">메시지: </span><span style="color:var(--text1)" x-text="tc.error||tc.error_message"></span></div>
                          </template>
                        </div>
                      </template>

                      <!-- ② 보안 위반 정보 (enable_security=True 시 존재) -->
                      <template x-if="tc.violation_type||tc.is_restricted||tc.has_dangerous_params||(tc.is_authorized===false)">
                        <div style="margin-bottom:8px;padding:7px 10px;background:rgba(220,50,50,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(220,50,50,0.25);border-radius:5px">
                          <div style="font-weight:600;color:#e55;margin-bottom:5px">🔒 보안 위반</div>
                          <template x-if="tc.violation_type">
                            <div style="margin-bottom:3px"><span style="color:var(--text2)">위반 유형: </span>
                              <span class="badge-ng" x-text="tc.violation_type"></span>
                            </div>
                          </template>
                          <template x-if="tc.privilege_level">
                            <div style="margin-bottom:3px"><span style="color:var(--text2)">권한 레벨: </span><span style="color:var(--text1)" x-text="tc.privilege_level"></span></div>
                          </template>
                          <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:4px">
                            <template x-if="tc.is_authorized===false">
                              <span class="badge-ng">미인가 도구</span>
                            </template>
                            <template x-if="tc.is_restricted">
                              <span class="badge-ng">제한 도구</span>
                            </template>
                            <template x-if="tc.has_dangerous_params">
                              <span class="badge-ng">위험 파라미터</span>
                            </template>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      </template>

                      <!-- ③ 권한 레벨 (보안 위반 없는 경우에만 별도 표시) -->
                      <template x-if="tc.privilege_level && !tc.violation_type && tc.is_authorized!==false && !tc.is_restricted && !tc.has_dangerous_params">
                        <div style="margin-bottom:8px"><span style="color:var(--text2)">권한 레벨: </span><span class="tag" style="font-size:11px" x-text="tc.privilege_level"></span></div>
                      </template>

                      <!-- ④ 실행 결과 (execution_result — 4개 프레임워크 공통 필드. AutoGen은 오류 내용도 여기에 포함) -->
                      <template x-if="tc.execution_result||tc.output||tc.result">
                        <div style="margin-bottom:8px">
                          <div style="font-weight:600;color:var(--text1);margin-bottom:4px">실행 결과
                            <template x-if="tc.success===false && !tc.error && !tc.error_message">
                              <span style="font-weight:400;color:var(--text2);font-size:11px"> — 오류 내용이 포함될 수 있음</span>
                            </template>
                          </div>
                          <pre style="background:var(--bg1);padding:6px 8px;border-radius:4px;overflow-x:auto;margin:0;font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;max-height:140px;white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-all"
                            x-text="(()=>{let v=tc.execution_result||tc.output||tc.result; return typeof v==='object'?JSON.stringify(v,null,2):String(v)})()"></pre>
                        </div>
                      </template>

                      <!-- ⑤ 입력 파라미터 (parameters / args / input 필드명 모두 지원) -->
                      <template x-if="(tc.parameters||tc.args||tc.input) && Object.keys(tc.parameters||tc.args||tc.input||{}).length>0">
                        <div style="margin-bottom:8px">
                          <div style="font-weight:600;color:var(--text1);margin-bottom:4px">입력 파라미터</div>
                          <pre style="background:var(--bg1);padding:6px 8px;border-radius:4px;overflow-x:auto;margin:0;font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;max-height:120px" x-text="JSON.stringify(tc.parameters||tc.args||tc.input,null,2)"></pre>
                        </div>
                      </template>

                      <!-- ⑥ 메타 정보 (call_id, duration_estimated) -->
                      <template x-if="tc.call_id||tc.duration_estimated">
                        <div style="margin-bottom:8px;display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap">
                          <template x-if="tc.call_id">
                            <div><span style="color:var(--text2)">Call ID: </span><span style="color:var(--text1);font-family:monospace" x-text="tc.call_id"></span></div>
                          </template>
                          <template x-if="tc.duration_estimated">
                            <div><span class="tag" style="font-size:11px">⏱ 시간 추정값</span></div>
                          </template>
                        </div>
                      </template>

                      <!-- ⑦ 전체 원본 데이터 -->
                      <div>
                        <div style="font-weight:600;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:4px">전체 원본 데이터</div>
                        <pre style="background:var(--bg1);padding:6px 8px;border-radius:4px;overflow-x:auto;margin:0;font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;max-height:160px" x-text="JSON.stringify(tc,null,2)"></pre>
                      </div>

                      <div style="margin-top:8px;text-align:right">
                        <span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);cursor:pointer" @click="selTc=null">닫기 ✕</span>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </template>
                </div>
              </template>
            </div>
          </div>
        </template>
        <div x-show="(data.tasks||[]).filter(t=>(t.tool_calls||[]).length>0).length>30"
          style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);text-align:center;padding:8px">
          상위 30개 태스크만 표시됩니다.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  </div>
</div>


<!-- ══ 성능 (Performance) ══ -->
<div x-show="data && sec==='performance'" x-cloak>

  <div class="tabs">
    <div class="tab" :class="{on:tperf==='basic'}"      @click="tperf='basic';tp='lat'">⏱️ 응답 지연 (Latency)</div>
    <div class="tab" :class="{on:tperf==='advanced'}"   @click="tperf='advanced';tp='tok'">🪙 토큰 &amp; 비용 (Cost)</div>
    <div class="tab" :class="{on:tperf==='integrated'}" @click="tperf='integrated'">🔗 프레임워크 &amp; APM</div>
    <span style="margin-left:auto;font-size:14px;color:var(--text2)">
      성능 Score: <b x-text="perspScore('performance',data)"></b>/100
    </span>
  </div>

  <div class="sec" style="padding:8px 12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);border-left:3px solid var(--accent)">
    <span x-show="tperf==='basic'">⏱️ 응답 지연 — SLA 준수 현황(P95·P99), 백분위 분포, TaskType별 지연 비교.</span>
    <span x-show="tperf==='advanced'">🪙 토큰 &amp; 비용 — 리소스 효율성 점수, 입출력 토큰 사용량, Task당 비용 및 월간 예산 추적.</span>
    <span x-show="tperf==='integrated'">🔗 프레임워크 &amp; APM — 프레임워크별 Task 분포, Datadog·Grafana 등 외부 APM 연동 가이드.</span>
  </div>

  <!-- ── 기본 티어 ── -->
  <div x-show="tperf==='basic'">
    <!-- SLA 준수 현황 -->
    <div class="sec">
      <div class="sec-t">📋 SLA 준수 현황</div>
      <table class="dt">
        <colgroup>
          <col style="width:auto">
          <col style="width:110px">
          <col style="width:110px">
          <col style="width:110px">
        </colgroup>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th style="text-align:left">SLA 항목</th>
            <th style="text-align:right">목표</th>
            <th style="text-align:right">현재</th>
            <th style="text-align:left">상태</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>
              응답 시간 P95
              <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:2px">전체 요청의 95%가 이 시간 안에 응답 · SLA 경고선</div>
            </td>
            <td style="text-align:right;color:var(--accent);font-weight:600" x-text="'≤ ' + thresholds.p95 + 's'"></td>
            <td style="text-align:right" x-text="sec_(data.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.p95||0)"></td>
            <td style="text-align:left" :style="(data.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.p95||0)<=thresholds.p95?'color:var(--green)':'color:var(--red)'" x-text="(data.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.p95||0)<=thresholds.p95?'✅ PASS':'❌ FAIL'"></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>
              응답 시간 P99
              <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:2px">전체 요청의 99%가 이 시간 안에 응답 · SLA 위험선</div>
            </td>
            <td style="text-align:right;color:var(--accent);font-weight:600" x-text="'≤ ' + thresholds.p99 + 's'"></td>
            <td style="text-align:right" x-text="sec_(data.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.p99||0)"></td>
            <td style="text-align:left" :style="(data.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.p99||0)<=thresholds.p99?'color:var(--green)':'color:var(--red)'" x-text="(data.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.p99||0)<=thresholds.p99?'✅ PASS':'❌ FAIL'"></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Task당 비용</td>
            <td style="text-align:right;color:var(--accent);font-weight:600" x-text="'≤ $' + thresholds.cost"></td>
            <td style="text-align:right" x-text="cost(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.avg_cost_per_task)"></td>
            <td style="text-align:left" :style="(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.avg_cost_per_task||0)<=thresholds.cost?'color:var(--green)':'color:var(--red)'" x-text="(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.avg_cost_per_task||0)<=thresholds.cost?'✅ PASS':'❌ FAIL'"></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <!-- Latency 상세 (기존 내용 이관) -->
    <div x-show="tp==='lat'" x-data="{
      selK: null,
      meta: {
        lat_mean:{label:'평균(Mean)',unit:'s',desc:'모든 태스크 응답 시간의 산술 평균',hint:'이상치(outlier)에 민감 — P50과 함께 해석 권장'},
        lat_p50: {label:'P50',unit:'s',desc:'응답 시간 중앙값 — 전체의 50%가 이 시간 이하',hint:'일반적 사용자 경험을 가장 잘 나타내는 지표'},
        lat_p95: {label:'P95',unit:'s',desc:'95번째 백분위 응답 시간 — SLA 경고선',hint:'전체 요청 중 가장 느린 5% 직전의 응답 시간'},
        lat_p99: {label:'P99',unit:'s',desc:'99번째 백분위 응답 시간 — SLA 위험선',hint:'전체 요청 중 가장 느린 1% 직전 — 최악의 케이스'},
        lat_max: {label:'Max',unit:'s',desc:'기록된 최대 응답 시간',hint:'극단적 이상치 — 타임아웃 또는 재시도 발생 원인'},
        lat_std: {label:'Std Dev',unit:'s',desc:'응답 시간 표준편차 — 분포 일관성 지표',hint:'값이 클수록 응답 시간이 불안정 — 재현성 문제'},
      },
      calcFormula(k, data) {
        const lm = data.efficiency_metrics?.latency||{};
        const n = (data.tasks||[]).filter(t=>t.execution_time>0).length;
        if(k==='lat_mean') return `평균 = Σ(응답시간) / N\n= ${(lm.mean||0).toFixed(3)}s (측정 ${n}건)`;
        if(k==='lat_p50')  return `P50(중앙값) = 정렬 후 50번째 백분위\n= ${(lm.p50||0).toFixed(3)}s`;
        if(k==='lat_p95')  return `P95 = 정렬 후 95번째 백분위\n= ${(lm.p95||0).toFixed(3)}s\n목표 SLA: ≤ ${thresholds.p95}s`;
        if(k==='lat_p99')  return `P99 = 정렬 후 99번째 백분위\n= ${(lm.p99||0).toFixed(3)}s\n목표 SLA: ≤ ${thresholds.p99}s`;
        if(k==='lat_max')  return `Max = 최대값\n= ${(lm.max||0).toFixed(3)}s`;
        if(k==='lat_std')  return `Std Dev = √(Σ(xᵢ-μ)²/N)\n= ${(lm.std||0).toFixed(3)}s`;
        return '';
      },
      filteredItems(k, data) {
        const tasks = [...(data.tasks||[])].filter(t=>t.execution_time>0).sort((a,b)=>(b.execution_time||0)-(a.execution_time||0));
        const lm = data.efficiency_metrics?.latency||{};
        if(k==='lat_p95') return tasks.filter(t=>(t.execution_time||0)>=(lm.p95||0)).slice(0,15);
        if(k==='lat_p99') return tasks.filter(t=>(t.execution_time||0)>=(lm.p99||0)).slice(0,10);
        if(k==='lat_max') return tasks.slice(0,10);
        return tasks.slice(0,15);
      },
      filterLabel(k) {
        if(k==='lat_p95') return 'P95 근접 태스크';
        if(k==='lat_p99') return 'P99 근접 태스크';
        if(k==='lat_max') return '최대 응답 상위 10건';
        return '응답시간 상위 15건';
      },
      hlCol(k) { return ''; }
    }">
    <div class="kpi-grid">
      <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='lat_mean'}" @click="selK=selK==='lat_mean'?null:'lat_mean'"><div class="kpi-lbl">평균(Mean)</div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="sec_(data.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.mean)"></div></div>
      <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='lat_p50'}"  @click="selK=selK==='lat_p50'?null:'lat_p50'"><div class="kpi-lbl">P50</div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="sec_(data.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.p50)"></div></div>
      <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='lat_p95'}"  @click="selK=selK==='lat_p95'?null:'lat_p95'"><div class="kpi-lbl">P95</div><div class="kpi-val" :class="lat_cl(data.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.p95)" x-text="sec_(data.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.p95)"></div></div>
      <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='lat_p99'}"  @click="selK=selK==='lat_p99'?null:'lat_p99'"><div class="kpi-lbl">P99</div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="sec_(data.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.p99)"></div></div>
      <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='lat_max'}"  @click="selK=selK==='lat_max'?null:'lat_max'"><div class="kpi-lbl">Max</div><div class="kpi-val" style="color:var(--red)" x-text="sec_(data.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.max)"></div></div>
      <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='lat_std'}"  @click="selK=selK==='lat_std'?null:'lat_std'"><div class="kpi-lbl">Std Dev</div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="sec_(data.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.std)"></div></div>
    </div>
    {% call kpi_detail_panel("{lat_mean:sec_(data.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.mean),lat_p50:sec_(data.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.p50),lat_p95:sec_(data.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.p95),lat_p99:sec_(data.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.p99),lat_max:sec_(data.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.max),lat_std:sec_(data.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.std)}[selK]||''", "data", "응답 지연 태스크") %}
    <div class="dtx" style="max-height:240px;overflow-y:auto">
      <div class="dtx-row dtx-head" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 80px 80px 60px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1">
        <span>태스크 ID</span><span style="text-align:right">응답시간</span><span style="text-align:center">유형</span><span style="text-align:center">상태</span>
      </div>
      <template x-for="lt in filteredItems(selK, data)" :key="lt.task_id">
        <div class="dtx-row" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 80px 80px 60px">
          <span class="dtx-id" x-text="lt.task_id"></span>
          <span style="text-align:right;font-weight:600" :style="(lt.execution_time||0)>=(data.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.p95||9999)?'color:var(--red)':''" x-text="(lt.execution_time||0).toFixed(3)+'s'"></span>
          <span style="text-align:center;font-size:11px;color:var(--text2)" x-text="lt.task_type||'-'"></span>
          <span style="text-align:center"><span :class="lt.success?'badge-ok':'badge-ng'" x-text="lt.success?'성공':'실패'"></span></span>
        </div>
      </template>
      <div class="dtx-empty" x-show="filteredItems(selK, data).length===0">측정 데이터 없음</div>
    </div>
    {% endcall %}
    <div x-show="!(data.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.mean>0)" class="es" style="padding:16px">
      <div class="es-icon">⏱️</div>
      <div class="es-title">Latency 측정 데이터 없음</div>
      <div class="es-desc">태스크에 <code>execution_time</code> 값이 설정되어 있어야 합니다.</div>
    </div>
    <div x-show="data.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.mean>0" style="margin-top:16px">
      <div class="cg">
        <div class="cbox"><div class="ct">Latency 백분위</div><div id="lat-bar" class="plt-chart"></div></div>
        <div class="cbox"><div class="ct">태스크별 응답시간 분포</div><div id="lat-hist" class="plt-chart"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="cg" style="margin-top:12px">
        <div class="cbox"><div class="ct">Latency Box Plot (분포 요약)</div><div id="lat-box" class="plt-chart"></div></div>
        <div class="cbox"><div class="ct">TaskType별 Latency 비교</div><div id="lat-type-box" class="plt-chart"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="sec" style="margin-top:20px">
        <div class="sec-t">📋 TaskType별 P95 레이턴시 (SLA 기준선)</div>
        <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:8px">각 TaskType의 P95 응답시간과 SLA 목표(점선)를 비교합니다. 막대가 점선을 초과하면 해당 유형이 SLA 위반 위험입니다.</div>
        <div id="perf-scatter" style="height:220px"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ── 심화 티어 ── -->
  <div x-show="tperf==='advanced'">
    <!-- 리소스 효율성 점수 -->
    <div class="sec">
      <div class="sec-t">⚡ 리소스 효율성 점수</div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:8px">
        <div class="cbox">
          <div class="ct">지연 효율</div>
          <div class="cv" :style="(data.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.p95||0)<=thresholds.p95?'color:var(--green)':'color:var(--orange)'" x-text="(data.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.p95||0)<=thresholds.p95?'100':Math.max(0,100-((data.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.p95||0)-thresholds.p95)*20).toFixed(0)"></div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;margin-top:4px">현재 P95 <span :style="(data.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.p95||0)<=thresholds.p95?'color:var(--green);font-weight:600':'color:var(--orange);font-weight:600'" x-text="sec_(data.efficiency_metrics?.latency?.p95||0)"></span></div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text2)">목표 P95 <span style="color:var(--accent);font-weight:600" x-text="thresholds.p95+'s'"></span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cbox">
          <div class="ct">비용 효율</div>
          <div class="cv" :style="(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.avg_cost_per_task||0)<=thresholds.cost?'color:var(--green)':'color:var(--orange)'" x-text="(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.avg_cost_per_task||0)<=thresholds.cost?'100':Math.max(0,100-((data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.avg_cost_per_task||0)-thresholds.cost)*(50/thresholds.cost)).toFixed(0)"></div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;margin-top:4px">현재 <span :style="(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.avg_cost_per_task||0)<=thresholds.cost?'color:var(--green);font-weight:600':'color:var(--orange);font-weight:600'" x-text="'$'+(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.avg_cost_per_task||0).toFixed(5)+'/task'"></span></div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text2)">목표 <span style="color:var(--accent);font-weight:600" x-text="'$'+thresholds.cost+'/task'"></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Token -->
    <div class="tabs">
      <div class="tab" :class="{on:tp==='tok'}"  @click="tp='tok'">🔢 Token</div>
      <div class="tab" :class="{on:tp==='cost'}" @click="tp='cost'">💰 Cost</div>
    </div>
    <div x-show="tp==='tok'" x-data="{
      selK: null,
      meta: {
        tok_total: {label:'총 토큰',unit:'tokens',desc:'입력+출력 토큰 합계',hint:'모델 API 비용 산정의 기준'},
        tok_input: {label:'Input 토큰',unit:'tokens',desc:'프롬프트·컨텍스트 토큰 합계',hint:'시스템 프롬프트·히스토리 포함'},
        tok_output:{label:'Output 토큰',unit:'tokens',desc:'모델 생성 응답 토큰 합계',hint:'생성 토큰은 입력 토큰보다 단가 높음'},
        tok_avg:   {label:'Task당 평균',unit:'tokens',desc:'태스크 1건당 평균 토큰 사용량',hint:'비용 예측의 핵심 지표'},
      },
      calcFormula(k, data) {
        const tk = data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens||{};
        const n = (data.tasks||[]).filter(t=>t.tokens_used>0).length;
        if(k==='tok_total') return `총 토큰 = Σ(task.tokens_used)\n= ${(tk.total_tokens||0).toLocaleString()}개 (측정 ${n}건)`;
        if(k==='tok_input') return `Input 토큰 = Σ(input_tokens)\n= ${(tk.total_input_tokens||0).toLocaleString()}개`;
        if(k==='tok_output')return `Output 토큰 = Σ(output_tokens)\n= ${(tk.total_output_tokens||0).toLocaleString()}개`;
        if(k==='tok_avg')   return `Task당 평균 = 총 토큰 / N\n= ${(tk.total_tokens||0).toLocaleString()} / ${n}\n= ${Math.round(tk.avg_tokens_per_task||0).toLocaleString()}개`;
        return '';
      },
      filteredItems(k, data) {
        return [...(data.tasks||[])].filter(t=>t.tokens_used>0).sort((a,b)=>(b.tokens_used||0)-(a.tokens_used||0)).slice(0,15);
      },
      filterLabel(k) { return '토큰 사용 상위 15건'; },
      hlCol(k) { return ''; }
    }">
      <div x-show="!(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.total_tokens>0)" class="es" style="padding:16px">
        <div class="es-icon">🪙</div>
        <div class="es-title">Token 사용 데이터 없음</div>
        <div class="es-desc">태스크에 <code>tokens_used</code> 값이 있어야 합니다.</div>
      </div>
      <div x-show="data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.total_tokens>0">
        <div class="kpi-grid">
          <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='tok_total'}" @click="selK=selK==='tok_total'?null:'tok_total'"><div class="kpi-lbl">총 토큰</div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.total_tokens||0).toLocaleString()"></div></div>
          <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='tok_input'}" @click="selK=selK==='tok_input'?null:'tok_input'"><div class="kpi-lbl">Input 토큰</div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.total_input_tokens||0).toLocaleString()"></div></div>
          <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='tok_output'}" @click="selK=selK==='tok_output'?null:'tok_output'"><div class="kpi-lbl">Output 토큰</div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.total_output_tokens||0).toLocaleString()"></div></div>
          <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='tok_avg'}" @click="selK=selK==='tok_avg'?null:'tok_avg'"><div class="kpi-lbl">Task당 평균</div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="Math.round(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.avg_tokens_per_task||0).toLocaleString()"></div></div>
        </div>
        {% call kpi_detail_panel("{tok_total:(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.total_tokens||0).toLocaleString(),tok_input:(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.total_input_tokens||0).toLocaleString(),tok_output:(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.total_output_tokens||0).toLocaleString(),tok_avg:Math.round(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.avg_tokens_per_task||0).toLocaleString()}[selK]||''", "data", "토큰 사용 태스크") %}
        <div class="dtx" style="max-height:240px;overflow-y:auto">
          <div class="dtx-row dtx-head" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 90px 60px 60px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1">
            <span>태스크 ID</span><span style="text-align:right">토큰 수</span><span style="text-align:center">유형</span><span style="text-align:center">상태</span>
          </div>
          <template x-for="tk in filteredItems(selK, data)" :key="tk.task_id">
            <div class="dtx-row" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 90px 60px 60px">
              <span class="dtx-id" x-text="tk.task_id"></span>
              <span style="text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums" x-text="(tk.tokens_used||0).toLocaleString()"></span>
              <span style="text-align:center;font-size:11px;color:var(--text2)" x-text="tk.task_type||'-'"></span>
              <span style="text-align:center"><span :class="tk.success?'badge-ok':'badge-ng'" x-text="tk.success?'성공':'실패'"></span></span>
            </div>
          </template>
          <div class="dtx-empty" x-show="filteredItems(selK, data).length===0">데이터 없음</div>
        </div>
        {% endcall %}
        <div class="cg" style="margin-top:16px">
          <div class="cbox"><div class="ct">Input / Output 비율</div><div id="tok-pie" class="plt-chart"></div></div>
          <div class="cbox"><div class="ct">태스크별 토큰 분포</div><div id="tok-hist" class="plt-chart"></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div x-show="tp==='cost'" x-data="{
      selK: null,
      meta: {
        cost_total:   {label:'총 비용',unit:'$',desc:'이번 평가 세션의 총 추정 비용',hint:'input_tokens × 입력단가 + output_tokens × 출력단가'},
        cost_per_task:{label:'Task당 비용',unit:'$',desc:'태스크 1건당 평균 비용',hint:'SLA 비용 목표와 비교 — Settings에서 임계값 조정 가능'},
        cost_monthly: {label:'월간 추정',unit:'$',desc:'현재 평균 비용 기준 월 1000건 처리 시 추정 비용',hint:'비용 예측 및 예산 계획 수립에 활용'},
      },
      calcFormula(k, data) {
        const tk = data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens||{};
        if(k==='cost_total')    return `총 비용 = input_tokens × 입력단가 + output_tokens × 출력단가\n= ${cost(tk.total_cost)}`;
        if(k==='cost_per_task') return `Task당 비용 = 총 비용 / 태스크 수\n= ${cost(tk.avg_cost_per_task)}\n목표: $${thresholds.cost}/task`;
        if(k==='cost_monthly')  return `월간 추정 = Task당 비용 × 1,000건\n= ${cost(tk.estimated_monthly_cost)}`;
        return '';
      },
      filteredItems(k, data) {
        const pr = data.pricing||{};
        const inp = pr.input||0, out = pr.output||0;
        return [...(data.tasks||[])].filter(t=>t.tokens_used>0).map(t=>{
          const c = (t.tokens_used||0) * (inp+out) / 2000;
          return {...t, _cost: c};
        }).sort((a,b)=>b._cost-a._cost).slice(0,15);
      },
      filterLabel(k) { return '비용 상위 15건'; },
      hlCol(k) { return ''; }
    }">
      <div class="kpi-grid">
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='cost_total'}" @click="selK=selK==='cost_total'?null:'cost_total'"><div class="kpi-lbl">총 비용</div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="cost(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.total_cost)"></div></div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='cost_per_task'}" @click="selK=selK==='cost_per_task'?null:'cost_per_task'">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">Task당 비용</div>
          <div class="kpi-val" :class="(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.avg_cost_per_task||0)<=thresholds.cost?'ok':'warn'" x-text="cost(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.avg_cost_per_task)"></div>
          <div class="kpi-sub" :class="(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.avg_cost_per_task||0)<=thresholds.cost?'ok':'warn'" x-text="(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.avg_cost_per_task||0)<=thresholds.cost?'✅ 목표 달성':'⚠️ 목표 미달'"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='cost_monthly'}" @click="selK=selK==='cost_monthly'?null:'cost_monthly'"><div class="kpi-lbl">월간 추정</div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="cost(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.estimated_monthly_cost)"></div></div>
      </div>
      {% call kpi_detail_panel("{cost_total:cost(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.total_cost),cost_per_task:cost(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.avg_cost_per_task),cost_monthly:cost(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.estimated_monthly_cost)}[selK]||''", "data", "비용 상위 태스크") %}
      <div class="dtx" style="max-height:240px;overflow-y:auto">
        <div class="dtx-row dtx-head" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 80px 80px 60px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1">
          <span>태스크 ID</span><span style="text-align:right">토큰 수</span><span style="text-align:right">추정 비용</span><span style="text-align:center">상태</span>
        </div>
        <template x-for="ct in filteredItems(selK, data)" :key="ct.task_id">
          <div class="dtx-row" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 80px 80px 60px">
            <span class="dtx-id" x-text="ct.task_id"></span>
            <span style="text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:11px" x-text="(ct.tokens_used||0).toLocaleString()"></span>
            <span style="text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums" x-text="'$'+(ct._cost||0).toFixed(5)"></span>
            <span style="text-align:center"><span :class="ct.success?'badge-ok':'badge-ng'" x-text="ct.success?'성공':'실패'"></span></span>
          </div>
        </template>
        <div class="dtx-empty" x-show="filteredItems(selK, data).length===0">데이터 없음</div>
      </div>
      {% endcall %}
      <!-- 목표 대비 비교 -->
      <div class="sec" style="margin-top:16px">
        <div class="sec-t">📐 목표 대비 비교</div>
        <table class="dt">
          <colgroup>
            <col style="width:auto">
            <col style="width:110px">
            <col style="width:120px">
            <col style="width:140px">
          </colgroup>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th style="text-align:left">항목</th>
              <th style="text-align:right">현재 값</th>
              <th style="text-align:center">목표 값</th>
              <th style="text-align:left">판정</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>Task당 비용 (평균)</td>
              <td style="text-align:right" x-text="cost(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.avg_cost_per_task)"></td>
              <td style="text-align:center;color:var(--accent);font-weight:600" x-text="'$'+thresholds.cost"></td>
              <td style="text-align:left" :style="(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.avg_cost_per_task||0)<=thresholds.cost?'color:var(--green)':'color:var(--orange)'" x-text="(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.avg_cost_per_task||0)<=thresholds.cost?'✅ 목표 달성':'⚠️ 목표 미달'"></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <div style="margin-top:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text2)">
          ⚙️ 목표 값은 <a href="#" @click.prevent="sec='settings'" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none">Settings</a>에서 변경·저장할 수 있습니다.
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sec" style="margin-top:12px">
        <div class="drow"><span class="dk">Input 단가</span><span x-text="cost(data.pricing?.input)+' / 1K tokens'"></span></div>
        <div class="drow"><span class="dk">Output 단가</span><span x-text="cost(data.pricing?.output)+' / 1K tokens'"></span></div>
        <div class="drow"><span class="dk">P50 비용</span><span x-text="cost(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.cost_percentiles?.p50)"></span></div>
        <div class="drow"><span class="dk">P90 비용</span><span x-text="cost(data.efficiency_metrics?.tokens?.cost_percentiles?.p90)"></span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ── 통합 티어 ── -->
  <div x-show="tperf==='integrated'">
    <!-- Framework Distribution -->
    <div x-show="!frameworkDist().length" class="empty es"><p>Framework 정보 없음 — 태스크에 framework 필드를 설정하세요.</p></div>
    <div x-show="frameworkDist().length>0">
      <div class="kpi-grid">
        <template x-for="fw in frameworkDist()" :key="fw.name">
          <div class="kpi">
            <div class="kpi-lbl" x-text="fw.name||'unknown'"></div>
            <div class="kpi-val" x-text="fw.count+'건'"></div>
            <div class="kpi-sub" style="color:var(--text2)" x-text="pct(fw.rate)+'  성공률'"></div>
          </div>
        </template>
      </div>
      <div class="cbox" style="margin-top:10px"><div class="ct">Framework별 Task 분포</div><div id="fw-bar" class="plt-chart"></div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="sec" style="margin-top:20px;border-left:3px solid var(--accent)">
      <div class="sec-t">🔗 외부 APM 연동</div>
      <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text2)">실운영 성능 모니터링을 위해 외부 APM 도구와 연동하세요.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <span class="badge" style="cursor:default">Datadog</span>
        <span class="badge" style="cursor:default">New Relic</span>
        <span class="badge" style="cursor:default">Grafana</span>
        <span class="badge" style="cursor:default">Prometheus</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ══ 보안 (Security) ══ -->
<div x-show="data && sec==='security'" x-cloak>

  <div class="tabs">
    <div class="tab" :class="{on:tsec2==='basic'}"      @click="tsec2='basic';tsec='l1in'">🔵 기본</div>
    <div class="tab" :class="{on:tsec2==='advanced'}"   @click="tsec2='advanced';tsec='l1auth'">🟡 심화</div>
    <div class="tab" :class="{on:tsec2==='integrated'}" @click="tsec2='integrated'">🟣 통합</div>
    <span style="margin-left:auto;font-size:14px;color:var(--text2)">
      보안 Score: <b x-text="perspScore('security',data)"></b>/100
    </span>
  </div>

  <div x-show="!data.has_security" class="es">
    <div class="es-icon">🔒</div>
    <div class="es-title">보안 지표 없음</div>
    <div class="es-desc">InputSanitizationTracker, OutputLeakageDetector 등 보안 트래커를 활성화하세요.</div>
  </div>
  <div x-show="data.has_security">

  <!-- ── 기본 티어 ── -->
  <div x-show="tsec2==='basic'">
    <!-- 보안 종합 스코어카드 -->
    <div class="sec">
      <div class="sec-t">🛡️ 보안 종합</div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:8px">
        <div class="cbox">
          <div class="ct">입력 위협 <span style="font-size:9px;opacity:.6;margin-left:3px">L1</span></div>
          <div class="cv" :style="(data.security_l1?.input_security?.threat_rate||0)<5?'color:var(--green)':'color:var(--red)'" x-text="(data.security_l1?.input_security?.threat_rate||0).toFixed(1)+'%'"></div>
          <div style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text2)">목표 &lt; 5%</div>
        </div>
        <div class="cbox">
          <div class="ct">출력 유출 <span style="font-size:9px;opacity:.6;margin-left:3px">L1</span></div>
          <div class="cv" :style="(data.security_l1?.output_leakage?.outputs_with_leakage||0)===0?'color:var(--green)':'color:var(--red)'" x-text="(data.security_l1?.output_leakage?.outputs_with_leakage||0)+'건'"></div>
          <div style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text2)">목표 0건</div>
        </div>
        <div class="cbox">
          <div class="ct">권한 준수 <span style="font-size:9px;opacity:.6;margin-left:3px">L1</span></div>
          <div class="cv" :style="(data.security_l1?.authorization?.compliance_rate||100)>=95?'color:var(--green)':'color:var(--red)'" x-text="(data.security_l1?.authorization?.compliance_rate||100).toFixed(1)+'%'"></div>
          <div style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text2)">목표 ≥95%</div>
        </div>
        <div class="cbox">
          <div class="ct">권한 상승 <span style="font-size:9px;opacity:.6;margin-left:3px">L2</span></div>
          <div class="cv" :style="(data.security_l2?.privilege_escalation?.escalations_detected||0)===0?'color:var(--green)':'color:var(--red)'" x-text="(data.security_l2?.privilege_escalation?.escalations_detected||0)+'건'"></div>
          <div style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text2)">목표 0건</div>
        </div>
        <div class="cbox">
          <div class="ct">공격 체인 <span style="font-size:9px;opacity:.6;margin-left:3px">L2</span></div>
          <div class="cv" :style="(data.security_l2?.attack_detection?.suspicious_chains||0)===0?'color:var(--green)':'color:var(--red)'" x-text="(data.security_l2?.attack_detection?.suspicious_chains||0)+'건'"></div>
          <div style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text2)">목표 0건</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 입력검사 + 출력유출 탭 -->
    <div class="tabs">
      <div class="tab" :class="{on:tsec==='l1in'}"  @click="tsec='l1in'">🔍 입력 검사</div>
      <div class="tab" :class="{on:tsec==='l1out'}" @click="tsec='l1out'">📤 출력 유출</div>
    </div>

    <!-- Input Sanitization -->
    <div x-show="tsec==='l1in'">
      <div x-show="!(data.security_l1?.input_security?.total_inputs_evaluated>0)" class="es">
        <p>입력 검사 데이터 없음 — <code>enable_security_metrics=True</code>로 InputSanitizationTracker를 활성화하세요.</p>
      </div>
      <div x-show="data.security_l1?.input_security?.total_inputs_evaluated>0"
           x-data="{
        selK: null,
        meta: {
          sec_in_total:  {label:'평가 입력',unit:'건',desc:'InputSanitizationTracker가 분석한 총 입력(태스크) 수',hint:'security_metrics 활성화 시 모든 태스크 입력이 분석됨'},
          sec_in_threat: {label:'위협 입력',unit:'건',desc:'1건 이상의 위협이 탐지된 입력(태스크) 수',hint:'복수 위협 유형이 있어도 1건으로 집계 (중복 제거)'},
          sec_in_events: {label:'위협 이벤트',unit:'건',desc:'탐지된 위협 유형 건수 합계',hint:'입력 1개에서 SQL+XSS가 동시 탐지되면 2건 — 위협의 다양성 측정'},
          sec_in_rate:   {label:'위협률',unit:'%',desc:'전체 입력 대비 위협 입력 비율',hint:'목표: 5% 미만 — 이상치가 클수록 공격 테스트 데이터 포함 가능성'},
        },
        calcFormula(k, data) {
          const s = data.security_l1?.input_security||{};
          const total = s.total_inputs_evaluated||0;
          const threats = s.inputs_with_threats||0;
          const events = (s.sql_injection_attempts||0)+(s.command_injection_attempts||0)+(s.path_traversal_attempts||0)+(s.xss_attempts||0)+(s.prompt_injection_attempts||0);
          if(k==='sec_in_total')  return `평가 입력 = InputSanitizationTracker 분석 태스크\n= ${total}건`;
          if(k==='sec_in_threat') return `위협 입력 = 위협 탐지 태스크 수 (중복 제거)\n= ${threats}건 / ${total}건`;
          if(k==='sec_in_events') return `위협 이벤트 = Σ(유형별 탐지 수)\n= SQL(${s.sql_injection_attempts||0}) + CMD(${s.command_injection_attempts||0})\n  + Path(${s.path_traversal_attempts||0}) + XSS(${s.xss_attempts||0})\n  + Prompt(${s.prompt_injection_attempts||0})\n= ${events}건`;
          if(k==='sec_in_rate')   return `위협률 = 위협 입력 / 전체 입력 × 100\n= ${threats} / ${total} × 100\n= ${(s.threat_rate||0).toFixed(1)}%`;
          return '';
        },
        filteredItems(k, data) {
          const evals = data.security_l1?.input_evals||[];
          if(k==='sec_in_threat'||k==='sec_in_rate') return evals.filter(e=>e.sanitization_needed);
          if(k==='sec_in_events') return evals.filter(e=>e.threat_count>0);
          return evals;
        },
        filterLabel(k) {
          if(k==='sec_in_threat'||k==='sec_in_rate') return '위협 감지 태스크';
          if(k==='sec_in_events') return '위협 이벤트 발생 태스크 (이벤트 합계와 건수 다를 수 있음)';
          return '전체 평가';
        },
        hlCol(k) { return ''; }
      }">
      <div class="kpi-grid">
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='sec_in_total'}" @click="selK=selK==='sec_in_total'?null:'sec_in_total'"><div class="kpi-lbl">평가 입력</div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="data.security_l1?.input_security?.total_inputs_evaluated||0"></div></div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='sec_in_threat'}" @click="selK=selK==='sec_in_threat'?null:'sec_in_threat'" title="위협이 1건 이상 탐지된 입력(태스크) 수 — 복수 위협 유형이 있어도 1건으로 집계">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">위협 입력</div>
          <div class="kpi-val" style="color:var(--red)" x-text="data.security_l1?.input_security?.inputs_with_threats||0"></div>
          <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:2px">입력 기준 (중복 제거)</div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='sec_in_events'}" @click="selK=selK==='sec_in_events'?null:'sec_in_events'" title="탐지된 위협 유형 건수 합계 — 입력 1개에 복수 유형이 탐지되면 각각 카운트">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">위협 이벤트</div>
          <div class="kpi-val" style="color:var(--red)"
               x-text="(data.security_l1?.input_security?.sql_injection_attempts||0)
                       +(data.security_l1?.input_security?.command_injection_attempts||0)
                       +(data.security_l1?.input_security?.path_traversal_attempts||0)
                       +(data.security_l1?.input_security?.xss_attempts||0)
                       +(data.security_l1?.input_security?.prompt_injection_attempts||0)"></div>
          <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:2px">유형별 합산 (중복 허용)</div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='sec_in_rate'}" @click="selK=selK==='sec_in_rate'?null:'sec_in_rate'"><div class="kpi-lbl">위협률</div><div class="kpi-val" :style="`color:${(data.security_l1?.input_security?.threat_rate||0)>20?'var(--red)':'var(--green)'}`" x-text="pct(data.security_l1?.input_security?.threat_rate)"></div></div>
      </div>
      {% call kpi_detail_panel("{sec_in_total:String(data.security_l1?.input_security?.total_inputs_evaluated??0),sec_in_threat:String(data.security_l1?.input_security?.inputs_with_threats??0)+'건',sec_in_events:String((data.security_l1?.input_security?.sql_injection_attempts||0)+(data.security_l1?.input_security?.command_injection_attempts||0)+(data.security_l1?.input_security?.path_traversal_attempts||0)+(data.security_l1?.input_security?.xss_attempts||0)+(data.security_l1?.input_security?.prompt_injection_attempts||0))+'건',sec_in_rate:pct(data.security_l1?.input_security?.threat_rate)}[selK]||''", "data", "입력 평가 상세") %}
      <div class="dtx" style="max-height:240px;overflow-y:auto">
        <div class="dtx-row dtx-head" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 60px 70px 70px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1">
          <span>태스크 ID</span><span style="text-align:center">위협여부</span><span style="text-align:center">위험도</span><span style="text-align:right">위협 수</span>
        </div>
        <template x-for="se in filteredItems(selK, data)" :key="se.task_id">
          <div class="dtx-row" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 60px 70px 70px">
            <span class="dtx-id" x-text="se.task_id"></span>
            <span style="text-align:center"><span :class="se.sanitization_needed?'badge-ng':'badge-ok'" x-text="se.sanitization_needed?'위협':'안전'"></span></span>
            <span style="text-align:center"><span class="badge-gray" x-text="se.risk_level||'low'"></span></span>
            <span style="text-align:right;color:var(--text2)" x-text="`위협 ${se.threat_count||0}개`"></span>
          </div>
        </template>
        <div class="dtx-empty" x-show="filteredItems(selK, data).length===0">데이터 없음</div>
      </div>
      {% endcall %}
      <div class="sec">
        <div class="sec-t">위협 유형별 <span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:400;color:var(--text2);margin-left:6px">입력 1개에 복수 유형 탐지 가능 → 유형 합계 ≥ 위협 입력 수</span></div>
        <div class="cg4">
          <div class="cbox"><div class="ct">SQL Injection</div><div style="font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:var(--red)" x-text="data.security_l1?.input_security?.sql_injection_attempts||0"></div></div>
          <div class="cbox"><div class="ct">Command Injection</div><div style="font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:var(--red)" x-text="data.security_l1?.input_security?.command_injection_attempts||0"></div></div>
          <div class="cbox"><div class="ct">Path Traversal</div><div style="font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:var(--orange)" x-text="data.security_l1?.input_security?.path_traversal_attempts||0"></div></div>
          <div class="cbox"><div class="ct">XSS</div><div style="font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:var(--orange)" x-text="data.security_l1?.input_security?.xss_attempts||0"></div></div>
          <div class="cbox"><div class="ct">Prompt Injection</div><div style="font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:var(--red)" x-text="data.security_l1?.input_security?.prompt_injection_attempts||0"></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Output Leakage -->
    <div x-show="tsec==='l1out'">
      <div x-show="!(data.security_l1?.output_leakage?.total_outputs_evaluated>0)" class="es">
        <p>출력 유출 검사 데이터 없음 — <code>enable_security_metrics=True</code>로 OutputLeakageDetector를 활성화하세요.</p>
      </div>
      <div x-show="data.security_l1?.output_leakage?.total_outputs_evaluated>0"
           x-data="{
        selK: null,
        meta: {
          sec_out_total:  {label:'평가 출력',unit:'건',desc:'OutputLeakageDetector가 분석한 총 출력(태스크) 수',hint:'모든 태스크의 응답이 민감 정보 패턴과 대조됨'},
          sec_out_leaked: {label:'유출 탐지',unit:'건',desc:'1건 이상의 유출이 탐지된 출력(태스크) 수',hint:'API Key, Password, 개인정보 등 8가지 패턴 탐지'},
          sec_out_rate:   {label:'유출률',unit:'%',desc:'전체 출력 대비 유출 탐지 비율',hint:'목표: 0% — 1건이라도 탐지 시 즉시 원인 분석 필요'},
        },
        calcFormula(k, data) {
          const ol = data.security_l1?.output_leakage||{};
          if(k==='sec_out_total')  return `평가 출력 = OutputLeakageDetector 분석 태스크\n= ${ol.total_outputs_evaluated||0}건`;
          if(k==='sec_out_leaked') return `유출 탐지 = 유출 패턴 포함 출력 수\n= ${ol.outputs_with_leakage||0}건 / ${ol.total_outputs_evaluated||0}건`;
          if(k==='sec_out_rate')   return `유출률 = 유출 탐지 / 전체 출력 × 100\n= ${ol.outputs_with_leakage||0} / ${ol.total_outputs_evaluated||0} × 100\n= ${(ol.leakage_rate||0).toFixed(1)}%`;
          return '';
        },
        filteredItems(k, data) {
          const dets = data.security_l1?.output_detections||[];
          if(k==='sec_out_leaked'||k==='sec_out_rate') return dets.filter(d=>d.leakage_count>0);
          return dets;
        },
        filterLabel(k) {
          if(k==='sec_out_leaked'||k==='sec_out_rate') return '유출 감지됨';
          return '전체 평가';
        },
        hlCol(k) { return ''; }
      }">
      <div class="kpi-grid">
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='sec_out_total'}" @click="selK=selK==='sec_out_total'?null:'sec_out_total'"><div class="kpi-lbl">평가 출력</div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="data.security_l1?.output_leakage?.total_outputs_evaluated||0"></div></div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='sec_out_leaked'}" @click="selK=selK==='sec_out_leaked'?null:'sec_out_leaked'"><div class="kpi-lbl">유출 탐지</div><div class="kpi-val" style="color:var(--red)" x-text="data.security_l1?.output_leakage?.outputs_with_leakage||0"></div></div>
        <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='sec_out_rate'}" @click="selK=selK==='sec_out_rate'?null:'sec_out_rate'"><div class="kpi-lbl">유출률</div><div class="kpi-val" :style="`color:${(data.security_l1?.output_leakage?.leakage_rate||0)>10?'var(--red)':'var(--green)'}`" x-text="pct(data.security_l1?.output_leakage?.leakage_rate)"></div></div>
      </div>
      {% call kpi_detail_panel("{sec_out_total:String(data.security_l1?.output_leakage?.total_outputs_evaluated??0),sec_out_leaked:String(data.security_l1?.output_leakage?.outputs_with_leakage??0)+'건',sec_out_rate:pct(data.security_l1?.output_leakage?.leakage_rate)}[selK]||''", "data", "출력 탐지 상세") %}
      <div class="dtx" style="max-height:240px;overflow-y:auto">
        <div class="dtx-row dtx-head" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 70px 70px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1">
          <span>태스크 ID</span><span style="text-align:center">유출여부</span><span style="text-align:center">심각도</span>
        </div>
        <template x-for="so in filteredItems(selK, data)" :key="so.task_id">
          <div class="dtx-row" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 70px 70px">
            <span class="dtx-id" x-text="so.task_id"></span>
            <span style="text-align:center"><span :class="so.leakage_count>0?'badge-ng':'badge-ok'" x-text="so.leakage_count>0?`유출${so.leakage_count}`:'안전'"></span></span>
            <span style="text-align:center"><span class="badge-gray" x-text="so.severity||'none'"></span></span>
          </div>
        </template>
        <div class="dtx-empty" x-show="filteredItems(selK, data).length===0">데이터 없음</div>
      </div>
      {% endcall %}
      <div class="sec">
        <div class="sec-t">유출 유형별</div>
        <div class="cg4">
          <div class="cbox"><div class="ct">API Key</div><div style="font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:var(--red)" x-text="data.security_l1?.output_leakage?.api_key_leaks||0"></div></div>
          <div class="cbox"><div class="ct">Password</div><div style="font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:var(--red)" x-text="data.security_l1?.output_leakage?.password_leaks||0"></div></div>
          <div class="cbox"><div class="ct">Credit Card</div><div style="font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:var(--red)" x-text="data.security_l1?.output_leakage?.credit_card_leaks||0"></div></div>
          <div class="cbox"><div class="ct">Email</div><div style="font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:var(--orange)" x-text="data.security_l1?.output_leakage?.email_leaks||0"></div></div>
          <div class="cbox"><div class="ct">SSN</div><div style="font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:var(--orange)" x-text="data.security_l1?.output_leakage?.ssn_leaks||0"></div></div>
          <div class="cbox"><div class="ct">Phone</div><div style="font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:var(--orange)" x-text="data.security_l1?.output_leakage?.phone_leaks||0"></div></div>
          <div class="cbox"><div class="ct">Private IP</div><div style="font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:var(--yellow)" x-text="data.security_l1?.output_leakage?.private_ip_leaks||0"></div></div>
          <div class="cbox"><div class="ct">File Path</div><div style="font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:var(--yellow)" x-text="data.security_l1?.output_leakage?.file_path_leaks||0"></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Authorization -->
    <div x-show="tsec==='l1auth'">
      <div class="kpi-grid">
        <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-lbl">총 Tool 호출</div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="data.security_l1?.authorization?.total_tool_calls||0"></div></div>
        <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-lbl">준수율</div><div class="kpi-val" :style="`color:${(data.security_l1?.authorization?.compliance_rate||100)<90?'var(--red)':'var(--green)'}`" x-text="pct(data.security_l1?.authorization?.compliance_rate)"></div></div>
        <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-lbl">위반 건수</div><div class="kpi-val" style="color:var(--red)" x-text="data.security_l1?.authorization?.violations||0"></div></div>
        <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-lbl">제한 도구 시도</div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="data.security_l1?.authorization?.restricted_attempts||0"></div></div>
        <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-lbl">위험 파라미터</div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="data.security_l1?.authorization?.dangerous_params||0"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="sec" x-show="data.security_l1?.tool_calls_detail?.length>0">
        <div class="sec-t">Tool 호출 상세</div>
        <div class="dtx">
          <div class="dtx-row dtx-head" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 140px 64px 80px">
            <span>Task ID</span><span>Tool</span><span style="text-align:center">인가</span><span style="text-align:center">권한</span>
          </div>
          <div style="max-height:280px;overflow-y:auto">
            <template x-for="t in (data.security_l1?.tool_calls_detail||[]).slice(0,30)" :key="t.task_id+(t.tool_name||'')">
              <div class="dtx-row" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 140px 64px 80px">
                <span class="dtx-id" x-text="t.task_id"></span>
                <span style="color:var(--text2);overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap" x-text="t.tool_name||'-'"></span>
                <span style="text-align:center"><span :class="t.is_authorized?'badge-ok':'badge-ng'" class="pill" x-text="t.is_authorized?'인가':'위반'"></span></span>
                <span style="text-align:center"><span class="tag" x-text="t.privilege_level||'normal'"></span></span>
              </div>
            </template>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- ── 심화 티어 ── -->
  <div x-show="tsec2==='advanced'">
    <!-- 위협 패턴 인텔리전스 -->
    <div class="sec" x-data="{
      threatItems() {
        const s = data.security_l1?.input_security || {};
        const map = {
          'SQL Injection':       s.sql_injection_attempts,
          'Command Injection':   s.command_injection_attempts,
          'Path Traversal':      s.path_traversal_attempts,
          'XSS':                 s.xss_attempts,
          'Prompt Injection':    s.prompt_injection_attempts,
        };
        return Object.entries(map).filter(([k,v]) => v > 0).map(([k,v]) => ({name:k, count:v}));
      }
    }">
      <div class="sec-t">🔬 위협 패턴 인텔리전스</div>
      <div x-show="threatItems().length===0" class="empty es"><p>탐지된 위협 패턴 없음 ✅</p></div>
      <div x-show="threatItems().length>0" class="dtx">
        <div class="dtx-row dtx-head" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 80px 72px">
          <span>위협 유형</span><span style="text-align:center">상태</span><span style="text-align:right">탐지 수</span>
        </div>
        <template x-for="t in threatItems()" :key="t.name">
          <div class="dtx-row" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 80px 72px">
            <span class="dtx-id" x-text="t.name"></span>
            <span style="text-align:center"><span class="badge-ng">⚠️ 탐지</span></span>
            <span style="text-align:right;color:var(--text2)" x-text="`${t.count}건`"></span>
          </div>
        </template>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 권한/권한상승 탭 -->
    <div class="tabs">
      <div class="tab" :class="{on:tsec==='l1auth'}" @click="tsec='l1auth'">🔐 권한</div>
      <div class="tab" :class="{on:tsec==='l2pe'}"  @click="tsec='l2pe'">🚀 권한 상승</div>
      <div class="tab" :class="{on:tsec==='int'}"   @click="tsec='int'">🛡️ 통합</div>
    </div>

    <!-- Privilege Escalation -->
    <div x-show="tsec==='l2pe'">
      <div x-show="!data.security_l2?.privilege_escalation?.total_evaluations" class="empty es"><p>권한 상승 탐지 데이터 없음 — PrivilegeEscalationDetector를 활성화하세요.</p></div>
      <div x-show="data.security_l2?.privilege_escalation?.total_evaluations>0"
           x-data="{
        selK: null,
        meta: {
          pe_total: {label:'평가 건수',unit:'건',desc:'PrivilegeEscalationDetector가 분석한 총 태스크 수',hint:'권한 상승 시도 여부를 분석한 전체 실행 수'},
          pe_rate:  {label:'상승 탐지율',unit:'%',desc:'권한 상승 시도가 탐지된 비율',hint:'목표: 0% — 정상 에이전트에서는 권한 상승 시도가 발생하지 않아야 함'},
        },
        calcFormula(k, data) {
          const pe = data.security_l2?.privilege_escalation||{};
          if(k==='pe_total') return `평가 건수 = PrivilegeEscalationDetector 분석\n= ${pe.total_evaluations||0}건`;
          if(k==='pe_rate')  return `상승 탐지율 = 탐지 건수 / 전체 평가 × 100\n= ${pe.escalations_detected||0} / ${pe.total_evaluations||0} × 100\n= ${(pe.escalation_rate||0).toFixed(1)}%`;
          return '';
        },
        filteredItems(k, data) {
          return data.security_l2?.escalation_events||[];
        },
        filterLabel(k) { return '상승 이벤트'; },
        hlCol(k) { return ''; }
      }">
        <div class="kpi-grid">
          <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='pe_total'}" @click="selK=selK==='pe_total'?null:'pe_total'"><div class="kpi-lbl">평가 건수</div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="data.security_l2?.privilege_escalation?.total_evaluations||0"></div></div>
          <div class="kpi kpi-act" :class="{sel:selK==='pe_rate'}" @click="selK=selK==='pe_rate'?null:'pe_rate'"><div class="kpi-lbl">상승 탐지율</div><div class="kpi-val" style="color:var(--red)" x-text="pct(data.security_l2?.privilege_escalation?.escalation_rate)"></div></div>
        </div>
        {% call kpi_detail_panel("{pe_total:String(data.security_l2?.privilege_escalation?.total_evaluations??0),pe_rate:pct(data.security_l2?.privilege_escalation?.escalation_rate)}[selK]||''", "data", "권한 상승 이벤트") %}
        <div style="max-height:200px;overflow-y:auto">
          <div class="dtx-row dtx-head" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 80px 80px">
            <span>태스크 ID</span><span style="text-align:center">이벤트 유형</span><span style="text-align:center">위험도</span>
          </div>
          <template x-for="ev in filteredItems(selK, data)" :key="ev.task_id+(ev.event_type||'')">
            <div class="dtx-row" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 80px 80px">
              <span class="dtx-id" x-text="ev.task_id||'-'"></span>
              <span style="text-align:center;font-size:11px" x-text="ev.event_type||'-'"></span>
              <span style="text-align:center"><span :class="ev.severity==='high'?'badge-ng':ev.severity==='medium'?'badge-warn':'badge-gray'" x-text="ev.severity||'-'"></span></span>
            </div>
          </template>
          <div class="dtx-empty" x-show="filteredItems(selK, data).length===0">이벤트 데이터 없음</div>
        </div>
        {% endcall %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Integrated Security View -->
    <div x-show="tsec==='int'">
      <div class="sec">
        <div class="sec-t">🛡️ 통합 보안 점수</div>
        <div class="cg">
          <div>
            <div class="brow" style="margin-bottom:10px">
              <div class="blbl"><span>입력 보안 (Input Sanitization)</span><span x-text="secScore('input')+'점'"></span></div>
              <div class="btrack"><div class="bfill" :style="`width:${secScore('input')}%;background:${bc(secScore('input'))}`"></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="brow" style="margin-bottom:10px">
              <div class="blbl"><span>출력 보안 (Output Leakage)</span><span x-text="secScore('output')+'점'"></span></div>
              <div class="btrack"><div class="bfill" :style="`width:${secScore('output')}%;background:${bc(secScore('output'))}`"></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="brow" style="margin-bottom:10px">
              <div class="blbl"><span>권한 준수 (Authorization)</span><span x-text="secScore('auth')+'점'"></span></div>
              <div class="btrack"><div class="bfill" :style="`width:${secScore('auth')}%;background:${bc(secScore('auth'))}`"></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="cbox"><div class="ct">보안 위협 분포</div><div id="sec-radar" class="plt-chart"></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 보안 이벤트 타임라인 -->
    <div class="sec">
      <div class="sec-t">⏱️ 보안 이벤트 타임라인</div>
      <div x-show="secEventTimeline().length>0">
        <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:8px">L1 입력위협 · L1 출력유출 · L2 고급위협 — 마커 크기: 위험도, 색상: 레이어</p>
        <div class="cbox"><div id="sec-timeline-adv" class="plt-chart" style="height:280px"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div x-show="!secEventTimeline().length" class="es">
        <p>보안 이벤트 없음 — 보안 트래커 데이터를 확인하세요.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ── 통합 티어 ── -->
  <div x-show="tsec2==='integrated'">
    <!-- Attack Detection -->
    <div x-show="tsec==='l2atk' || true">
      <div x-show="!data.security_l2?.attack_detection?.total_chains_analyzed" class="empty es"><p>공격 탐지 데이터 없음 — ToolChainAttackDetector를 활성화하세요.</p></div>
      <div x-show="data.security_l2?.attack_detection?.total_chains_analyzed>0">
        <div class="kpi-grid">
          <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-lbl">분석 체인</div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="data.security_l2?.attack_detection?.total_chains_analyzed||0"></div></div>
          <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-lbl">탐지율</div><div class="kpi-val" style="color:var(--red)" x-text="pct(data.security_l2?.attack_detection?.detection_rate)"></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 통합 보안 위험도 -->
    <div class="sec">
      <div class="sec-t">🛡️ 통합 보안 위험도</div>
      <div class="kpi-grid">
        <div class="kpi">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">종합 보안 점수</div>
          <div class="kpi-val" :style="`color:${bc(ss())}`" x-text="ss()+'점'"></div>
          <div class="kpi-sub" :class="ss()>=80?'ok':'warn'" x-text="ss()>=80?'✅ 안전':ss()>=60?'⚠️ 주의':'🚨 위험'"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">입력 보안</div>
          <div class="kpi-val" :style="`color:${bc(secScore('input'))}`" x-text="secScore('input')+'점'"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">출력 보안</div>
          <div class="kpi-val" :style="`color:${bc(secScore('output'))}`" x-text="secScore('output')+'점'"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">권한 준수</div>
          <div class="kpi-val" :style="`color:${bc(secScore('auth'))}`" x-text="secScore('auth')+'점'"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">입력 위협 탐지</div>
          <div class="kpi-val" style="color:var(--red)" x-text="pct(data.security_l1?.input_security?.threat_rate)"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">출력 유출률</div>
          <div class="kpi-val" style="color:var(--red)" x-text="pct(data.security_l1?.output_leakage?.leakage_rate)"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Radar + bars side by side -->
    <div class="cg">
      <div class="cbox"><div class="ct">보안 위협 분포 (레이더)</div><div id="intsec-radar" class="plt-chart" style="height:240px"></div></div>
      <div>
        <div class="sec" style="margin-bottom:8px">
          <div class="sec-t">🔍 위협 유형별 집계</div>
          <div class="brow" style="margin-bottom:8px">
            <div class="blbl"><span>SQL Injection</span><span x-text="data.security_l1?.input_security?.sql_injection_attempts||0"></span></div>
            <div class="btrack"><div class="bfill" style="background:var(--red)" :style="`width:${Math.min(100,(data.security_l1?.input_security?.sql_injection_attempts||0)*10)}%`"></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="brow" style="margin-bottom:8px">
            <div class="blbl"><span>Prompt Injection</span><span x-text="data.security_l1?.input_security?.prompt_injection_attempts||0"></span></div>
            <div class="btrack"><div class="bfill" style="background:var(--red)" :style="`width:${Math.min(100,(data.security_l1?.input_security?.prompt_injection_attempts||0)*10)}%`"></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="brow" style="margin-bottom:8px">
            <div class="blbl"><span>XSS</span><span x-text="data.security_l1?.input_security?.xss_attempts||0"></span></div>
            <div class="btrack"><div class="bfill" style="background:var(--orange)" :style="`width:${Math.min(100,(data.security_l1?.input_security?.xss_attempts||0)*10)}%`"></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="brow" style="margin-bottom:8px">
            <div class="blbl"><span>Command Injection</span><span x-text="data.security_l1?.input_security?.command_injection_attempts||0"></span></div>
            <div class="btrack"><div class="bfill" style="background:var(--red)" :style="`width:${Math.min(100,(data.security_l1?.input_security?.command_injection_attempts||0)*10)}%`"></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="brow">
            <div class="blbl"><span>Path Traversal</span><span x-text="data.security_l1?.input_security?.path_traversal_attempts||0"></span></div>
            <div class="btrack"><div class="bfill" style="background:var(--orange)" :style="`width:${Math.min(100,(data.security_l1?.input_security?.path_traversal_attempts||0)*10)}%`"></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="sec">
          <div class="sec-t">📤 유출 유형별</div>
          <template x-for="[k,v] in [
            ['API Key',     data.security_l1?.output_leakage?.api_key_leaks||0],
            ['Password',    data.security_l1?.output_leakage?.password_leaks||0],
            ['Credit Card', data.security_l1?.output_leakage?.credit_card_leaks||0],
            ['Email',       data.security_l1?.output_leakage?.email_leaks||0],
            ['SSN',         data.security_l1?.output_leakage?.ssn_leaks||0],
            ['Phone',       data.security_l1?.output_leakage?.phone_leaks||0],
            ['Private IP',  data.security_l1?.output_leakage?.private_ip_leaks||0]
          ]" :key="k">
            <div class="drow"><span class="dk" x-text="k"></span><span :style="`color:${v>0?'var(--red)':'var(--green)'}`" x-text="v+'건'"></span></div>
          </template>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- L2 Security -->
    <div class="sec" style="margin-top:20px" x-show="data.security_l2?.privilege_escalation?.total_evaluations>0 || data.security_l2?.attack_detection?.total_chains_analyzed>0">
      <div class="sec-t">🚀 Layer 2 보안 위협</div>
      <div class="kpi-grid">
        <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-lbl">권한 상승 탐지율</div><div class="kpi-val" style="color:var(--red)" x-text="pct(data.security_l2?.privilege_escalation?.escalation_rate)"></div></div>
        <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-lbl">공격 체인 탐지율</div><div class="kpi-val" style="color:var(--red)" x-text="pct(data.security_l2?.attack_detection?.detection_rate)"></div></div>
        <div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-lbl">분석 체인 수</div><div class="kpi-val" x-text="data.security_l2?.attack_detection?.total_chains_analyzed||0"></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Alerts specific to security -->
    <div class="sec" x-show="(data.insights?.alerts||[]).filter(a=>['input','output','auth','escalation','attack'].some(k=>a.metric?.toLowerCase().includes(k))).length>0">
      <div class="sec-t">🚨 보안 알림</div>
      <template x-for="(a,i) in (data.insights?.alerts||[]).filter(a=>['input','output','auth','escalation','attack','security','injection','leak'].some(k=>(a.metric||'').toLowerCase().includes(k)))" :key="i">
        <div class="alert" :class="a.severity">
          <div class="alert-t" x-text="`[${(a.severity||'').toUpperCase()}] ${a.metric}`"></div>
          <div class="alert-b" x-text="a.message"></div>
        </div>
      </template>
    </div>

    <!-- Security Event Timeline -->
    <div class="sec">
      <div class="sec-t">⏱️ 보안 이벤트 타임라인</div>
      <div x-show="secEventTimeline().length>0">
        <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:8px">L1 입력위협 · L1 출력유출 · L2 고급위협 — 마커 크기: 위험도, 색상: 레이어</p>
        <div class="cbox"><div id="sec-timeline" class="plt-chart" style="height:280px"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div x-show="!secEventTimeline().length" class="es">
        <p>보안 이벤트 없음 — 보안 트래커 데이터를 확인하세요.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- OWASP LLM Top 10 Mapping -->
    <div class="sec">
      <div class="sec-t">📋 OWASP LLM Top 10 매핑</div>
      <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:10px">현재 평가 결과와 OWASP LLM Top 10 (2025) 위협 항목의 매핑</p>
      <div style="overflow-x:auto">
        <table class="dt-grid">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th style="text-align:left">#</th>
              <th style="text-align:left">위협</th>
              <th style="text-align:left">관련 지표</th>
              <th style="text-align:center">상태</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <template x-for="[num,threat,metric,check] in [
              ['LLM01','Prompt Injection','InputSanitizationTracker',data.security_l1?.input_security?.prompt_injection_attempts===0],
              ['LLM02','Sensitive Info Disclosure','OutputLeakageDetector',data.security_l1?.output_leakage?.outputs_with_leakage===0],
              ['LLM03','Supply Chain Vulnerabilities','ToolAuthorizationTracker',data.security_l1?.authorization?.violations===0],
              ['LLM04','Data & Model Poisoning','HallucinationDetector',(data.accuracy_metrics?.hallucination?.overall_rate||0)<10],
              ['LLM05','Improper Output Handling','OutputLeakageDetector',data.security_l1?.output_leakage?.outputs_with_leakage===0],
              ['LLM06','Excessive Agency','ToolAuthorizationTracker',(data.security_l1?.authorization?.compliance_rate||100)>=95],
              ['LLM07','System Prompt Leakage','OutputLeakageDetector',(data.security_l1?.output_leakage?.leakage_rate||0)<1],
              ['LLM08','Vector & Embedding Weaknesses','N/A (Layer 3 필요)',false],
              ['LLM09','Misinformation','HallucinationDetector',(data.accuracy_metrics?.hallucination?.overall_rate||0)<5],
              ['LLM10','Unbounded Consumption','PrivilegeEscalationDetector',(data.security_l2?.privilege_escalation?.escalations_detected||0)===0]
            ]" :key="num">
              <tr :style="check===false&&check!==undefined?'background:rgba(248,113,113,0.07)':''">
                <td style="font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)" x-text="num"></td>
                <td x-text="threat"></td>
                <td style="color:var(--text2);font-size:13px" x-text="metric"></td>
                <td style="text-align:center">
                  <span x-show="check===true" style="color:var(--green);font-weight:700">✅ PASS</span>
                  <span x-show="check===false" style="color:var(--red);font-weight:700">⚠️ RISK</span>
                  <span x-show="check===undefined||metric==='N/A (Layer 3 필요)'" style="color:var(--text2);font-size:13px">— 미평가</span>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </template>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</div>

<!-- ══ INSIGHTS ══ -->
<div x-show="data && sec==='insights'" x-cloak>
  <div class="tabs">
    <div class="tab" :class="{on:ti==='diag'}"     @click="ti='diag'">🔍 진단
      <span class="badge" x-text="(data.insights?.alerts?.length||0)+(autoAnomalies()?.length||0)+(bottleneckAnalysis()?.length||0)"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="tab" :class="{on:ti==='actions'}"  @click="ti='actions'">💡 개선 방안
      <span class="badge" x-text="(data.insights?.recommendations?.length||0)+(bottleneckAnalysis()?.length||0)"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="tab" :class="{on:ti==='analysis'}" @click="ti='analysis'">📊 분석</div>
  </div>

  <!-- ── 진단 탭 ── -->
  <div x-show="ti==='diag'">

    <!-- 지표 상태 요약 (항상 표시) -->
    <div class="sec" style="margin-bottom:8px" x-show="metricStatus().length>0">
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:center">
        <template x-for="m in metricStatus()" :key="m.name">
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:13px">
            <span class="dk" x-text="m.name"></span>
            <span style="font-weight:700" x-text="m.value"></span>
            <span :class="m.cls" class="pill badge-info" style="font-size:10px;padding:1px 6px" x-text="m.status"></span>
          </div>
        </template>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 🚨 활성 알림 -->
    <details class="sec" open style="margin-bottom:8px">
      <summary style="cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px">
        <span class="sec-t" style="margin:0">🚨 활성 알림</span>
        <span class="badge" x-text="data.insights?.alerts?.length||0"></span>
      </summary>
      <div x-show="!(data.insights?.alerts?.length>0)" class="es"><p>알림 없음 — 모든 지표 정상</p></div>
      <template x-for="(a,i) in data.insights?.alerts||[]" :key="i">
        <div class="alert" :class="a.severity">
          <div class="alert-t">
            <span :class="{'badge-ng':a.severity==='critical','badge-info':a.severity==='high','badge-warn':a.severity==='medium','badge-ok':a.severity==='low'}" class="pill" x-text="a.severity?.toUpperCase()"></span>
            <span style="margin-left:6px" x-text="a.metric"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="alert-b" x-text="a.message"></div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--accent);margin-top:4px" x-text="a.action"></div>
        </div>
      </template>
    </details>

    <!-- 📉 이상치 탐지 -->
    <details class="sec" style="margin-bottom:8px">
      <summary style="cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px">
        <span class="sec-t" style="margin:0">📉 이상치 탐지</span>
        <span class="badge" x-text="(autoAnomalies()?.length||0)+(statAnomalies()?.length||0)+'건'"></span>
      </summary>
      <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text2);padding:4px 0 6px">규칙 기반</div>
      <template x-for="a in autoAnomalies()" :key="a.title">
        <div class="alert" :class="a.sev">
          <div class="alert-t" x-text="a.title"></div>
          <div class="alert-b" x-text="a.desc"></div>
        </div>
      </template>
      <div x-show="autoAnomalies().length===0" style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);padding:6px 0">✅ 규칙 기반 이상치 없음</div>
      <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text2);padding:10px 0 6px">통계적 이상치 (Z-score ≥ 2.0)</div>
      <template x-for="(a,i) in statAnomalies()" :key="i">
        <div class="alert" :class="a.sev">
          <div class="alert-t" x-text="a.title"></div>
          <div class="alert-b" x-text="a.desc"></div>
        </div>
      </template>
      <div x-show="statAnomalies().length===0" style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);padding:6px 0">✅ 통계적 이상치 없음</div>
    </details>

    <!-- ⚡ 성능 병목 -->
    <details class="sec">
      <summary style="cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px">
        <span class="sec-t" style="margin:0">⚡ 성능 병목</span>
        <span class="badge" x-text="bottleneckAnalysis()?.length+'건'"></span>
      </summary>
      <template x-for="(b,i) in bottleneckAnalysis()" :key="i">
        <div class="alert" :class="b.severity">
          <div class="alert-t" x-text="b.title"></div>
          <div class="alert-b" x-text="b.desc"></div>
          <div x-show="b.tasks.length>0" style="margin-top:8px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px">
            <template x-for="t in b.tasks" :key="t.task_id">
              <span class="tag" x-text="`${t.task_id} (${(t.execution_time||0).toFixed(2)}s)`"></span>
            </template>
          </div>
        </div>
      </template>
      <div x-show="!bottleneckAnalysis().length" style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);padding:6px 0">✅ 성능 병목 없음</div>
    </details>
  </div>

  <!-- ── 개선 방안 탭 ── -->
  <div x-show="ti==='actions'">

    <!-- 우선순위 필터 -->
    <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;margin-bottom:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
      <button @click="recFilter='all'"    :class="recFilter==='all'   ?'pill pr':'pill'" style="cursor:pointer;border:none;font-size:12px;padding:4px 12px">전체 <span x-text="(data.insights?.recommendations?.length||0)+(bottleneckAnalysis()?.length||0)"></span></button>
      <button @click="recFilter='high'"   :class="recFilter==='high'  ?'pill pr':'pill py'" style="cursor:pointer;border:none;font-size:12px;padding:4px 12px">HIGH <span x-text="(data.insights?.recommendations||[]).filter(r=>r.priority==='high').length"></span></button>
      <button @click="recFilter='medium'" :class="recFilter==='medium'?'pill py':'pill'" style="cursor:pointer;border:none;font-size:12px;padding:4px 12px">MEDIUM <span x-text="(data.insights?.recommendations||[]).filter(r=>r.priority==='medium').length"></span></button>
      <button @click="recFilter='low'"    :class="recFilter==='low'   ?'pill pg':'pill'" style="cursor:pointer;border:none;font-size:12px;padding:4px 12px">LOW <span x-text="(data.insights?.recommendations||[]).filter(r=>r.priority==='low').length"></span></button>
      <button @click="recFilter='bottleneck'" :class="recFilter==='bottleneck'?'pill po':'pill'" style="cursor:pointer;border:none;font-size:12px;padding:4px 12px">병목 <span x-text="bottleneckAnalysis()?.length"></span></button>
    </div>

    <!-- 권고사항 -->
    <div x-show="!(data.insights?.recommendations?.length>0) && !bottleneckAnalysis().length" class="empty es"><p>개선 방안이 없습니다 — 현재 지표 양호</p></div>
    <template x-for="(r,i) in (data.insights?.recommendations||[])" :key="i">
      <div class="rec" x-show="recFilter==='all' || recFilter===r.priority">
        <div class="rec-t">
          <span :class="{'pr':r.priority==='high','py':r.priority==='medium','pg':r.priority==='low'}" class="pill" x-text="r.priority?.toUpperCase()"></span>
          <span style="margin-left:6px;font-weight:600" x-text="r.title||r.area"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="rec-b" x-show="r.issue" x-text="r.issue"></div>
        <details style="margin-top:6px">
          <summary style="cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent)">💡 개선 제안 보기</summary>
          <div style="font-size:13px;margin-top:8px;color:var(--text2)" x-html="md2html(r.suggestion)"></div>
          <div x-show="r.impact" style="margin-top:8px;padding-top:8px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);font-size:13px;color:var(--text2)" x-html="'<strong>📈 예상 효과</strong>'+md2html(r.impact||'')"></div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </template>

    <!-- 병목 기반 개선 항목 -->
    <div x-show="bottleneckAnalysis().length>0 && (recFilter==='all'||recFilter==='bottleneck')" style="margin-top:4px">
      <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text2);padding:8px 0 4px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)">⚡ 성능 병목 기반 개선 항목</div>
      <template x-for="(b,i) in bottleneckAnalysis()" :key="i">
        <div class="rec">
          <div class="rec-t">
            <span class="pill" :class="b.severity==='high'?'pr':b.severity==='medium'?'py':'pg'" x-text="b.severity.toUpperCase()"></span>
            <span style="margin-left:6px;font-weight:600" x-text="b.title"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="rec-b" x-text="b.desc"></div>
          <div x-show="b.tasks.length>0" style="margin-top:6px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px">
            <template x-for="t in b.tasks" :key="t.task_id">
              <span class="tag" x-text="`${t.task_id} (${(t.execution_time||0).toFixed(2)}s)`"></span>
            </template>
          </div>
        </div>
      </template>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ── 분석 탭 ── -->
  <div x-show="ti==='analysis'">

    <!-- 📈 지표 상관관계 -->
    <details class="sec" open style="margin-bottom:8px">
      <summary style="cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px">
        <span class="sec-t" style="margin:0">📈 지표 상관관계 (Pearson)</span>
      </summary>
      <div x-show="!metricCorr().length" class="es"><p>분석 가능한 태스크 데이터 부족 (최소 3건 필요)</p></div>
      <div x-show="metricCorr().length>0">
        <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:10px">정확도 · 지연시간 · 토큰 · 완료율 4×4 매트릭스 — 파랑(음의 상관) / 흰색(0) / 빨강(양의 상관)</p>
        <div class="cbox"><div id="corr-heatmap" class="plt-chart" style="height:300px"></div></div>
        <div class="dtx" style="margin-top:12px">
          <div class="dtx-row dtx-head" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 90px 100px 96px">
            <span>지표 쌍</span><span style="text-align:right">r 값</span><span style="text-align:center">강도</span><span style="text-align:center">방향</span>
          </div>
          <template x-for="c in metricCorr()" :key="c.label">
            <div class="dtx-row" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 90px 100px 96px">
              <span class="dtx-id" x-text="c.label"></span>
              <span style="text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums" :style="`color:${Math.abs(c.r)>=0.5?'var(--accent)':Math.abs(c.r)>=0.3?'var(--yellow)':'var(--text2)'}`" x-text="c.r.toFixed(3)"></span>
              <span style="text-align:center"><span class="pill" :class="Math.abs(c.r)>=0.5?'po':Math.abs(c.r)>=0.3?'py':'pg'" x-text="Math.abs(c.r)>=0.5?'강한 상관':Math.abs(c.r)>=0.3?'중간 상관':'약한 상관'"></span></span>
              <span style="text-align:center"><span class="tag" x-text="c.r>0?'양의 상관':'음의 상관'"></span></span>
            </div>
          </template>
        </div>
      </div>
    </details>

    <!-- 📊 데이터 품질 -->
    <details class="sec">
      <summary style="cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px">
        <span class="sec-t" style="margin:0">📊 데이터 품질 (완전도)</span>
        <span class="badge" :style="`background:${bc(dataQuality().overall)}`" x-text="pct(dataQuality().overall)"></span>
        <div style="margin-left:auto;font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center">
          <span><span class="pill pg" style="font-size:10px;padding:1px 6px">필수</span></span>
          <span><span class="pill" style="font-size:10px;padding:1px 6px;background:var(--bg3);color:var(--text2);border:1px solid var(--border)">선택</span></span>
        </div>
      </summary>
      <div class="kpi-grid dq-grid">
        <div class="kpi" style="grid-column:span 1">
          <div class="kpi-lbl">전체 완전도 <span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text2)">(필수 필드)</span></div>
          <div class="kpi-val" :style="`color:${bc(dataQuality().overall)}`" x-text="pct(dataQuality().overall)"></div>
          <div class="kpi-sub" style="color:var(--text2)" x-text="`필수 ${dataQuality().fields.filter(f=>f.required).length}개 필드 기준`"></div>
        </div>
        <template x-for="f in dataQuality().fields" :key="f.name">
          <div class="kpi" :style="!f.required&&f.pct===0?'opacity:0.55':''">
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;margin-bottom:4px;flex-wrap:wrap">
              <div class="kpi-lbl" style="margin:0" x-text="f.name"></div>
              <span x-show="f.required" class="pill pg" style="font-size:9px;padding:1px 5px;line-height:1.4">필수</span>
              <span x-show="!f.required" class="pill" style="font-size:9px;padding:1px 5px;line-height:1.4;background:var(--bg3);color:var(--text2);border:1px solid var(--border)">선택</span>
            </div>
            <div class="kpi-val" style="font-size:16px"
              :style="`color:${f.required?(f.pct>=90?'var(--green)':f.pct>=70?'var(--yellow)':'var(--red)'):(f.pct===0?'var(--text2)':f.pct>=70?'var(--green)':'var(--yellow)')}`"
              x-text="pct(f.pct)">
            </div>
            <div class="kpi-sub" style="color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:6px" x-text="`${f.filled}/${f.total}`"></div>
            <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.5;border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:6px;margin-top:2px" x-text="f.desc"></div>
          </div>
        </template>
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ══ TRANSPARENCY ══ -->
<div x-show="data && sec==='transparency'" x-cloak
     x-effect="if(sec==='transparency' && data){ loadTransparency('traces'); loadTransparency('annotations'); loadTransparency('audit'); }">
  <div class="tabs">
    <div class="tab" :class="{on:ttr==='tr'}"   @click="loadTransparency('traces');ttr='tr'">📍 Traces <span class="badge" x-text="trData.traces.length"></span></div>
    <div class="tab" :class="{on:ttr==='ann'}"  @click="loadTransparency('annotations');ttr='ann'">📝 Annotations <span class="badge" x-text="trData.annotations.length"></span></div>
    <div class="tab" :class="{on:ttr==='aud'}"  @click="loadTransparency('audit');ttr='aud'">🗒️ Audit Log <span class="badge" x-text="trData.audit.length"></span></div>
  </div>

  <!-- Traces -->
  <div x-show="ttr==='tr'">
    <div class="tr-info">
      📡 <span><strong>전체 범위 표시</strong> — Traces는 평가 실행 중 기록된 측정 단계 로그입니다.
      선택된 평가 파일과 무관하게 <code>results/traces/</code> 디렉토리의 모든 trace가 표시됩니다.
      특정 평가와 연결하려면 <code>TestTransparencyManager</code>의 <code>metadata</code>에
      <code>source_file_id</code>를 기록하세요.</span>
    </div>
    <div x-show="trData.traces.length===0" class="empty es"><p>Trace 파일 없음 — 투명성 예제를 실행하세요.</p></div>
    <template x-for="(tr,i) in trData.traces" :key="i">
      <div class="sec">
        <div class="sec-t">📍 <span x-text="tr.stem||tr.name"></span></div>
        <div x-show="!trDetail[tr.stem]">
          <button class="btn" @click="loadTrace(tr.stem)">상세 보기</button>
        </div>
        <div x-show="trDetail[tr.stem]">
          <div class="drow"><span class="dk">Metric</span><span x-text="trDetail[tr.stem]?.metric_name"></span></div>
          <div class="drow"><span class="dk">Status</span><span x-text="trDetail[tr.stem]?.status"></span></div>
          <div class="drow"><span class="dk">Final Value</span><span x-text="trDetail[tr.stem]?.final_value"></span></div>
          <div style="margin-top:8px">
            <template x-for="(s,si) in trDetail[tr.stem]?.steps||[]" :key="si">
              <div class="trace-step">
                <h4 x-text="`Step ${si+1}: ${s.step_name}`"></h4>
                <p x-text="s.description"></p>
                <p x-show="s.output_data?.reasoning" x-text="`추론: ${s.output_data?.reasoning}`"></p>
              </div>
            </template>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </template>
  </div>

  <!-- Annotations -->
  <div x-show="ttr==='ann'">
    <div class="tr-info">
      🔗 <span><strong>파일별 필터 적용</strong> — 현재 선택된 평가 파일
      (<code x-text="files.find(f=>f.id===selId)?.name||'없음'"></code>)과 연결된 어노테이션만 표시됩니다.
      <code>source_file_id</code>가 없는 글로벌 메모(예: <code>TestTransparencyManager</code>로 생성한 항목)도 함께 표시됩니다.
      다른 파일의 어노테이션은 해당 파일 선택 후 확인하세요.</span>
    </div>

    <!-- 새 어노테이션 작성 버튼 -->
    <div style="display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;margin-bottom:10px">
      <button class="btn" @click="annForm.show=!annForm.show; if(annForm.show){ annForm.target_id=files.find(f=>f.id===selId)?.name||''; annForm.target_type='evaluation'; annForm.error=''; }"
        :style="annForm.show?'background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-color:var(--accent)':''">
        ✏️ 새 어노테이션 작성
      </button>
    </div>

    <!-- 작성 폼 -->
    <div x-show="annForm.show" class="sec" style="border:1px solid var(--accent);margin-bottom:12px">
      <div class="sec-t">✏️ 어노테이션 작성</div>

      <!-- 제목 -->
      <div style="margin-bottom:8px">
        <label style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);display:block;margin-bottom:4px">제목 *</label>
        <input x-model="annForm.title" type="text" placeholder="어노테이션 제목을 입력하세요"
          style="width:100%;padding:6px 10px;background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r);color:var(--text);font-size:14px;box-sizing:border-box">
      </div>

      <!-- Type / Priority / Author -->
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px">
        <div>
          <label style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);display:block;margin-bottom:4px">유형</label>
          <select x-model="annForm.annotation_type"
            style="width:100%;padding:6px 8px;background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r);color:var(--text);font-size:14px">
            <option value="note">📝 Note</option>
            <option value="warning">⚠️ Warning</option>
            <option value="review">🔍 Review</option>
            <option value="improvement">💡 Improvement</option>
            <option value="bug">🐛 Bug</option>
            <option value="question">❓ Question</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);display:block;margin-bottom:4px">우선순위</label>
          <select x-model="annForm.priority"
            style="width:100%;padding:6px 8px;background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r);color:var(--text);font-size:14px">
            <option value="low">🟢 Low</option>
            <option value="medium">🟡 Medium</option>
            <option value="high">🟠 High</option>
            <option value="critical">🔴 Critical</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);display:block;margin-bottom:4px">작성자</label>
          <input x-model="annForm.author" type="text" placeholder="이름 (선택)"
            style="width:100%;padding:6px 10px;background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r);color:var(--text);font-size:14px;box-sizing:border-box">
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Target -->
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px">
        <div>
          <label style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);display:block;margin-bottom:4px">대상 유형</label>
          <select x-model="annForm.target_type"
            style="width:100%;padding:6px 8px;background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r);color:var(--text);font-size:14px">
            <option value="evaluation">evaluation</option>
            <option value="metric">metric</option>
            <option value="task">task</option>
            <option value="dataset">dataset</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);display:block;margin-bottom:4px">대상 ID (선택)</label>
          <input x-model="annForm.target_id" type="text" placeholder="예: task_001, tcr"
            style="width:100%;padding:6px 10px;background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r);color:var(--text);font-size:14px;box-sizing:border-box">
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 내용 -->
      <div style="margin-bottom:10px">
        <label style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);display:block;margin-bottom:4px">내용 *</label>
        <textarea x-model="annForm.content" rows="4" placeholder="어노테이션 내용을 입력하세요"
          style="width:100%;padding:6px 10px;background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r);color:var(--text);font-size:14px;resize:vertical;box-sizing:border-box"></textarea>
      </div>

      <!-- 에러 -->
      <div x-show="annForm.error" style="color:var(--red);font-size:13px;margin-bottom:8px" x-text="annForm.error"></div>

      <!-- 버튼 -->
      <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:flex-end">
        <button class="btn" @click="annForm.show=false;annForm.error=''">취소</button>
        <button class="btn" @click="saveAnnotation()"
          :disabled="annForm.saving"
          style="background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-color:var(--accent)"
          x-text="annForm.saving?'저장 중...':'저장'"></button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 기존 어노테이션 목록 -->
    <div x-show="trData.annotations.length===0 && !annForm.show" class="empty es"><p>Annotation이 없습니다 — 위에서 새 어노테이션을 작성하세요.</p></div>
    <template x-for="(an,i) in trData.annotations" :key="i">
      <div class="sec">
        <!-- 헤더 -->
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:6px">
          <span x-text="{'note':'📝','warning':'⚠️','review':'🔍','improvement':'💡','bug':'🐛','question':'❓'}[annDetail[an.stem]?.annotation_type||'note']||'📝'"></span>
          <span style="font-weight:600;flex:1" x-text="annDetail[an.stem]?.title || an.stem"></span>
          <span :class="{'pr':annDetail[an.stem]?.priority==='critical','po':annDetail[an.stem]?.priority==='high','py':annDetail[an.stem]?.priority==='medium','pg':annDetail[an.stem]?.priority==='low'}"
            class="pill" x-show="annDetail[an.stem]?.priority"
            x-text="annDetail[an.stem]?.priority?.toUpperCase()"></span>
          <button class="btn" x-show="!annDetail[an.stem]" @click="loadAnnotation(an.stem)" style="padding:2px 8px;font-size:12px">펼치기</button>
        </div>

        <div x-show="annDetail[an.stem]">
          <!-- 메타 -->
          <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:6px">
            <span x-text="'✍️ '+(annDetail[an.stem]?.author||'-')"></span>
            <span x-text="'🏷️ '+(annDetail[an.stem]?.annotation_type||'-')"></span>
            <span x-text="(annDetail[an.stem]?.created_at||'').substring(0,16)"></span>
          </div>
          <!-- 본문 -->
          <div style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:8px" x-text="annDetail[an.stem]?.content"></div>
          <!-- 태그 -->
          <div x-show="(annDetail[an.stem]?.tags||[]).length>0" style="margin-bottom:8px">
            <template x-for="t in annDetail[an.stem]?.tags||[]" :key="t">
              <span class="tag" x-text="t"></span>
            </template>
          </div>
          <!-- 답글 목록 -->
          <div x-show="(annDetail[an.stem]?.replies||[]).length>0"
            style="border-left:3px solid var(--border);padding-left:12px;margin-bottom:8px">
            <template x-for="(rep,ri) in annDetail[an.stem]?.replies||[]" :key="ri">
              <div style="margin-bottom:6px">
                <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--accent)" x-text="rep.author||'anonymous'"></span>
                <span style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);margin-left:8px" x-text="(rep.created_at||'').substring(0,16)"></span>
                <div style="font-size:13px;margin-top:2px" x-text="rep.content"></div>
              </div>
            </template>
          </div>
          <!-- 답글 입력 -->
          <div x-show="replyForm.stem===an.stem" style="margin-bottom:6px">
            <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:flex-start">
              <input x-model="replyForm.author" type="text" placeholder="이름 (선택)"
                style="width:90px;padding:4px 8px;background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r);color:var(--text);font-size:13px">
              <textarea x-model="replyForm.content" rows="2" placeholder="답글 내용"
                style="flex:1;padding:4px 8px;background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r);color:var(--text);font-size:13px;resize:none"></textarea>
              <button class="btn" @click="saveReply(an.stem)" :disabled="replyForm.saving"
                style="background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-color:var(--accent);white-space:nowrap"
                x-text="replyForm.saving?'…':'등록'"></button>
              <button class="btn" @click="replyForm.stem=null">취소</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- 답글 버튼 -->
          <button class="btn" x-show="replyForm.stem!==an.stem" @click="replyForm.stem=an.stem;replyForm.content=''"
            style="font-size:12px;padding:2px 8px">💬 답글</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </template>
  </div>

  <!-- Audit Log -->
  <div x-show="ttr==='aud'">
    <div class="tr-info">
      📋 <span><strong>전체 범위 표시</strong> — Audit Log는 서버·프로세스 수준 이벤트(평가 시작, 파일 저장, 설정 변경 등)를 기록합니다.
      이벤트는 특정 평가 파일이 아닌 실행 프로세스에 귀속되므로, 선택된 파일과 무관하게 전체 이력이 표시됩니다.</span>
    </div>
    <div x-show="trData.audit.length===0" class="empty es"><p>Audit Log 없음</p></div>
    <div class="slist">
      <template x-for="(au,i) in trData.auditItems" :key="i">
        <div class="irow">
          <span :class="au.success?'pg':'pr'" class="pill" x-text="au.success?'✓':'✗'"></span>
          <span x-text="au.event_type||au.stem" style="color:var(--accent)"></span>
          <span x-text="au.action||''" style="color:var(--text2)"></span>
          <span style="margin-left:auto;font-size:14px;color:var(--text2)" x-text="(au.timestamp||'').substring(0,16)"></span>
        </div>
      </template>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ══ GLOSSARY ══ -->
<div x-show="sec==='glossary'" x-cloak>
  <div class="sec">
    <div class="sec-t">📚 지표 설명</div>
    <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:10px">⚙️ Settings에서 임계값을 변경하면 <b style="color:var(--accent)">목표값(★)</b>이 실시간으로 반영됩니다.</p>

    <!-- 검색 + 카테고리 탭 -->
    <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
      <input x-model="glossSearch" type="text" placeholder="지표 검색..." style="flex:1;min-width:160px;padding:6px 10px;background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r);color:var(--text);font-size:14px">
      <template x-for="[key,lbl] in [['all','전체'],['quality','품질'],['performance','성능'],['agentic','에이전틱'],['security','보안'],['hybrid','하이브리드']]" :key="key">
        <button class="btn" :style="glossCat===key?'background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-color:var(--accent)':''"
          @click="glossCat=key" x-text="lbl"></button>
      </template>
    </div>

    <!-- 카테고리 섹션별 렌더링 -->
    <template x-for="[catKey,catIcon,catLabel,catColor] in [
      ['quality','📊','품질','#6c8ef5'],
      ['performance','⚡','성능','#facc15'],
      ['agentic','🤖','에이전틱','#4ade80'],
      ['security','🔒','보안','#f87171'],
      ['hybrid','🔬','하이브리드 (Hybrid / 외부 라이브러리)','#fb923c']
    ]" :key="catKey">
      <div x-show="(glossCat==='all'||glossCat===catKey) && glossary.some(g=>g.cat===catKey&&(!glossSearch||g.term.toLowerCase().includes(glossSearch.toLowerCase())))">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:18px 0 8px;padding-bottom:5px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--border)">
          <span x-text="catIcon" style="font-size:16px"></span>
          <span x-text="catLabel" style="font-weight:700;font-size:13px" :style="`color:${catColor}`"></span>
        </div>
        <template x-for="g in glossary.filter(g=>g.cat===catKey&&(!glossSearch||g.term.toLowerCase().includes(glossSearch.toLowerCase())))" :key="g.term">
          <div class="gterm" :style="`border-left-color:${catColor}`">
            <h4 style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap">
              <span x-text="g.icon"></span>
              <span x-text="g.term" style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700"></span>
              <span class="badge" x-text="g.layer" style="font-size:13px"></span>
            </h4>
            <p x-text="g.purpose" style="margin-top:5px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text)"></p>
            <p x-text="g.desc" style="margin-top:3px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text2)"></p>
            <p style="margin-top:5px;font-size:14px;display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap">
              <span style="color:var(--text2)">범위: <b x-text="g.range"></b></span>
              <span :style="`color:${catColor}`">
                ★ 목표:
                <b x-text="
                  g.tKey==='tcr'  ? '≥ '+thresholds.tcr+'%' :
                  g.tKey==='acc'  ? '≥ '+thresholds.acc+'%' :
                  g.tKey==='hall' ? '≤ '+thresholds.hall+'%' :
                  g.tKey==='p95'  ? '≤ '+thresholds.p95+'s' :
                  g.tKey==='cost' ? '< $'+thresholds.cost.toFixed(3) :
                  g.target
                "></b>
              </span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </template>
      </div>
    </template>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ══ TASKS ══ -->
<div x-show="data && sec==='tasks'" x-cloak>
  <div class="sec">
    <div class="sec-t">📋 전체 태스크 <span class="badge" x-text="data.total_tasks+'건'"></span></div>
    <!-- Filter bar -->
    <div class="fbar">
      <label>Type</label>
      <select x-model="taskFilter.type" @change="applyTaskFilter()" style="max-width:140px">
        <option value="all">전체</option>
        <template x-for="tp in taskTypes()" :key="tp"><option :value="tp" x-text="tp"></option></template>
      </select>
      <label>상태</label>
      <select x-model="taskFilter.status" @change="applyTaskFilter()" style="max-width:110px">
        <option value="all">전체</option>
        <option value="success">성공</option>
        <option value="fail">실패</option>
      </select>
      <label>정렬</label>
      <select x-model="taskFilter.sort" @change="applyTaskFilter()" style="max-width:140px">
        <option value="task_id">Task ID</option>
        <option value="accuracy_score">Accuracy ↓</option>
        <option value="execution_time">Latency ↓</option>
        <option value="completion_score">Completion ↓</option>
      </select>
      <button class="btn" @click="taskFilter={type:'all',status:'all',sort:'task_id'};applyTaskFilter()">초기화</button>
      <span style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2)" x-text="`${filteredTaskCount}건 표시`"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="tw"><div id="task-table"></div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ══ COMPARE ══ -->
<div x-show="sec==='compare'" x-cloak>
  <div class="sec">
    <div class="sec-t">⚖️ 파일 비교 <span class="badge" x-text="`${compareIds.length}개 선택`"></span></div>
    <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:10px">비교할 파일을 선택하세요 (최대 5개)</p>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:14px">
      <template x-for="f in files" :key="f.id">
        <label style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;cursor:pointer;font-size:14px;background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px" :style="compareIds.includes(f.id)?'border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent)':''">
          <input type="checkbox" :value="f.id" :checked="compareIds.includes(f.id)" @change="toggleCompare(f.id)" style="accent-color:var(--accent)">
          <span x-text="f.name.substring(0,28)"></span>
        </label>
      </template>
    </div>
    <button class="btn" @click="loadCompare()" :disabled="compareIds.length<2" style="margin-bottom:14px">📊 비교 실행</button>
    <div x-show="Object.keys(compareData).length>0">
      <div style="overflow-x:auto">
        <table class="cmp-tbl">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>지표</th>
              <template x-for="id in compareIds" :key="id">
                <th x-text="compareData[id]?.name?.substring(0,20)||id"></th>
              </template>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <template x-for="row in compareRows()" :key="row.key">
              <tr>
                <td x-text="row.label"></td>
                <template x-for="id in compareIds" :key="id">
                  <td x-text="row.fmt(compareData[id])" :style="row.best && compareData[id] ? (row.fmt(compareData[id])===row.best(compareIds.map(i=>compareData[i]).filter(Boolean)) ? 'color:var(--green);font-weight:700' : '') : ''"></td>
                </template>
              </tr>
            </template>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div x-show="compareIds.length<2 && Object.keys(compareData).length===0" class="empty" style="padding:20px">
      <p>파일을 2개 이상 선택 후 비교 실행 버튼을 누르세요</p>
    </div>
    <!-- Merge analysis -->
    <div x-show="Object.keys(compareData).length>=2" style="margin-top:12px">
      <div class="sec">
        <div class="sec-t">🔀 병합 통계 (선택된 파일 합산)</div>
        <div class="kpi-grid">
          <div class="kpi">
            <div class="kpi-lbl">평균 TCR</div>
            <div class="kpi-val" x-text="pct(mergedStats().tcr)"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="kpi">
            <div class="kpi-lbl">평균 Accuracy</div>
            <div class="kpi-val" x-text="pct(mergedStats().acc)"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="kpi">
            <div class="kpi-lbl">평균 Hallucination</div>
            <div class="kpi-val" x-text="pct(mergedStats().hall)"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="kpi">
            <div class="kpi-lbl">평균 Latency</div>
            <div class="kpi-val" x-text="sec_(mergedStats().lat)"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="kpi">
            <div class="kpi-lbl">총 Tasks</div>
            <div class="kpi-val" x-text="mergedStats().tasks"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="kpi">
            <div class="kpi-lbl">총 비용</div>
            <div class="kpi-val" x-text="cost(mergedStats().cost)"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Trend chart -->
      <div class="sec" style="margin-top:10px">
        <div class="sec-t">📈 지표 트렌드 (선택 파일 순서)</div>
        <div id="compare-trend-wrap" style="min-height:240px;position:relative">
          <div id="compare-trend-chart" style="width:100%"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ══ GOLDEN DATASET ══ -->
<div x-show="sec==='golden'" x-cloak>
  <div class="sec">
    <div class="sec-t">📝 Golden Dataset 관리</div>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
      <button class="btn" @click="loadGoldenList()">🔄 목록 새로고침</button>
      <button class="btn" @click="gdNewName='';gdShowCreate=true" style="color:var(--green);border-color:var(--green)">＋ 새 Dataset</button>
      <button class="btn" @click="gdAiPanel=!gdAiPanel;gdAiResult=null" style="color:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent)">📄 PDF → QA Dataset</button>
    </div>
    <!-- PDF → QA generation panel -->
    <div x-show="gdAiPanel" class="sec" style="border-color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:10px">
      <div class="sec-t">📄 PDF → QA Dataset 생성
        <span style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);font-weight:400;margin-left:8px">API 키 없이도 동작 (추출 모드) · API 키 입력 시 GPT 고품질 생성</span>
      </div>
      <!-- API key + model (AI mode only) -->
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-bottom:10px">
        <div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:4px">
            🔑 OpenAI API Key
            <span style="font-size:11px"> — 비워두면 규칙 기반 추출 모드로 동작</span>
          </div>
          <input type="password" class="gd-input" x-model="gdAiKey" placeholder="sk-... (선택사항)" style="width:100%;font-family:monospace">
        </div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:4px">모델 <span style="font-size:11px">(API 키 입력 시 적용)</span></div>
          <select class="gd-input" x-model="gdAiModel" style="width:100%" :disabled="!gdAiKey">
            <option value="gpt-5-nano">gpt-5-nano (빠름, 저렴)</option>
            <option value="gpt-4o-mini">gpt-4o-mini</option>
            <option value="gpt-4o">gpt-4o (고품질)</option>
            <option value="gpt-3.5-turbo">gpt-3.5-turbo</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <!-- AI-only options -->
        <div x-show="gdAiKey">
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:4px">청크당 질문 수 <span style="font-size:11px">(1–5)</span></div>
          <input type="number" class="gd-input" x-model.number="gdAiNumQ" min="1" max="5" style="width:100%">
        </div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:4px">
            <span x-text="gdAiKey ? '최대 청크 수 (API 호출 수 = 청크×질문)' : '생성할 QA 항목 수'"></span>
          </div>
          <input type="number" class="gd-input" x-model.number="gdAiMaxChunks" min="1" max="200" style="width:100%">
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Question types (AI mode only) -->
      <div x-show="gdAiKey" style="margin-bottom:10px">
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:6px">질문 유형</div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
          <template x-for="qt in ['factual','reasoning','summary']" :key="qt">
            <label style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer">
              <input type="checkbox" :value="qt" :checked="gdAiQTypes.includes(qt)"
                @change="gdAiQTypes.includes(qt) ? gdAiQTypes=gdAiQTypes.filter(t=>t!==qt) : gdAiQTypes=[...gdAiQTypes,qt]">
              <span x-text="qt==='factual'?'📌 Factual (사실 기반)':qt==='reasoning'?'🧠 Reasoning (추론)':'📋 Summary (요약)'"></span>
            </label>
          </template>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
        <label class="btn" style="cursor:pointer;color:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);flex:1;justify-content:center;text-align:center" :style="gdAiUploading?'opacity:.6;pointer-events:none':''">
          <span x-show="!gdAiUploading" x-text="gdAiKey ? '📂 PDF 선택 후 AI 생성 시작' : '📂 PDF 선택 후 추출 시작'"></span>
          <span x-show="gdAiUploading" x-text="gdAiKey ? '⏳ AI QA 생성 중... (최대 수 분 소요)' : '⏳ 텍스트 추출 중...'"></span>
          <input type="file" accept=".pdf" style="display:none" @change="generatePdfQA($event)" :disabled="gdAiUploading">
        </label>
        <button class="btn" @click="gdAiPanel=false;gdAiResult=null" style="flex-shrink:0">닫기</button>
      </div>
      <div x-show="gdAiUploading && gdAiKey" style="margin-top:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text2)">
        💡 청크 수 × 질문 수만큼 OpenAI API를 호출합니다. 최대 청크 수를 줄이면 빠르게 완료됩니다.
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- QA generation result preview -->
    <div x-show="gdAiResult" class="sec" style="border-color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:10px">
      <div class="sec-t">📄 생성 결과
        <span class="badge" x-text="`${gdAiResult?.item_count||0}개 항목`"></span>
        <span class="badge" x-show="gdAiResult?.model" x-text="gdAiResult?.model"></span>
        <span class="badge" x-show="!gdAiResult?.model">추출 모드</span>
      </div>
      <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:8px" x-text="`파일: ${gdAiResult?.filename||''} · ${(gdAiResult?.total_chars||0).toLocaleString()} 문자`"></div>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
        <input class="gd-input" x-model="gdAiSaveName" placeholder="dataset_from_pdf" style="flex:1">
        <button class="btn" style="color:var(--green);border-color:var(--green)" @click="saveAiResult()">💾 Dataset으로 저장</button>
        <button class="btn" @click="gdAiResult=null">✕</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- Create form -->
    <div x-show="gdShowCreate" class="sec" style="border-color:var(--accent)">
      <div class="sec-t">새 Golden Dataset 생성</div>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px;align-items:center">
        <label style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);white-space:nowrap">파일명</label>
        <input class="gd-input" x-model="gdNewName" placeholder="my_golden_dataset" style="flex:1">
        <button class="btn" @click="createGolden()" :disabled="!gdNewName">저장</button>
        <button class="btn" @click="gdShowCreate=false">취소</button>
      </div>
      <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2)">빈 dataset이 생성됩니다. 생성 후 항목을 추가하세요.</div>
    </div>
    <!-- File list -->
    <div x-show="!gdFiles.length" class="empty es"><p>Golden Dataset 없음 — golden_datasets/ 디렉토리에 JSON 파일을 추가하세요.</p></div>
    <template x-for="f in gdFiles" :key="f.name">
      <div class="sec" style="margin-bottom:8px">
        <div class="sec-t" style="margin-bottom:8px">
          <span x-text="f.name"></span>
          <span class="badge" x-text="`${f.count}건`"></span>
          <span class="badge" x-text="`${(f.size_bytes/1024).toFixed(1)}KB`"></span>
          <button class="btn" style="margin-left:auto" @click="loadGoldenFile(f.stem)">📂 편집</button>
        </div>
        <div x-show="gdSelected===f.stem">
          <div style="margin-bottom:8px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
            <span style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2)" x-text="`${(gdItems[f.stem]||[]).length}개 항목`"></span>
            <button class="btn" style="color:var(--green);border-color:var(--green)" @click="addGoldenItem(f.stem)">＋ 항목 추가</button>
            <button class="btn" @click="saveGolden(f.stem)">💾 저장</button>
          </div>
          <template x-for="(item,idx) in (gdItems[f.stem]||[])" :key="idx">
            <div style="background:var(--bg3);border-radius:8px;padding:10px;margin-bottom:6px">
              <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:6px">
                <span style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2)" x-text="`#${idx+1}`"></span>
                <button class="btn" style="color:var(--red);border-color:var(--red);padding:2px 7px;font-size:14px" @click="removeGoldenItem(f.stem,idx)">✕</button>
              </div>
              <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px">
                <div>
                  <div style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:3px">질문 (Question)</div>
                  <textarea class="gd-input" x-model="gdItems[f.stem][idx].question" placeholder="질문을 입력하세요"></textarea>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <div style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:3px">정답 (Ground Truth)</div>
                  <textarea class="gd-input" x-model="gdItems[f.stem][idx].ground_truth" placeholder="정답을 입력하세요"></textarea>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div style="margin-top:6px">
                <div style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:3px">컨텍스트 (Context, 선택사항)</div>
                <input class="gd-input" x-model="gdItems[f.stem][idx].context" placeholder="RAG 컨텍스트 (선택사항)">
              </div>
            </div>
          </template>
        </div>
      </div>
    </template>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ══ EXPORT ══ -->
<div x-show="data && sec==='export'" x-cloak>
  <div class="sec">
    <div class="sec-t">📦 내보내기</div>

    <!-- 포맷 카드 -->
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:10px;margin-bottom:20px">

      <!-- JSON -->
      <div class="cbox" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px">
        <div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600">📄 JSON</div>
        <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);flex:1">
          전체 평가 결과 원본 데이터.<br>
          모든 집계 지표(TCR·Accuracy·Latency·Token·Agentic·Security·RAG 등)와 태스크 배열을 포함한 완전한 구조.<br>
          <span style="color:var(--accent)">대시보드 재로드·SDK 재분석·버전 비교에 사용.</span>
        </div>
        <a :href="`/api/export/json/${selId}`" class="btn" style="text-align:center">⬇️ 다운로드</a>
      </div>

      <!-- CSV -->
      <div class="cbox" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px">
        <div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600">📊 CSV</div>
        <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);flex:1">
          태스크 단위 플랫 테이블.<br>
          컬럼: task_id · task_type · success · completion_score · accuracy_score · execution_time · tokens_total · attempts · errors<br>
          <span style="color:var(--accent)">Excel·pandas·BI 툴에서 즉시 분석 가능.</span>
        </div>
        <a :href="`/api/export/csv/${selId}`" class="btn" style="text-align:center">⬇️ 다운로드</a>
      </div>

      <!-- HTML 리포트 -->
      <div class="cbox" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px">
        <div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600">🌐 HTML 리포트</div>
        <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);flex:1">
          독립 실행형 경량 리포트.<br>
          KPI 카드(TCR·Accuracy·Hallucination·Latency·Cost·Tokens)·성공/실패 도넛 차트·태스크 목록 테이블 포함.<br>
          <span style="color:var(--accent)">외부 공유·이메일 첨부·오프라인 열람에 최적.</span>
        </div>
        <a :href="`/api/export/html/${selId}`" class="btn" style="text-align:center">⬇️ 다운로드</a>
